в","ИИ инструменты для разработчиков","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","Поддержка CLI"],"ar":["مهارات مفيدة ل Claude Code","تحسين إنتاجية المطورين","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","التكامل مع React، Python و Node.js","دعم CLI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用op","什么是op","op替代品","op vs Claude Code","op安装","op设置指南","AI智能工具","Claude Code开发"],"ja":["opの使い方","opとは","opの代替","op vs Claude Code","opのインストール","opの設定ガイド","AIエージェント","Claude Code開発"],"ko":["op 사용법","op이란","op 대체제","op vs Claude Code","op 설치","op 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트","Claude Code 개발"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de agente de inteligencia artificial","qué es un agente de inteligencia artificial","alternativas a Claude Code","Claude Code vs otros agentes","instalación de herramientas de agente de inteligencia artificial","guía de configuración de KI-Tools"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils d''agent d''intelligence artificielle","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''intelligence artificielle","alternatives à Claude Code","Claude Code vs autres agents","installation d''outils d''agent d''intelligence artificielle","guide de configuration d''outils d''IA"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternativen zu Claude Code","Claude Code vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von KI-Tools","Einrichtungsanleitung für KI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar op","o que é op","op alternative","op vs Claude Code","instalar op","guia de configuração do op","desenvolvimento de IA","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать op","что такое op","оп альтернатива","оп vs Claude Code","установить оп","руководство по настройке оп","разработка ИИ","ИИ инструменты для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام op","ما هي op","بديل op","op مقابل Claude Code","تثبيت op","دليل إعداد op","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"underwear","repo":"claude-code-underwear-skills","repoPath":"underwear/claude-code-underwear-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.948Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"op","description":"Manage 1Password secrets. Use when user wants to list, get, or read passwords, OTP codes, API keys, or other secrets from 1Password.","bodyPreview":"# 1Password CLI (`op`)\n\nManage secrets in 1Password using the `op` command. Authenticated via service account.\n\n## User Request\n\n$ARGUMENTS\n\n## Commands Reference\n\n**Important:** Service accounts require `--vault` on every command. Before running any item commands, discover the available vault name first:\n\n```bash\nop vault list --format=json\n```\n\nThen use the vault name from the response in all subsequent commands.\n\n### List Items\n\n```bash\n# List all items in vault\nop item list --vault \"VAULT_NA","body":"# 1Password CLI (`op`)\n\nManage secrets in 1Password using the `op` command. Authenticated via service account.\n\n## User Request\n\n$ARGUMENTS\n\n## Commands Reference\n\n**Important:** Service accounts require `--vault` on every command. Before running any item commands, discover the available vault name first:\n\n```bash\nop vault list --format=json\n```\n\nThen use the vault name from the response in all subsequent commands.\n\n### List Items\n\n```bash\n# List all items in vault\nop item list --vault \"VAULT_NAME\" --format=json\n\n# Long format (with categories, dates)\nop item list --vault \"VAULT_NAME\" --long --format=json\n\n# Filter by category\nop item list --vault \"VAULT_NAME\" --categories Login --format=json\nop item list --vault \"VAULT_NAME\" --categories \"API Credential\" --format=json\n\n# Filter by tags\nop item list --vault \"VAULT_NAME\" --tags production --format=json\n\n# Filter favorites only\nop item list --vault \"VAULT_NAME\" --favorite --format=json\n```\n\n### Get Item Details\n\n```bash\n# Full item details\nop item get \"Item Title\" --vault \"VAULT_NAME\" --format=json\n\n# Get OTP (one-time password / 2FA code)\nop item get \"Item Title\" --vault \"VAULT_NAME\" --otp\n\n# Get specific fields\nop item get \"Item Title\" --vault \"VAULT_NAME\" --fields label=username --format=json\nop item get \"Item Title\" --vault \"VAULT_NAME\" --fields label=password --format=json\nop item get \"Item Title\" --vault \"VAULT_NAME\" --fields label=username,label=password --format=json\n\n# Get fields by type\nop item get \"Item Title\" --vault \"VAULT_NAME\" --fields type=CONCEALED --format=json\n```\n\n### Read Individual Secret\n\n```bash\n# Read a specific field value directly\nop read \"op://VAULT_NAME/Item Title/username\"\nop read \"op://VAULT_NAME/Item Title/password\"\nop read \"op://VAULT_NAME/Item Title/Section Name/field\"\n```\n\n### List Vaults\n\n```bash\nop vault list --format=json\n```\n\n## JSON Response Structures\n\n**`op vault list --format=json`:**\n```json\n[\n  {\"id\": \"abc123...\", \"name\": \"My Vault\", \"content_version\": 42}\n]\n```\n\n**`op item list --format=json`:**\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"abc123...\",\n    \"title\": \"Example Service\",\n    \"version\": 1,\n    \"vault\": {\"id\": \"xyz...\", \"name\": \"My Vault\"},\n    \"category\": \"LOGIN\",\n    \"last_edited_by\": \"...\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\n    \"updated_at\": \"2025-01-02T00:00:00Z\",\n    \"additional_information\": \"user@example.com\",\n    \"urls\": [{\"primary\": true, \"href\": \"https://example.com\"}]\n  }\n]\n```\n\n**`op item get --format=json`:**\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"abc123...\",\n  \"title\": \"Example Service\",\n  \"category\": \"LOGIN\",\n  \"vault\": {\"id\": \"xyz...\", \"name\": \"My Vault\"},\n  \"fields\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"username\",\n      \"type\": \"STRING\",\n      \"purpose\": \"USERNAME\",\n      \"label\": \"email\",\n      \"value\": \"user@example.com\",\n      \"reference\": \"op://My Vault/Example Service/email\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"password\",\n      \"type\": \"CONCEALED\",\n      \"purpose\": \"PASSWORD\",\n      \"label\": \"password\",\n      \"value\": \"secret_value\",\n      \"reference\": \"op://My Vault/Example Service/password\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"TOTP_xxx\",\n      \"type\": \"OTP\",\n      \"label\": \"one-time password\",\n      \"value\": \"otpauth://totp/...\",\n      \"totp\": \"123456\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"urls\": [{\"primary\": true, \"href\": \"https://example.com\"}]\n}\n```\n\n**`op item get --otp`:**\nReturns just the 6-digit TOTP code as plain text (e.g., `182448`).\n\n**`op item get --fields --format=json`:**\n```json\n[\n  {\"id\": \"username\", \"type\": \"STRING\", \"label\": \"email\", \"value\": \"user@example.com\"},\n  {\"id\": \"password\", \"type\": \"CONCEALED\", \"label\": \"password\", \"value\": \"secret_value\"}\n]\n```\n\n## Important Notes\n\n- **Service account requires `--vault`** — always discover vault name via `op vault list` first, then use it in all commands\n- **`--otp` returns plain text** — do not combine with `--format=json`\n- **OTP field in JSON** — when getting full item, the current TOTP code is in the `totp` key of OTP-type fields\n- **Categories:** Login, Password, API Credential, Secure Note, Database, SSH Key, Credit Card, Identity, Document, Server, Software License\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Parse the user''s natural language request to determine what they need\n2. **First, run `op vault list --format=json`** to discover the available vault name(s)\n3. Determine the appropriate `op` command, using the discovered vault name\n4. **Always use `--format=json`** except for `--otp` (which returns plain text)\n5. Execute the command via Bash\n6. Parse the JSON response and present results clearly to the user\n7. For OTP requests, just return the code prominently\n8. For credential requests, format as a clear key-value list\n9. **Never log or echo secrets unnecessarily** — only show what was requested\n\nIf the request is ambiguous, ask for clarification.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:11:20.631Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Security Agents needing seamless secret management via 1Password CLI","zh":"适合需要通过 1Password CLI 实现无缝密钥管理的安全代理","ja":"1Password CLI を使用したシームレスなシークレット管理が必要なセキュリティ エージェントに適しています","ko":"1Password CLI를 통해 무결점 비밀 관리가 필요한 보안 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Seguridad que necesitan una gestión de secretos sin problemas a través de 1Password CLI","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Sécurité ayant besoin d''une gestion de secrets sans faille via 1Password CLI","de":"Perfekt für Sicherheitsagenten, die eine nahtlose Verwaltung von Geheimnissen über 1Password CLI benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Segurança que necessitam de gerenciamento de segredos sem interrupção via 1Password CLI","ru":"Идеально для агентов безопасности, которым необходим бесшовное управление секретами через 1Password CLI","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الأمن الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة سرية بدون انقطاع عبر 1Password CLI"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage secrets in 1Password using the `op` command, authenticated via service account, and leveraging JSON-formatted vault lists and item commands with `--vault` specification","zh":"赋予代理通过 `op` 命令、使用服务账号进行身份验证并利用 JSON 格式的保管库列表和带有 `--vault` 指定的项目命令来管理 1Password 中的密钥的能力","ja":"`op` コマンド、サービス アカウントでの認証、JSON 形式の保管庫リストおよび `--vault` 指定のアイテム コマンドを利用して、1Password 内のシークレットを管理するエージェントの能力を強化します","ko":"`op` 명령, 서비스 계정으로 인증, JSON 형식의 금고 목록 및 `--vault` 지정된 항목 명령을 사용하여 1Password의 비밀을 관리할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 강화합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar secretos en 1Password utilizando el comando `op`, autenticados a través de una cuenta de servicio, y aprovechando listas de vault y comandos de elementos con formato JSON con especificación `--vault`","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les secrets dans 1Password en utilisant la commande `op`, authentifiés via un compte de service, et en exploitant des listes de vault et des commandes d''éléments au format JSON avec spécification `--vault`","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Geheimnisse in 1Password mithilfe des `op`-Befehls zu verwalten, der über ein Dienstkonto authentifiziert wird und JSON-formatierte Vault-Listen und Elementbefehle mit `--vault`-Spezifikation nutzt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar segredos no 1Password usando o comando `op`, autenticado via conta de serviço, e aproveitando listas de cofres e comandos de itens formatados em JSON com especificação `--vault`","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять секретами в 1Password с помощью команды `op`, аутентифицированной через учетную запись службы, и использует списки хранилищ и команды элементов в формате JSON с указанием `--vault`","ar":"يُمكن الوكلاء من إدارة السرية في 1Password باستخدام الأمر `op` ، والمصادق عليه من خلال حساب الخدمة ، وتستفيد من قوائم الخزائن والأوامر المformatة بالجسون مع تحديد `--vault`"},"useCases":{"en":["Listing all items in a specified vault","Discovering available vault names for subsequent commands","Authenticating via service account for secure secret access"],"zh":["列出指定保管库中的所有项目","发现可用于后续命令的保管库名称","通过服务账号进行身份验证以实现安全的密钥访问"],"ja":["指定された保管庫内のすべてのアイテムを列挙する","後続のコマンドで使用可能な保管庫名を発見する","サービス アカウントを使用して安全なシークレット アクセスを実現するための認証"],"ko":["지정된 금고中的 모든 항목을 나열","추가 명령에서 사용 가능한 금고 이름을 발견","서비스 계정을 사용하여 보안 비밀 접근을 위한 인증"],"es":["Listar todos los elementos en un vault especificado","Descubrir los nombres de vault disponibles para comandos posteriores","Autenticarse a través de una cuenta de servicio para un acceso seguro a secretos"],"fr":["Lister tous les éléments dans un vault spécifié","Découvrir les noms de vault disponibles pour les commandes ultérieures","S''authentifier via un compte de service pour un accès sécurisé aux secrets"],"de":["Auflisten aller Elemente in einem angegebenen Vault","Verfügbare Vault-Namen für nachfolgende Befehle erkennen","Authentifizierung über ein Dienstkonto für sicheren Zugriff auf Geheimnisse"],"pt":["Listar todos os itens em um cofre especificado","Descobrir nomes de cofres disponíveis para comandos subsequentes","Autenticar via conta de serviço para acesso seguro a segredos"],"ru":["Перечислить все элементы в указанном хранилище","Определить доступные имена хранилищ для последующих команд","Аутентифицироваться через учетную запись службы для безопасного доступа к секретам"],"ar":["قائمة جميع العناصر في خزنة محددة","اكتشاف أسماء الخزائن المتاحة للأوامر اللاحقة","التحقق من خلال حساب الخدمة للوصول الآمن إلى السرية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires service account authentication","Needs `--vault` specification on every command","Dependent on 1Password CLI installation and configuration"],"zh":["需要服务账号身份验证","需要在每个命令中指定 `--vault`","依赖于 1Password CLI 的安装和配置"],"ja":["サービス アカウントでの認証が必要","各コマンドで `--vault` の指定が必要","1Password CLI のインストールおよび構成に依存する"],"ko":["서비스 계정 인증이 필요","각 명령에서 `--vault` 지정이 필요","1Password CLI 설치 및 구성에 의존"],"es":["Requiere autenticación por cuenta de servicio","Necesita especificación `--vault` en cada comando","Depende de la instalación y configuración de 1Password CLI"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification par compte de service","Nécessite une spécification `--vault` pour chaque commande","Dépend de l''installation et de la configuration de 1Password CLI"],"de":["Benötigt Authentifizierung über ein Dienstkonto","Benötigt `--vault`-Spezifikation bei jedem Befehl","Hängt von der Installation und Konfiguration von 1Password CLI ab"],"pt":["Exige autenticação por conta de serviço","Necessita de especificação `--vault` em cada comando","Depende da instalação e configuração do 1Password CLI"],"ru":["Требует аутентификации через учетную запись службы","Требует указания `--vault` для каждого команды","Зависит от установки и конфигурации 1Password CLI"],"ar":["يتطلب مصادقة عبر حساب الخدمة","يحتاج إلى تحديد `--vault` في كل أمر","يعتمد على تثبيت وتكوين 1Password CLI"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a6d6f8ca5b003a00a1585e32e7b97e5a437d37f1d0542334867e3ae0f89a09b8","qualityScore":49}');
