e Forms LITE","outils d''IA pour le développement","Formidable Forms LITE alternative","Formidable Forms LITE vs autres plugins","installation de Formidable Forms LITE","guide de configuration de Formidable Forms LITE"],"de":["wie man Formidable Forms LITE verwendet","KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","Formidable Forms LITE Alternative","Formidable Forms LITE vs andere Plugins","Installation von Formidable Forms LITE","Konfigurationsanleitung für Formidable Forms LITE"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","corrigir erros","Formidable Forms LITE","desenvolvimento de plugins","otimização de código","como usar ferramentas de IA","alternativas para Formidable Forms LITE","guia de instalação do Formidable Forms LITE"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","исправить ошибки","Formidable Forms LITE","разработка плагинов","оптимизация кода","как использовать ИИ агенты","алтернативы для Formidable Forms LITE","руководство по установке Formidable Forms LITE"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تصحيح الأخطاء","Formidable Forms LITE","تطوير البرامج المساعدة","تحسين الكود","كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديلات لبرنامج Formidable Forms LITE","دليل تثبيت Formidable Forms LITE"]}},"owner":"Strategy11","repo":"formidable-forms","repoPath":"Strategy11/formidable-forms","stars":60,"forks":39,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T18:19:36Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fix-bug","description":"Bug-fixing workflow for Formidable Forms. Use when fixing bugs, debugging unexpected behavior, investigating error logs, or resolving compatibility issues.","bodyPreview":"# Fix Bug\n\nStructured bug-fixing workflow for the Formidable Forms plugin ecosystem, following WordPress, Formidable Forms, and WordPress VIP coding standards.\n\nThis skill builds on the always-on rules in `.windsurf/rules/enterprise/` which define core principles, code change phases, writing style, and commit message format. Those rules apply automatically to every conversation. This skill extends them with bug-fix-specific steps.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Fixing reported bugs\n- Debugging unexpected be","body":"# Fix Bug\n\nStructured bug-fixing workflow for the Formidable Forms plugin ecosystem, following WordPress, Formidable Forms, and WordPress VIP coding standards.\n\nThis skill builds on the always-on rules in `.windsurf/rules/enterprise/` which define core principles, code change phases, writing style, and commit message format. Those rules apply automatically to every conversation. This skill extends them with bug-fix-specific steps.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Fixing reported bugs\n- Debugging unexpected behavior\n- Investigating error logs\n- Resolving compatibility issues\n\n---\n\n## Coding Standards\n\nBefore writing or modifying ANY code, read and follow the applicable rules from `.windsurf/rules/`:\n\n| File type                | Rules to read                                                                                                        |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `*.php`                  | `formidable/frm-php.md`, `wordpress/php.md`, `wordpress-vip/wpvip-security.md`, `wordpress-vip/wpvip-performance.md` |\n| `*.js`, `*.jsx`, `*.mjs` | `formidable/frm-javascript.md`, `wordpress/javascript.md`, `wordpress-vip/wpvip-security.md`                         |\n| `*.css`, `*.scss`        | `formidable/frm-css.md`                                                                                              |\n| `*.html`                 | `wordpress/html.md`                                                                                                  |\n| Block editor code        | `wordpress/block-editor.md`, `wordpress-vip/wpvip-block-editor.md`                                                   |\n| UI/forms/user-facing     | `wordpress/accessibility.md`                                                                                         |\n| Tests                    | `formidable/testing.md`                                                                                              |\n\n**How to apply:**\n\n1. Before implementing, read ALL rules that match the file types you will modify\n2. Follow every rule when writing new code or modifying existing code\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\nThe always-on rule `enterprise/code-change-principles.md` defines the core phases: Understand, Locate, Research, Select Solution, Implement, and Verify. The steps below are **additional** bug-fix-specific requirements.\n\n### Phase 4: Design\n\n- Document proposed solutions using [solution-template.md](solution-template.md)\n\n### Phase 6: Verify\n\n- Run through [checklist.md](checklist.md)\n\n### Phase 7: Report\n\nOutput a single concise report following [report-template.md](report-template.md).\n\nThe report contains all deliverables:\n\n```markdown\nReport\n├── Root Cause → Fix (1 sentence each)\n├── Files Changed (file path + what changed)\n├── PR Info\n│ ├── Branch (fix/{issue}-{slug})\n│ ├── PR Title (human-readable, NOT conventional commit format)\n│ ├── PR Body (Fixes URL + description + test steps)\n│ └── Commit Msg (conventional commit, NO issue number)\n└── Manual Test Steps (numbered reproduction/verification)\n```\n\nSee [pr-template.md](pr-template.md) for PR title, PR body, and commit message formatting rules.\n\n---\n\n## Supporting Resources\n\n- [checklist.md](checklist.md): Verification checklist\n- [solution-template.md](solution-template.md): Solution comparison template\n- [report-template.md](report-template.md): Completion report template\n- [pr-template.md](pr-template.md): Branch name, PR title, and PR body template\n\n## Invocation\n\nCascade automatically invokes this skill when your request matches bug-fixing tasks.\n\nTo manually invoke:\n\n```text\n@fix-bug\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T13:15:26.570Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for WordPress-focused AI Agents requiring structured bug-fixing workflows for the Formidable Forms plugin ecosystem","zh":"适用于需要结构化的bug修复工作流的WordPress专注的AI代理，特别是针对Formidable Forms插件生态系统","ja":"WordPressに焦点を当てたAIエージェントに最適であり、Formidable Formsプラグインのエコシステム向けに構造化されたバグ修正ワークフローを必要とする","ko":"워드프레스에 초점을 맞춘 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며, Formidable Forms 플러그인 에코システム을 위한 구조화된 버그 수정 워크플로가 필요한 경우","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial enfocados en WordPress que requieren flujos de trabajo de corrección de errores estructurados para el ecosistema de plugins de Formidable Forms","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle axés sur WordPress nécessitant des flux de travail de correction de bogues structurés pour l''écosystème de plugins Formidable Forms","de":"Ideal für WordPress-fokussierte KI-Agents, die strukturierte Fehlerbehebungs-Workflows für das Formidable Forms-Plugin-Ökosystem benötigen","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA focados em WordPress que exigem fluxos de trabalho de correção de bugs estruturados para o ecossistema do plugin Formidable Forms","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на WordPress, требующих структурированных рабочих процессов исправления ошибок для экосистемы плагина Formidable Forms","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يركز على ووردبريس والذي يتطلب سير عمل تصحيح الأخطاء المنظمة لنظام إيكوسيستم Plugin Formidable Forms"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to follow WordPress, Formidable Forms, and WordPress VIP coding standards, utilizing always-on rules in `.windsurf/rules/enterprise/` for core principles, code change phases, writing style, and commit message format, ensuring seamless bug-fixing experiences with Formidable Forms LITE Plugin","zh":"赋予代理遵循WordPress、Formidable Forms和WordPress VIP编码标准的能力，利用`.windsurf/rules/enterprise/`中的始终打开的规则来遵循核心原则、代码更改阶段、编写风格和提交消息格式，确保与Formidable Forms LITE插件实现无缝的bug修复体验","ja":"エージェントがWordPress、Formidable Forms、WordPress VIPのコーディング規約に従う能力を付与し、`.windsurf/rules/enterprise/`にある常にオンのルールを使用してコア原則、コード変更の段階、書き込みスタイル、コミットメッセージ形式に従い、Formidable Forms LITEプラグインとのシームレスなバグ修正体験を保証する","ko":"에이전트가 워드프레스, Formidable Forms, 워드프레스 VIP 코딩 표준을 따를 수 있는 능력을 부여하고, `.windsurf/rules/enterprise/`에 있는 항상 켜져 있는 규칙을 사용하여 핵심 원칙, 코드 변경 단계, 작성 스타일 및 커밋 메시지 형식을 따르며, Formidable Forms LITE 플러그인과 함께無縫한 버그 수정 경험을 보장한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a seguir los estándares de codificación de WordPress, Formidable Forms y WordPress VIP, utilizando reglas siempre activas en `.windsurf/rules/enterprise/` para principios básicos, fases de cambio de código, estilo de escritura y formato de mensaje de confirmación, garantizando experiencias de corrección de errores sin problemas con el plugin Formidable Forms LITE","fr":"Permet aux agents de suivre les normes de codage WordPress, Formidable Forms et WordPress VIP, en utilisant des règles toujours activées dans `.windsurf/rules/enterprise/` pour les principes de base, les phases de modification de code, le style d''écriture et le format de message de commit, garantissant des expériences de correction de bogues sans problème avec le plugin Formidable Forms LITE","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, WordPress-, Formidable Forms- und WordPress-VIP-Codierungsstandards zu befolgen, indem immer aktive Regeln in `.windsurf/rules/enterprise/` für Kernprinzipien, Code-Änderungsphasen, Schreibstil und Commit-Nachrichtenformat verwendet werden, um nahtlose Fehlersuche-Erfahrungen mit dem Formidable Forms LITE-Plugin sicherzustellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a seguir os padrões de codificação do WordPress, Formidable Forms e WordPress VIP, utilizando regras sempre ativadas em `.windsurf/rules/enterprise/` para princípios básicos, fases de alteração de código, estilo de escrita e formato de mensagem de commit, garantindo experiências de correção de bugs sem interrupções com o Plugin Formidable Forms LITE","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью следовать стандартам кодирования WordPress, Formidable Forms и WordPress VIP, используя всегда включенные правила в `.windsurf/rules/enterprise/` для основных принципов, фаз изменений кода, стиля написания и формата сообщения о коммите, обеспечивая бесперебойный опыт исправления ошибок с плагином Formidable Forms LITE","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على اتباع معايير الترميز الخاصة بـ ووردبريس و Formidable Forms و ووردبريس VIP ، باستخدام القواعد المفعلة دائمًا في `.windsurf/rules/enterprise/` للمبادئ الأساسية وأطوار تغيير الشفرة وأسلوب الكتابة وتنسيق رسالة Commit ، ضامنًا تجارب تصحيح الأخطاء دون انقطاع مع Plugin Formidable Forms LITE"},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging unexpected behavior in Formidable Forms","Fixing reported bugs in WordPress environments","Implementing structured bug-fixing workflows for enterprise-level WordPress projects"],"zh":["调试Formidable Forms中的意外行为","修复WordPress环境中的已报告的bug","为企业级WordPress项目实现结构化的bug修复工作流"],"ja":["Formidable Formsの中の予期しない動作をデバッグする","WordPress環境の中の報告されたバグを修正する","企業レベルのWordPressプロジェクト向けに構造化されたバグ修正ワークフローを実装する"],"ko":["Formidable Forms에서 예상치 못한 동작을 디버깅하는 것","워드프레스 환경에서 보고된 버그를 수정하는 것","기업 수준의 워드프레스 프로젝트를 위한 구조화된 버그 수정 워크플로를 구현하는 것"],"es":["Depuración de comportamiento inesperado en Formidable Forms","Corrección de errores informados en entornos de WordPress","Implementación de flujos de trabajo de corrección de errores estructurados para proyectos de WordPress de nivel empresarial"],"fr":["Débogage d''un comportement inattendu dans Formidable Forms","Correction de bogues signalés dans des environnements WordPress","Mise en œuvre de flux de travail de correction de bogues structurés pour des projets WordPress de niveau entreprise"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei unerwartetem Verhalten in Formidable Forms","Behebung von gemeldeten Fehlern in WordPress-Umgebungen","Implementierung von strukturierten Fehlersuche-Workflows für WordPress-Projekte auf Unternehmensebene"],"pt":["Depuração de comportamento inesperado no Formidable Forms","Correção de bugs relatados em ambientes do WordPress","Implementação de fluxos de trabalho de correção de bugs estruturados para projetos de nível empresarial do WordPress"],"ru":["Отладка неожиданного поведения в Formidable Forms","Исправление сообщенных ошибок в средах WordPress","Реализация структурированных рабочих процессов исправления ошибок для проектов WordPress уровня предприятия"],"ar":["تصحيح السلوك غير المتوقع في Formidable Forms","تصحيح الأخطاء المبلغ عنها في بيئات ووردبريس","تنفيذ سير عمل تصحيح الأخطاء المنظمة لمشاريع ووردبريس من مستوى المؤسسة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires WordPress and Formidable Forms plugin ecosystem","Must adhere to WordPress, Formidable Forms, and WordPress VIP coding standards"],"zh":["需要WordPress和Formidable Forms插件生态系统","必须遵循WordPress、Formidable Forms和WordPress VIP编码标准"],"ja":["WordPressとFormidable Formsプラグインのエコシステムを必要とする","WordPress、Formidable Forms、WordPress VIPのコーディング規約に従わなければならない"],"ko":["워드프레스와 Formidable Forms 플러그인 에코システム이 필요함","워드프레스, Formidable Forms, 워드프레스 VIP 코딩 표준을 따라야 함"],"es":["Requiere WordPress y el ecosistema de plugins de Formidable Forms","Debe adherirse a los estándares de codificación de WordPress, Formidable Forms y WordPress VIP"],"fr":["Nécessite WordPress et l''écosystème de plugins Formidable Forms","Doit se conformer aux normes de codage WordPress, Formidable Forms et WordPress VIP"],"de":["Benötigt WordPress und das Formidable Forms-Plugin-Ökosystem","Muss den Codierungsstandards von WordPress, Formidable Forms und WordPress VIP entsprechen"],"pt":["Exige WordPress e ecossistema do plugin Formidable Forms","Deve aderir aos padrões de codificação do WordPress, Formidable Forms e WordPress VIP"],"ru":["Требует WordPress и экосистемы плагина Formidable Forms","Должно соответствовать стандартам кодирования WordPress, Formidable Forms и WordPress VIP"],"ar":["يتطلب ووردبريس ونظام إيكوسيستم Plugin Formidable Forms","يجب الامتثال لمعايير الترميز الخاصة بـ ووردبريس و Formidable Forms و ووردبريس VIP"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"47139e8218c39a42e5c445d4cdc9ea3bc651f45451ebc33e47a8fdc0b90443e9","qualityScore":48}');
