gne de commande similaire à Vercel CLI","Déploiement sur le cloud Alibaba","Processus de déploiement automatisé","Compatible avec les environnements de production"],"de":["Implementiert in TypeScript und Bun","Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle ähnlich wie Vercel CLI","Bereitstellung in der Alibaba-Cloud","Automatisierter Bereitstellungsprozess","Kompatibel mit Produktionsumgebungen"],"pt":["Implementado em TypeScript + Bun","Fluxo de trabalho de um clique para implantação na nuvem","Semelhante ao Vercel CLI","Adequado para ambientes de produção","Simplifica a implantação na nuvem"],"ru":["Реализован на TypeScript + Bun","Однократный рабочий процесс для развертывания в облаке","Аналогичен Vercel CLI","Подходит для производственных сред","Упрощает развертывание в облаке"],"ar":["مبني على TypeScript + Bun","عملية عمل واحدة لنشر السحابي","مشابه لـ Vercel CLI","ملائم للبيئات الإنتاجية","يبسط عملية النشر السحابي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["阿里云Redis部署","TypeScript + Bun","一键化部署","Vercel CLI","生产环境部署","Redis自动化部署","阿里云Redis一键化部署CLI工具","如何使用阿里云Redis","阿里云Redis vs Vercel CLI"],"ja":["AIエージェント","阿里云Redisの部署","Vercel CLI","TypeScript + Bun","一键化部署","生産環境で使用可能","Redisの自動化部署","AIエージェント：阿里云Redis","阿里云Redisの使い方","Vercel CLIと阿里云Redisの比較"],"ko":["알리云 Redis 자동화 배포","TypeScript + Bun","일키자 배포","Vercel CLI","생산 환경에서 사용 가능","Redis 자동화 배포","알리云 Redis 자동화 배포 CLI 도구","알리云 Redis 사용법","Vercel CLI와 알리云 Redis 비교"],"es":["herramientas de Inteligencia Artificial","alicloud-redis","despliegue en la nube","Vercel CLI","TypeScript","Bun","cómo usar alicloud-redis","alternativas a Vercel CLI"],"fr":["outils d''Intelligence Artificielle","alicloud-redis","déploiement sur le cloud","Vercel CLI","TypeScript","Bun","comment utiliser alicloud-redis","alternatives à Vercel CLI"],"de":["KI-Tools","alicloud-redis","Bereitstellung in der Cloud","Vercel CLI","TypeScript","Bun","wie man alicloud-redis verwendet","Alternativen zu Vercel CLI"],"pt":["como usar Alicloud Redis CLI","o que é Alicloud Redis CLI","Alicloud Redis CLI alternativa","Alicloud Redis CLI vs Vercel CLI","instalar Alicloud Redis CLI","guia de configuração do Alicloud Redis CLI","ferramentas de nuvem","implantação de nuvem"],"ru":["как использовать Alicloud Redis CLI","что такое Alicloud Redis CLI","альтернатива Alicloud Redis CLI","Alicloud Redis CLI vs Vercel CLI","установить Alicloud Redis CLI","руководство по настройке Alicloud Redis CLI","инструменты облака","развертывание в облаке"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Alicloud Redis CLI","ما هو Alicloud Redis CLI","بديل Alicloud Redis CLI","Alicloud Redis CLI مقابل Vercel CLI","تثبيت Alicloud Redis CLI","دليل إعداد Alicloud Redis CLI","أدوات السحابة","نشر السحابي"]}},"owner":"agents-infrastructure","repo":"licell","repoPath":"agents-infrastructure/licell","stars":2,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T09:58:15Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"alicloud-redis","description":"Manage Alibaba Cloud Redis (Tair / R-KVStore) using the @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 TypeScript SDK. Use when working with Redis or Tair instances, accounts, backups, security (whitelist/SSL/TDE/audit), parameters, monitoring, cluster scaling, direct connection, Tair Custom instances, and resource tagging. Covers all 157 APIs of the R-KVStore 20150101 version.","version":"1.0","bodyPreview":"# Alibaba Cloud Redis (R-KVStore) Skill\n\nManage Redis and Tair instances via the `@alicloud/r-kvstore20150101` TypeScript SDK.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\nnpm install @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 @alicloud/openapi-core @darabonba/typescript\n```\n\n```bash\nexport ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_ID=\"<your-key-id>\"\nexport ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_SECRET=\"<your-key-secret>\"\n```\n\nSee [scripts/setup_client.ts](scripts/setup_client.ts) for a reusable client factory, and [references/quickstart.md](references/quick","body":"# Alibaba Cloud Redis (R-KVStore) Skill\n\nManage Redis and Tair instances via the `@alicloud/r-kvstore20150101` TypeScript SDK.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n```bash\nnpm install @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 @alicloud/openapi-core @darabonba/typescript\n```\n\n```bash\nexport ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_ID=\"<your-key-id>\"\nexport ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_SECRET=\"<your-key-secret>\"\n```\n\nSee [scripts/setup_client.ts](scripts/setup_client.ts) for a reusable client factory, and [references/quickstart.md](references/quickstart.md) for full setup including endpoints, instance types, architectures, Redis versions, pagination, and async polling.\n\n## Client Initialization\n\n```typescript\nimport Client from ''@alicloud/r-kvstore20150101'';\nimport { Config } from ''@alicloud/openapi-core'';\n\nconst client = new Client(new Config({\n  accessKeyId: process.env.ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_ID,\n  accessKeySecret: process.env.ALIBABA_CLOUD_ACCESS_KEY_SECRET,\n  endpoint: ''r-kvstore.aliyuncs.com'',\n  regionId: ''cn-hangzhou'',\n}));\n```\n\n## API Overview (157 APIs in 8 Domains)\n\n| Domain | APIs | Key Operations | Reference |\n|--------|------|----------------|-----------|\n| Instance Management | 82 | createInstance, describeInstances, modifyInstanceSpec | [references/instance.md](references/instance.md) |\n| Account Management | 7 | createAccount, grantAccountPrivilege, resetAccountPassword | [references/account.md](references/account.md) |\n| Backup & Recovery | 11 | createBackup, describeBackups, modifyBackupPolicy, restoreInstance | [references/backup.md](references/backup.md) |\n| Security & Encryption | 23 | modifySecurityIps, modifyInstanceSSL, modifyInstanceTDE, modifyAuditLogConfig | [references/security.md](references/security.md) |\n| Parameter Management | 11 | describeParameters, createParameterGroup, modifyInstanceParameter | [references/parameter.md](references/parameter.md) |\n| Monitoring & Performance | 8 | describeHistoryMonitorValues, describeSlowLogRecords | [references/monitoring.md](references/monitoring.md) |\n| Tair Custom Instance | 12 | createTairKVCacheCustomInstance, describeTairKVCacheCustomInstances | [references/tair-custom.md](references/tair-custom.md) |\n| Tag & Resource | 5 | tagResources, untagResources, listTagResources | [references/tag-resource.md](references/tag-resource.md) |\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### RPC-Style with instanceId\n\nMost APIs require `instanceId` as the primary identifier:\n\n```typescript\nimport * as models from ''@alicloud/r-kvstore20150101/dist/models'';\n\nconst { body } = await client.describeInstanceAttribute(\n  new models.DescribeInstanceAttributeRequest({\n    instanceId: ''r-bp1xxxxxxxxxxxxx'',\n  })\n);\n```\n\n### Page-Based Pagination\n\n```typescript\nlet pageNumber = 1;\nlet all: any[] = [];\nwhile (true) {\n  const { body } = await client.describeInstances(new models.DescribeInstancesRequest({\n    regionId: ''cn-hangzhou'', pageSize: 50, pageNumber,\n  }));\n  all.push(...(body.instances?.KVStoreInstance || []));\n  if (all.length >= (body.totalCount || 0)) break;\n  pageNumber++;\n}\n```\n\n### Async Operation Polling\n\nMany operations are async — poll instance status until target state:\n\n```typescript\nwhile (true) {\n  const { body } = await client.describeInstanceAttribute(\n    new models.DescribeInstanceAttributeRequest({ instanceId })\n  );\n  const status = body.instances?.DBInstanceAttribute?.[0]?.instanceStatus;\n  if (status === ''Normal'') break;\n  await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 5000));\n}\n```\n\n### Multi-Type Support\n\nR-KVStore supports Redis Community and Tair (DRAM/Persistent Memory/ESSD):\n\n```typescript\n// Redis Community\nconst { body: redis } = await client.createInstance(new models.CreateInstanceRequest({\n  regionId: ''cn-hangzhou'', instanceType: ''Redis'', engineVersion: ''7.0'',\n  instanceClass: ''redis.master.small.default'', chargeType: ''PostPaid'',\n  password: process.env.REDIS_PASSWORD!, vpcId: ''vpc-xxx'', vSwitchId: ''vsw-xxx'',\n}));\n\n// Tair (Enhanced Redis)\nconst { body: tair } = await client.createTairInstance(new models.CreateTairInstanceRequest({\n  regionId: ''cn-hangzhou'', instanceType: ''tair_rdb'',\n  instanceClass: ''tair.rdb.2g'', chargeType: ''PostPaid'',\n  password: process.env.REDIS_PASSWORD!, vpcId: ''vpc-xxx'', vSwitchId: ''vsw-xxx'',\n}));\n```\n\n### Config as JSON String\n\nInstance configuration is passed as a JSON string:\n\n```typescript\nawait client.modifyInstanceConfig(new models.ModifyInstanceConfigRequest({\n  instanceId,\n  config: JSON.stringify({\n    ''maxmemory-policy'': ''allkeys-lru'',\n    ''timeout'': ''300'',\n  }),\n}));\n```\n\n### Error Handling\n\n```typescript\ntry {\n  await client.createInstance(request);\n} catch (err: any) {\n  console.error(`Code: ${err.code}, Message: ${err.message}, RequestId: ${err.data?.RequestId}`);\n}\n```\n\n## Common Workflows\n\n### 1. Create Redis Instance with Account\n\n```\ncreateInstance → waitForNormal → createAccount → modifySecurityIps\n```\n\n### 2. Create Tair Cluster\n\n```\ncreateTairInstance → waitForNormal → describeClusterMemberInfo\n```\n\n### 3. Backup and Recovery\n\n```\nmodifyBackupPolicy → createBackup → describeBackups → restoreInstance\n```\n\n### 4. Security Hardening\n\n```\nmodifySecurityIps → modifyInstanceSSL → modifyInstanceTDE → modifyAuditLogConfig\n```\n\n### 5. Cluster Scaling\n\n```\ndescribeClusterMemberInfo → addShardingNode / deleteShardingNode\n```\n\n### 6. Direct Connection Mode\n\n```\nallocateDirectConnection → describeDBInstanceNetInfo → releaseDirectConnection\n```\n\n### 7. Parameter Tuning\n\n```\ndescribeParameterTemplates → createParameterGroup → modifyInstanceParameter\n```\n\n### 8. Performance Monitoring\n\n```\ndescribeMonitorItems → describeHistoryMonitorValues → describeSlowLogRecords → createCacheAnalysisTask\n```\n\nSee [references/workflows.md](references/workflows.md) for detailed workflow examples with full code.\n\n## API Reference Quick Index\n\nLoad the corresponding reference file for parameter details:\n\n- **Instance CRUD/lifecycle/spec/network/cluster/proxy**: `references/instance.md`\n- **Account CRUD/password/privileges**: `references/account.md`\n- **Backup/restore/cache analysis**: `references/backup.md`\n- **IP whitelist/SSL/TDE/audit/global whitelist**: `references/security.md`\n- **Parameters/parameter groups/templates**: `references/parameter.md`\n- **Performance monitoring/slow logs/running logs**: `references/monitoring.md`\n- **TairKVCache custom instances**: `references/tair-custom.md`\n- **Resource tagging**: `references/tag-resource.md`\n\nEach reference file contains per-API documentation with method signatures and parameter tables.\n\n## Code Examples\n\nSee [scripts/examples.ts](scripts/examples.ts) for ready-to-use code covering:\n\n- Instance listing, creation, and deletion\n- Account management\n- Backup creation and listing\n- IP whitelist and SSL configuration\n- Audit log management\n- Performance monitoring and slow log analysis\n- Parameter management\n- Resource tagging\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:41:36.164Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Agents requiring streamlined management of Alibaba Cloud Redis instances","zh":"适用于需要简化阿里云Redis实例管理的云代理","ja":"Alibaba Cloud Redisインスタンスの管理を簡素化するクラウドエージェントに適しています","ko":"알리바바 클라우드 Redis 인스턴스 관리를 간소화하는 클라우드 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Nube que requieren una gestión optimizada de instancias de Alibaba Cloud Redis","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Cloud nécessitant une gestion simplifiée des instances Alibaba Cloud Redis","de":"Ideal für Cloud-Agents, die eine optimierte Verwaltung von Alibaba Cloud Redis-Instanzen erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Nuvem que requerem gestão simplificada de instâncias do Alibaba Cloud Redis","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, требующих оптимизированного управления экземплярами Alibaba Cloud Redis","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء السحابيين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة مبسطة لمثيلات Alibaba Cloud Redis"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Redis and Tair instances via the @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 TypeScript SDK, leveraging Alibaba Cloud''s openAPI capabilities and facilitating one-click deployment workflows with TypeScript and Bun","zh":"赋予代理管理Redis和Tair实例的能力，通过@alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 TypeScript SDK利用阿里云的openAPI能力，并通过TypeScript和Bun实现一键式部署工作流","ja":"エージェントにRedisおよびTairインスタンスを管理する機能を提供します。@alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 TypeScript SDKを使用してAlibaba CloudのopenAPI機能を活用し、TypeScriptおよびBunを使用してワンクリックデプロイワークフローを実現します","ko":"에이전트가 Redis 및 Tair 인스턴스를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 TypeScript SDK를 통해 알리바바 클라우드의 openAPI 기능을 활용하고, TypeScript 및 Bun을 사용하여 일키 배포 워크플로를 촉진합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar instancias de Redis y Tair a través del SDK de TypeScript @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101, aprovechando las capacidades de openAPI de Alibaba Cloud y facilitando flujos de trabajo de implementación de un solo clic con TypeScript y Bun","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les instances Redis et Tair via le SDK TypeScript @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101, en exploitant les capacités openAPI d''Alibaba Cloud et en facilitant les flux de travail de déploiement d''un seul clic avec TypeScript et Bun","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Redis- und Tair-Instanzen über das @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 TypeScript SDK zu verwalten, indem es die openAPI-Fähigkeiten von Alibaba Cloud nutzt und Workflows für die Bereitstellung mit einem Klick mit TypeScript und Bun erleichtert","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem instâncias Redis e Tair por meio do SDK TypeScript @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101, utilizando as capacidades de openAPI da Alibaba Cloud e facilitando fluxos de trabalho de implantação em um clique com TypeScript e Bun","ru":"Позволяет агентам управлять экземплярами Redis и Tair через SDK @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 для TypeScript, используя возможности openAPI от Alibaba Cloud и облегчая рабочие процессы развертывания в один клик с помощью TypeScript и Bun","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة مثيلات Redis و Tair من خلال SDK @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 الخاص بTypeScript، واستخدام إمكانيات openAPI من Alibaba Cloud وتسهيل سير عمل التوزيع في نقرة واحدة مع TypeScript و Bun"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Redis instance provisioning on Alibaba Cloud","Managing Tair instance configurations programmatically","Monitoring Redis performance metrics for optimized deployment"],"zh":["在阿里云上自动化Redis实例的提供","以编程方式管理Tair实例配置","监控Redis性能指标以优化部署"],"ja":["Alibaba Cloud上でのRedisインスタンスのプロビジョニングを自動化する","Tairインスタンスの構成をプログラム的に管理する","Redisのパフォーマンスメトリクスを監視してデプロイを最適化する"],"ko":["알리바바 클라우드에서 Redis 인스턴스 할당을 자동화하는 것","Tair 인스턴스 구성 programu적으로 관리","Redis 성능 메트릭을 모니터링하여 배포를 최적화"],"es":["Automatizar la provisión de instancias de Redis en Alibaba Cloud","Gestionar configuraciones de instancias de Tair de forma programática","Supervisar métricas de rendimiento de Redis para una implementación optimizada"],"fr":["Automatiser la fourniture d''instances Redis sur Alibaba Cloud","Gérer les configurations d''instances Tair de manière programmatique","Surveiller les métriques de performance de Redis pour un déploiement optimisé"],"de":["Automatisieren der Bereitstellung von Redis-Instanzen in Alibaba Cloud","Programmatische Verwaltung von Tair-Instanzkonfigurationen","Überwachung von Redis-Leistungsmetriken für eine optimierte Bereitstellung"],"pt":["Automatizar a provisionamento de instâncias Redis na Alibaba Cloud","Gerenciar configurações de instâncias Tair de forma programática","Monitorar métricas de desempenho do Redis para implantação otimizada"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обеспечение экземпляров Redis в Alibaba Cloud","Управлять конфигурациями экземпляров Tair программно","Мониторить метрики производительности Redis для оптимизированной установки"],"ar":["توفير تلقائي لمثيلات Redis في Alibaba Cloud","إدارةconfigurations لمثيلات Tair بالبرمجة","مراقبة مقاييس أداء Redis لتحسين التوزيع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Alibaba Cloud Access Key ID and Secret","Dependent on @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 and @alicloud/openapi-core libraries","Specific to Alibaba Cloud Redis (R-KVStore) instances"],"zh":["需要阿里云Access Key ID和Secret","依赖@alicloud/r-kvstore20150101和@alicloud/openapi-core库","仅适用于阿里云Redis（R-KVStore）实例"],"ja":["Alibaba Cloud Access Key IDおよびSecretが必要","@alicloud/r-kvstore20150101および@alicloud/openapi-coreライブラリに依存","Alibaba Cloud Redis（R-KVStore）インスタンス専用"],"ko":["알리바바 클라우드 Access Key ID 및 Secret가 필요","@alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 및 @alicloud/openapi-core 라이브러리에 의존","알리바바 클라우드 Redis(R-KVStore) 인스턴스 전용"],"es":["Requiere ID de acceso a Alibaba Cloud y secreto","Dependiente de las bibliotecas @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 y @alicloud/openapi-core","Específico para instancias de Alibaba Cloud Redis (R-KVStore)"],"fr":["Nécessite une ID d''accès Alibaba Cloud et un secret","Dépend des bibliothèques @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 et @alicloud/openapi-core","Spécifique aux instances Alibaba Cloud Redis (R-KVStore)"],"de":["Erfordert Alibaba Cloud-Zugriffsschlüssel-ID und -Geheimnis","Abhängig von den Bibliotheken @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 und @alicloud/openapi-core","Spezifisch für Alibaba Cloud Redis-Instanzen (R-KVStore)"],"pt":["Requer ID de chave de acesso e segredo da Alibaba Cloud","Dependente das bibliotecas @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 e @alicloud/openapi-core","Específico para instâncias do Alibaba Cloud Redis (R-KVStore)"],"ru":["Требуется ID ключа доступа и секрет Alibaba Cloud","Зависит от библиотек @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 и @alicloud/openapi-core","Конкретно для экземпляров Alibaba Cloud Redis (R-KVStore)"],"ar":["يتطلب معرف مفتاح الوصول والسر للوكلاء السحابيين من Alibaba Cloud","اعتماد على المكتبات @alicloud/r-kvstore20150101 و @alicloud/openapi-core","محدد لمثيلات Alibaba Cloud Redis (R-KVStore)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6c52d88ef2bd8ad65b31d84cc4034a6b4494549b510e5bb5c25af17f552c4faa","qualityScore":48}');
