atos empresariais","Envio de textos"],"ru":["Список номеров телефона","Последние разговоры","Транскрипция звонков","Сводка звонков","Список деловых контактов","Отправка текстов"],"ar":["قائمة أرقام الهاتف","المكالمات الأخيرة","نص المكالمة","ملخص المكالمة","قائمة الاتصالات التجارية","إرسال الرسائل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Quo API","业务电话系统","自动化","集成","电话号码","最近的对话","会话记录","联系人列表"],"ja":["Quo API","ビジネス電話システム","自動化","統合","電話番号","最近の会話","会話の記録","連絡先の一覧"],"ko":["Quo API","비즈니스 전화 시스템","자동화","통합","전화 번호","최근 대화","대화 기록","연락처 목록"],"es":["Quo","OpenClaw","telefonía empresarial","desarrollo de software","configuración de API","inteligencia artificial","análisis de conversaciones","gestión de contactos","envío de textos"],"fr":["Quo","OpenClaw","téléphonie d''entreprise","développement de logiciels","configuration d''API","intelligence artificielle","analyse de conversations","gestion de contacts","envoi de textes"],"de":["Quo","OpenClaw","Unternehmens-Telefonie","Software-Entwicklung","API-Konfiguration","künstliche Intelligenz","Gesprächsanalyse","Kontaktverwaltung","Textnachrichten senden"],"pt":["Quo","Telefonia empresarial","Configuração de sistema de memória","Habilidades de agente","Instruções de agente","API de telefonia","Gerenciamento de chamadas","Gerenciamento de textos","Gerenciamento de contatos"],"ru":["Quo","Деловая телефония","Настройка системы памяти","Навыки агента","Инструкции агента","API телефонии","Управление звонками","Управление текстами","Управление контактами"],"ar":["Quo","هاتفية تجارية","إعداد نظام الذاكرة","مهارات الوكيل","إرشادات الوكيل","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للهاتف","إدارة المكالمات","إدارة الرسائل","إدارة الاتصالات"]}},"owner":"TechNickAI","repo":"openclaw-config","repoPath":"TechNickAI/openclaw-config","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.665Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"quo","description":"","version":"0.4.0","bodyPreview":"# Quo 📞\n\nQuery your Quo (formerly OpenPhone) business phone — calls, texts, contacts,\ntranscripts.\n\n## Setup\n\nAPI key from my.quo.com → Settings → API. Configure via gateway under\n`skills.entries.quo.apiKey`. OpenClaw injects it as `QUO_API_KEY` automatically.\n\n## What Users Ask\n\n- \"What''s my Quo number?\"\n- \"Show recent conversations\"\n- \"Get the transcript from that call\"\n- \"What was the summary of my call with [person]?\"\n- \"List my business contacts\"\n- \"Send a text to [number]\"\n- \"Show my rece","body":"# Quo 📞\n\nQuery your Quo (formerly OpenPhone) business phone — calls, texts, contacts,\ntranscripts.\n\n## Setup\n\nAPI key from my.quo.com → Settings → API. Configure via gateway under\n`skills.entries.quo.apiKey`. OpenClaw injects it as `QUO_API_KEY` automatically.\n\n## What Users Ask\n\n- \"What''s my Quo number?\"\n- \"Show recent conversations\"\n- \"Get the transcript from that call\"\n- \"What was the summary of my call with [person]?\"\n- \"List my business contacts\"\n- \"Send a text to [number]\"\n- \"Show my recent calls with [number]\"\n- \"Any missed calls today?\"\n- \"Who called the office?\"\n- \"Text [person] from my work number\"\n- \"Check my voicemails\"\n- \"What messages came in on the business line?\"\n\n## CLI Reference\n\n```\n{baseDir}/quo numbers                    List phone numbers\n{baseDir}/quo conversations [filters]    List conversations\n{baseDir}/quo contacts [--limit N]       List contacts\n{baseDir}/quo custom-fields              List contact custom fields\n{baseDir}/quo users                      List workspace users\n{baseDir}/quo summary <callId>           Get AI call summary\n{baseDir}/quo transcript <callId>        Get full dialogue transcript\n{baseDir}/quo recordings <callId>        Get recording URLs\n{baseDir}/quo voicemails <callId>        Get voicemail + transcript\n{baseDir}/quo send --from <num> --to <num> <message>\n{baseDir}/quo messages --number-id <id> --participant <phone> [--limit N]\n{baseDir}/quo calls --number-id <id> --participant <phone> [--limit N] [--created-after ISO] [--created-before ISO]\n{baseDir}/quo raw [METHOD] <endpoint> [json-body]\n```\n\n### Conversation Filters\n\n```\n--phone <number-or-id>    Filter by Quo phone line (repeatable)\n--updated-after ISO       Conversations updated after date\n--updated-before ISO      Conversations updated before date\n--created-after ISO       Conversations created after date\n--created-before ISO      Conversations created before date\n--include-inactive        Include inactive/snoozed conversations\n--limit N                 Max results (default 10)\n```\n\n## API Endpoints\n\nFull OpenAPI spec:\nhttps://openphone-public-api-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/public/openphone-public-api-v1-prod.json\n\n| Endpoint                       | Method  | Description                                                    |\n| ------------------------------ | ------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `/v1/phone-numbers`            | GET     | List phone numbers                                             |\n| `/v1/conversations`            | GET     | List conversations (filterable)                                |\n| `/v1/messages`                 | GET     | List messages for a conversation                               |\n| `/v1/messages`                 | POST    | Send a text message                                            |\n| `/v1/messages/{id}`            | GET     | Get message by ID                                              |\n| `/v1/calls`                    | GET     | List calls (with date filters)                                 |\n| `/v1/calls/{callId}`           | GET     | Get call by ID                                                 |\n| `/v1/call-summaries/{callId}`  | GET     | AI-generated call summary                                      |\n| `/v1/call-transcripts/{id}`    | GET     | Full dialogue transcript with speaker attribution              |\n| `/v1/call-recordings/{callId}` | GET     | Recording URLs (MP3)                                           |\n| `/v1/call-voicemails/{callId}` | GET     | Voicemail + transcript                                         |\n| `/v1/contacts`                 | GET     | List contacts (paginated)                                      |\n| `/v1/contacts`                 | POST    | Create a contact                                               |\n| `/v1/contacts/{id}`            | GET     | Get contact by ID                                              |\n| `/v1/contacts/{id}`            | PATCH   | Update contact (**replaces entire defaultFields!**)            |\n| `/v1/contacts/{id}`            | DELETE  | Delete a contact                                               |\n| `/v1/contact-custom-fields`    | GET     | List custom contact fields                                     |\n| `/v1/users`                    | GET     | List workspace users                                           |\n| `/v1/webhooks/*`               | Various | Webhook management for messages, calls, summaries, transcripts |\n\n## Key Data Formats\n\n### Transcript Response\n\nReturns `dialogue[]` array with speaker-attributed entries:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"callId\": \"AC...\",\n    \"dialogue\": [\n      {\n        \"content\": \"Hello\",\n        \"start\": 0.16,\n        \"end\": 0.48,\n        \"identifier\": \"+15551234567\",\n        \"userId\": \"US...\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"content\": \"Hi, my name is Jane\",\n        \"start\": 1.0,\n        \"end\": 2.5,\n        \"identifier\": \"+15559876543\",\n        \"userId\": null\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Contact Fields\n\n- `defaultFields`: firstName, lastName, company, role, emails[], phoneNumbers[]\n- `customFields`: Array of {key, value} pairs (keys from `/contact-custom-fields`)\n- ⚠️ PATCH replaces entire `defaultFields` — always include ALL existing fields\n\n### Custom Fields (Julianna''s workspace)\n\n- `Property Associated` (key: `1712532493777`, type: string)\n- `Address` (key: `1700067557182`, type: address)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Transcripts require call recording enabled in Quo settings\n- Phone numbers in E.164 format (+1XXXXXXXXXX)\n- Contacts API has no phone number search — must page through or use externalIds\n- Voicemail endpoint returns single object (not array)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:21:12.840Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Business Automation Agents requiring seamless integration with Quo business phone systems for call, text, and contact management.","zh":"非常适合需要与 Quo 商务电话系统无缝集成以实现通话、短信和联系人管理的业务自动化 Agent。","ja":"通話、メッセージ、および連絡先管理のために Quo ビジネス電話システムとのシームレスな統合を必要とするビジネスオートメーション Agent に最適です。","ko":"통화, 문자 메시지 및 연락처 관리를 위해 Quo 비즈니스 전화 시스템과의 원활한 통합이 필요한 비즈니스 자동화 Agent에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Automatización de Negocios que requieren una integración perfecta con los sistemas de teléfono empresarial Quo para la gestión de llamadas, textos y contactos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation d''entreprise nécessitant une intégration transparente avec les systèmes de téléphone d''entreprise Quo pour la gestion d''appels, de textes et de contacts.","de":"Ideal für Business-Automatisierungsagenten, die eine nahtlose Integration mit Quo-Geschäftstelefonsystemen für Anruf-, Text- und Kontaktverwaltung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação Empresarial que exigem integração perfeita com sistemas de telefonia empresarial Quo para gestão de chamadas, mensagens de texto e contactos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов бизнес-автоматизации, требующих бесшовной интеграции с бизнес-телефонными системами Quo для управления звонками, текстовыми сообщениями и контактами.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء أتمتة الأعمال الذين يتطلبون تكاملاً سلسًا مع أنظمة الهاتف التجارية من Quo لإدارة المكالمات والرسائل النصية وجهات الاتصال."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to query Quo business phone systems via API, enabling features like call transcript retrieval, contact listing, and text message sending using the QUO_API_KEY for secure authentication.","zh":"使 Agent 能够通过 API 查询 Quo 商务电话系统，从而利用 QUO_API_KEY 实现安全身份验证，启用通话记录检索、联系人列表和短信发送等功能。","ja":"QUO_API_KEY を使用した安全な認証により、通話記録の取得、連絡先のリスト表示、テキストメッセージの送信などの機能を有効にし、API 経由で Quo ビジネス電話システムをクエリすることを Agent に可能にします。","ko":"QUO_API_KEY를 사용한 보안 인증을 통해 통화 기록 검색, 연락처 목록 조회, 문자 메시지 전송 등의 기능을 활성화하며, Agent가 API를 통해 Quo 비즈니스 전화 시스템을 조회할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a consultar los sistemas de teléfono empresarial Quo a través de la API, lo que permite características como la recuperación de transcripciones de llamadas, la lista de contactos y el envío de mensajes de texto utilizando la QUO_API_KEY para la autenticación segura.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''interroger les systèmes de téléphone d''entreprise Quo via l''API, permettant des fonctionnalités telles que la récupération de transcriptions d''appels, la liste de contacts et l''envoi de messages texte en utilisant la QUO_API_KEY pour l''authentification sécurisée.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Quo-Geschäftstelefonsysteme über die API abzufragen, wodurch Funktionen wie die Abrufung von Anruftranskripten, die Kontaktliste und das Senden von Textnachrichten mithilfe der QUO_API_KEY für eine sichere Authentifizierung ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a consultar os sistemas de telefonia empresarial Quo via API, permitindo funcionalidades como a recuperação de transcrições de chamadas, listagem de contactos e envio de mensagens de texto utilizando a QUO_API_KEY para autenticação segura.","ru":"Позволяет агентам отправлять запросы к бизнес-телефонным системам Quo через API, обеспечивая такие функции, как получение расшифровок звонков, список контактов и отправка текстовых сообщений с использованием QUO_API_KEY для безопасной аутентификации.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من الاستعلام عن أنظمة الهاتف التجارية من Quo عبر واجهة برمجة التطبيقات (API)، مما يتيح ميزات مثل استرداد نصوص المكالمات وسرد جهات الاتصال وإرسال الرسائل النصية باستخدام مفتاح QUO_API_KEY للمصادقة الآمنة."},"useCases":{"en":["Retrieving call transcripts for analysis","Automating text message responses to contacts","Listing and managing business contacts"],"zh":["检索通话记录以供分析","自动向联系人发送短信回复","列出和管理业务联系人"],"ja":["分析のための通話記録の取得","連絡先へのテキストメッセージ応答の自動化","ビジネス連絡先のリスト表示と管理"],"ko":["분석을 위한 통화 기록 검색","연락처에 대한 문자 메시지 응답 자동화","비즈니스 연락처 목록 조회 및 관리"],"es":["Recuperación de transcripciones de llamadas para análisis","Automatización de respuestas de mensajes de texto a contactos","Listado y gestión de contactos empresariales"],"fr":["Récupération de transcriptions d''appels pour analyse","Automatisation de réponses de messages texte aux contacts","Listage et gestion de contacts d''entreprise"],"de":["Abrufung von Anruftranskripten für die Analyse","Automatisierung von Textnachrichten-Antworten an Kontakte","Auflistung und Verwaltung von Geschäftskontakten"],"pt":["Recuperação de transcrições de chamadas para análise","Automatização de respostas por mensagem de texto para contactos","Listagem e gestão de contactos empresariais"],"ru":["Получение расшифровок звонков для анализа","Автоматизация ответов текстовыми сообщениями контактам","Составление списка и управление бизнес-контактами"],"ar":["استرداد نصوص المكالمات لتحليلها","أتمتة ردود الرسائل النصية إلى جهات الاتصال","سرد جهات الاتصال التجارية وإدارتها"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Quo API key from my.quo.com","Dependent on Quo business phone system"],"zh":["需要从 my.quo.com 获取 Quo API 密钥","依赖于 Quo 商务电话系统"],"ja":["my.quo.com からの Quo API キーが必要","Quo ビジネス電話システムに依存"],"ko":["my.quo.com에서 Quo API 키 필요","Quo 비즈니스 전화 시스템에 의존"],"es":["Requiere clave de API de Quo desde my.quo.com","Dependiente del sistema de teléfono empresarial Quo"],"fr":["Nécessite une clé d''API Quo depuis my.quo.com","Dépendant du système de téléphone d''entreprise Quo"],"de":["Benötigt Quo-API-Schlüssel von my.quo.com","Von Quo-Geschäftstelefonsystem abhängig"],"pt":["Requer uma chave API do Quo de my.quo.com","Dependente do sistema de telefonia empresarial Quo"],"ru":["Требуется ключ API Quo с сайта my.quo.com","Зависит от бизнес-телефонной системы Quo"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح واجهة برمجة تطبيقات (API) من Quo من my.quo.com","يعتمد على نظام الهاتف التجاري من Quo"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b6531b9d11b47c7f7d8e10d90b357658e4998b2dbdc6212ce37709b09a2dfd42","qualityScore":48}');
