 委托","上下文工程","从想法到生产的全流程管理"],"ja":["SPEC第一の計画","TDD自動化","GPT委託","コンテキストエンジニアリング","アイデアから生産までの一連の流れを管理"],"ko":["SPEC-첫 계획","TDD 자동화","GPT 위임","컨텍스트 엔지니어링","아이디어에서 생산까지의 전체 프로세스를 관리"],"es":["Planificación SPEC-first","Automatización TDD","Delegación GPT","Ingeniería de contexto","Integración con Claude Code"],"fr":["Planification SPEC-first","Automatisation TDD","Délégation GPT","Ingénierie de contexte","Intégration avec Claude Code"],"de":["SPEC-first-Planung","TDD-Automatisierung","GPT-Delegation","Kontext-Engineering","Integration mit Claude Code"],"pt":["Planejamento SPEC-first","Automação TDD","Delegação GPT","Engenharia de contexto","Integração com Claude Code"],"ru":["Планирование SPEC-first","Автоматизация TDD","Делегирование GPT","Инженерия контекста","Интеграция с Claude Code"],"ar":["التخطيط SPEC-first","التحكم التلقائي TDD","ت 委هدة GPT","هندسة السياق","التكامل مع Claude Code"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","docs-verify","SPEC-first 规划","TDD 自动化","GPT 委托","上下文工程","软件开发自动化","全流程管理"],"ja":["AIエージェント","docs-verify","SPEC第一の計画","TDD自動化","GPT委託","コンテキストエンジニアリング","ソフトウェア開発自動化","全プロセス管理"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","docs-verify","SPEC-첫 계획","TDD 자동화","GPT 위임","컨텍스트 엔지니어링","소프트웨어 개발 자동화","전체 프로세스 관리"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","cómo usar docs-verify","qué es docs-verify","alternativas a docs-verify","docs-verify vs Claude Code","instalación de docs-verify","guía de configuración de docs-verify"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les développeurs","comment utiliser docs-verify","qu''est-ce que docs-verify","alternatives à docs-verify","docs-verify vs Claude Code","installation de docs-verify","guide de configuration de docs-verify"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","wie man docs-verify verwendet","was ist docs-verify","Alternativen zu docs-verify","docs-verify vs Claude Code","Installation von docs-verify","Konfigurationsanleitung für docs-verify"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","desenvolvimento de software","planejamento spec-first","automação tdd","delegação gpt","claude code","motor de workflow de código","como usar docs-verify","o que é docs-verify"],"ru":["ии агенты","разработка программного обеспечения","планирование spec-first","автоматизация tdd","делегирование gpt","claude code","движок потока кодирования","как использовать docs-verify","что такое docs-verify"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","التخطيط spec-first","التحكم التلقائي tdd","ت 委هدة gpt","claude code","محرك سير عمل الكود","كيفية استخدام docs-verify","ما هو docs-verify"]}},"owner":"changoo89","repo":"claude-pilot","repoPath":"changoo89/claude-pilot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.694Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"docs-verify","description":"Documentation verification for 3-Tier system - validates line limits, cross-references, file counts","bodyPreview":"# SKILL: Documentation Verification\n\n> **Purpose**: Validate 3-Tier documentation system compliance - line limits, cross-references, file counts\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### When to Use\n\n- After closing plan (`/03_close`)\n- After running `/document`\n- Before committing documentation changes\n\n### Quick Reference\n\n```bash\n# Pure bash link check (no external deps)\nfor file in CLAUDE.md docs/ai-context/*.md; do\n  [ -f \"$file\" ] || continue\n  grep -oE ''@[^][:space:]]+'' \"$file\" | while read ref; do\n    r","body":"# SKILL: Documentation Verification\n\n> **Purpose**: Validate 3-Tier documentation system compliance - line limits, cross-references, file counts\n\n---\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### When to Use\n\n- After closing plan (`/03_close`)\n- After running `/document`\n- Before committing documentation changes\n\n### Quick Reference\n\n```bash\n# Pure bash link check (no external deps)\nfor file in CLAUDE.md docs/ai-context/*.md; do\n  [ -f \"$file\" ] || continue\n  grep -oE ''@[^][:space:]]+'' \"$file\" | while read ref; do\n    ref_path=\"${ref#@}\"\n    [ ! -e \"$ref_path\" ] && echo \"Broken: $ref in $file\"\n  done\ndone\n```\n\n---\n\n## Change Detection (MANDATORY FIRST STEP)\n\n**Before running verification, check if docs changed**:\n\n```bash\n# Get changed markdown files (with fallback)\nCHANGED_MD=$(git diff --name-only HEAD~1 -- \"*.md\" 2>/dev/null || git diff --name-only -- \"*.md\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"FALLBACK_FULL_VERIFY\")\n\n# Fallback: If git diff fails, run full verification\nif [ \"$CHANGED_MD\" = \"FALLBACK_FULL_VERIFY\" ]; then\n    echo \"Cannot detect changes, running full verification\"\n    CHANGED_MD=$(find . -name \"*.md\" -type f ! -path \"*/.git/*\" ! -path \"*/.trash/*\")\nfi\n\nif [ -z \"$CHANGED_MD\" ]; then\n    echo \"No markdown files changed\"\n    echo \"Skipping documentation verification\"\n    exit 0\nfi\n\necho \"Changed markdown files:\"\necho \"$CHANGED_MD\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 3-Tier System\n\n**Tier 1** (3 files, ≤200 lines each):\n- `CLAUDE.md` - Project architecture, features, Quick Start\n- `docs/ai-context/project-structure.md` - Tech stack, file tree\n- `docs/ai-context/docs-overview.md` - Documentation navigation\n\n**Tier 2**: Component CONTEXT.md files (unlimited)\n\n**Tier 3**: Feature-specific CONTEXT.md files\n\n---\n\n## Verification Checks\n\n### 1. Tier 1 Line Limits (Changed Files Only)\n\n**Limit**: ≤200 lines per file\n\n```bash\nTIER1_FILES=(\n  \"CLAUDE.md\"\n  \"docs/ai-context/project-structure.md\"\n  \"docs/ai-context/docs-overview.md\"\n)\n\nfor file in \"${TIER1_FILES[@]}\"; do\n  # Only check if file was changed\n  if echo \"$CHANGED_MD\" | grep -q \"$file\"; then\n    LINES=$(wc -l < \"$file\" | tr -d '' '')\n    if [ \"$LINES\" -gt 200 ]; then\n      echo \"FAIL: $file has $LINES lines (limit: 200)\"\n      exit 1\n    fi\n    echo \"$file: $LINES lines\"\n  fi\ndone\n```\n\n**On violation**: Extract content to Tier 2 CONTEXT.md files\n\n### 2. Tier 1 File Count (CRITICAL)\n\n**Limit**: Exactly 2 files in `docs/ai-context/`\n\n```bash\nCOUNT=$(find docs/ai-context -maxdepth 1 -name \"*.md\" -type f | wc -l | tr -d '' '')\nif [ \"$COUNT\" -ne 2 ]; then\n  echo \"FAIL: docs/ai-context/ has $COUNT files (expected: 2)\"\n  exit 1\nfi\n```\n\n### 3. Cross-Reference Validation (Changed Files Only)\n\n```bash\n# Only validate changed files\nfor file in $CHANGED_MD; do\n  [ -f \"$file\" ] || continue\n  grep -oE ''@\\.(claude|docs)/[^][:space:]]+'' \"$file\" 2>/dev/null | while read ref; do\n    ref_path=\"${ref#@}\"\n    ref_path=\"${ref_path%[\\`\\*\\]\\\"]}\"\n    if [ ! -e \"$ref_path\" ]; then\n      echo \"Broken reference: $ref in $file\"\n    fi\n  done\ndone\n```\n\n### 4. Circular Reference Detection\n\n```bash\n# Check for self-references (A → A)\nfind . -name \"*.md\" ! -path \"*/REFERENCE.md\" ! -path \"*/.git/*\" | while read file; do\n  refs=$(grep -oE ''@\\.(claude|docs)/[^)[:space:]+'' \"$file\" || true)\n  for ref in $refs; do\n    if [ \"${ref#@}\" = \"$file\" ]; then\n      echo \"Self-reference: $file\"\n    fi\n  done\ndone\n```\n\n### 5. Skill Count Validation\n\n```bash\nACTUAL=$(find .claude/skills -name \"SKILL.md\" | wc -l | tr -d '' '')\nSTATED=$(grep -oE ''\\*\\*[0-9]+ Skills\\*\\*'' README.md | grep -oE ''[0-9]+'' || echo \"0\")\n\nif [ \"$ACTUAL\" -ne \"$STATED\" ]; then\n  echo \"WARNING: Skill count mismatch - README: $STATED, actual: $ACTUAL\"\nfi\n```\n\n---\n\n## Integration Pattern\n\n### In Commands\n\n```markdown\n## Step 3: Documentation Verification\n\nInvoke the `docs-verify` skill to validate documentation compliance.\n\nThe skill checks:\n- Tier 1 line limits (≤200 lines)\n- Tier 1 file count (exactly 2 in ai-context/)\n- Cross-reference validity\n- Circular references\n```\n\nClaude reads this skill file and executes the bash commands inline.\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n**three-tier-docs**: Full 3-Tier documentation system | **vibe-coding**: File size standards\n\n---\n\n**Version**: claude-pilot 4.4.14\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:35:58.359Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude Code, requiring comprehensive documentation validation and compliance checks","zh":"适用于 Claude Code 等 AI Agents，它们需要全面文档验证和合规检查","ja":"Claude Code などの AI Agents に適している。文書の検証と合規性のチェックが必要である","ko":"Claude Code などの AI Agents 에 적합하다. 문서의 검증과 규정 준수 확인이 필요하다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude Code, que requieren una validación y verificación de cumplimiento de documentación exhaustiva","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude Code, nécessitant une validation et des vérifications de conformité de documentation complètes","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude Code, die eine umfassende Dokumentenvalidierung und -konformitätsprüfung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude Code, que exigem validação e verificações de conformidade de documentação abrangente","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code, требующих комплексной проверки и верификации документации","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code ، التي تتطلب التحقق والامتثال الشامل للوثائق"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to validate 3-Tier documentation systems, ensuring line limits, cross-references, and file counts are compliant, leveraging bash scripting and grep for efficient link checking","zh":"启用代理验证 3-Tier 文档系统，确保行限制、交叉引用和文件计数符合要求，利用 bash 脚本和 grep 进行高效的链接检查","ja":"3-Tier 文書システムを検証するためのエージェントを有効にする。行数制限、交叉参照、ファイル数などを確認する。bash 脚本と grep を利用して効率的なリンクチェックを行う","ko":"3-Tier 문서 시스템을 검증하는 데 필요한 에이전트를 활성화한다. 행 제한, 교차 참조 및 파일 수 등이 규정에 맞는지 확인한다. bash 脚本과 grep 를 활용하여 효율적인 링크 확인을 수행한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a validar sistemas de documentación de 3 niveles, garantizando que los límites de línea, las referencias cruzadas y los recuentos de archivos sean conformes, aprovechando el scripting bash y grep para una verificación de enlaces eficiente","fr":"Permet aux agents de valider des systèmes de documentation 3 niveaux, en garantissant que les limites de ligne, les références croisées et les comptes de fichiers soient conformes, en exploitant le scripting bash et grep pour une vérification de liens efficace","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, 3-Tier-Dokumentationssysteme zu validieren, indem sie sicherstellen, dass Zeilenlimits, Querverweise und Dateizählungen konform sind, indem sie bash-Scripting und grep für eine effiziente Verknüpfungsprüfung nutzen","pt":"Permite que os agentes validem sistemas de documentação de 3 camadas, garantindo que os limites de linha, referências cruzadas e contagem de arquivos estejam em conformidade, utilizando script de bash e grep para verificação de links eficiente","ru":"Позволяет агентам проверять системы документации трехуровневой архитектуры, гарантируя соблюдение ограничений строк, кросс-референс и количества файлов, используя скрипты bash и grep для эффективной проверки ссылок","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من التحقق من أنظمة التوثيق ثلاثية المستوى ، مما يضمن امتثال حدود السطور والمراجع المتقاطعة وعدد الملفات ، باستخدام البرمجة النصية bash و grep للتحقق الفعال من الروابط"},"useCases":{"en":["Validating documentation before commits","Automating cross-reference checks in markdown files","Enforcing line limits for consistent documentation formatting"],"zh":["文档提交前验证","自动化 markdown 文件中的交叉引用检查","强制行限制以保持一致的文档格式"],"ja":["コミット前に文書を検証する","自動化 markdown ファイル内の交叉参照のチェック","行数制限を強制することで一貫した文書のフォーマットを維持する"],"ko":["커밋 전에 문서를 검증한다","자동화 markdown 파일 내의 교차 참조의 확인","행 제한을 강제하여 일관된 문서의 형식을 유지한다"],"es":["Validar la documentación antes de los commits","Automatizar las verificaciones de referencias cruzadas en archivos markdown","Hacer cumplir los límites de línea para una formato de documentación coherente"],"fr":["Valider la documentation avant les commits","Automatiser les vérifications de références croisées dans les fichiers markdown","Faire respecter les limites de ligne pour un formatage de documentation cohérent"],"de":["Dokumentation vor Commits validieren","Automatisierung von Querverweisprüfungen in Markdown-Dateien","Durchsetzen von Zeilenlimits für ein konsistentes Dokumentenformat"],"pt":["Validar documentação antes dos commits","Automatizar verificações de referências cruzadas em arquivos markdown","Impor limites de linha para formatação de documentação consistente"],"ru":["Проверка документации перед коммитами","Автоматизация проверок кросс-референс в файлах markdown","Внедрение ограничений строк для согласованного форматирования документации"],"ar":["التحقق من الوثائق قبل الالتزامات","توسيط التحقق من المراجع المتقاطعة في ملفات markdown","فرض حدود السطور لتدوين الوثائق المتسق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires bash environment","Limited to markdown file analysis","No external dependencies supported beyond grep"],"zh":["需要 bash 环境","仅限于 markdown 文件分析","不支持除 grep 之外的外部依赖"],"ja":["bash 環境が必要"," markdown ファイルの分析のみ対応","grep 以外の外部依赖はサポートされていない"],"ko":["bash 환경이 필요하다","markdown 파일 분석만 지원","grep 외의 외부 의존성은 지원되지 않"],"es":["Requiere entorno bash","Limitado al análisis de archivos markdown","No se admiten dependencias externas más allá de grep"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement bash","Limité à l''analyse de fichiers markdown","Aucune dépendance externe prise en charge au-delà de grep"],"de":["Benötigt bash-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Analyse von Markdown-Dateien","Keine externen Abhängigkeiten unterstützt, die über grep hinausgehen"],"pt":["Exige ambiente bash","Limitado à análise de arquivos markdown","Nenhum suporte a dependências externas além do grep"],"ru":["Требует среды bash","Ограничен анализ файлов markdown","Не поддерживаются внешние зависимости за пределами grep"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة bash","محدود إلى تحليل ملفات markdown","لا يدعم الاعتماديات الخارجية ما وراء grep"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"fbcaac30e65b2a7868959a90ae218da03c774998dfaf78b31189df0519c1cafd","qualityScore":48}');
