KI"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","configuração de markdown","copilot","claude","codex","gemini","desenvolvimento de software","produtividade","como usar tailwind-4","tailwind-4 vs outras ferramentas"],"ru":["инструменты ии","настройка markdown","copilot","claude","codex","gemini","разработка программного обеспечения","производительность","как использовать tailwind-4","tailwind-4 vs другие инструменты"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","إعداد markdown","copilot","claude","codex","gemini","تطوير البرمجيات","الإنتاجية","كيفية استخدام tailwind-4","tailwind-4 مقابل أدوات أخرى"]}},"owner":"raudyagdel","repo":"ai_setup_and_tips","repoPath":"raudyagdel/ai_setup_and_tips","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.713Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwind-4","description":">","version":"1.1","bodyPreview":"## Styling Decision Tree\n\n```\nTailwind class exists?  → className=\"...\"\nDynamic value?          → style={{ width: `${x}%` }}\nConditional styles?     → cn(\"base\", condition && \"variant\")\nStatic only?            → className=\"...\" (no cn() needed)\nLibrary can''t use class?→ style prop with var() constants\n```\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### Never Use var() in className\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ NEVER: var() in className\n<div className=\"bg-[var(--color-primary)]\" />\n<div className=\"text-[var(--text-color)]\" />\n\n//","body":"## Styling Decision Tree\n\n```\nTailwind class exists?  → className=\"...\"\nDynamic value?          → style={{ width: `${x}%` }}\nConditional styles?     → cn(\"base\", condition && \"variant\")\nStatic only?            → className=\"...\" (no cn() needed)\nLibrary can''t use class?→ style prop with var() constants\n```\n\n## Critical Rules\n\n### Never Use var() in className\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ NEVER: var() in className\n<div className=\"bg-[var(--color-primary)]\" />\n<div className=\"text-[var(--text-color)]\" />\n\n// ✅ ALWAYS: Use Tailwind semantic classes\n<div className=\"bg-primary\" />\n<div className=\"text-slate-400\" />\n```\n\n### Never Use Hex Colors\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ NEVER: Hex colors in className\n<p className=\"text-[#ffffff]\" />\n<div className=\"bg-[#1e293b]\" />\n\n// ✅ ALWAYS: Use Tailwind color classes\n<p className=\"text-white\" />\n<div className=\"bg-slate-800\" />\n```\n\n## The cn() Utility\n\n```typescript\nimport { clsx } from \"clsx\";\nimport { twMerge } from \"tailwind-merge\";\n\nexport function cn(...inputs: ClassValue[]) {\n  return twMerge(clsx(inputs));\n}\n```\n\n### When to Use cn()\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Conditional classes\n<div className={cn(\"base-class\", isActive && \"active-class\")} />\n\n// ✅ Merging with potential conflicts\n<button className={cn(\"px-4 py-2\", className)} />  // className might override\n\n// ✅ Multiple conditions\n<div className={cn(\n  \"rounded-lg border\",\n  variant === \"primary\" && \"bg-blue-500 text-white\",\n  variant === \"secondary\" && \"bg-gray-200 text-gray-800\",\n  disabled && \"opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed\"\n)} />\n```\n\n### When NOT to Use cn()\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Static classes - unnecessary wrapper\n<div className={cn(\"flex items-center gap-2\")} />\n\n// ✅ Just use className directly\n<div className=\"flex items-center gap-2\" />\n```\n\n## Style Constants for Charts/Libraries\n\nWhen libraries don''t accept className (like Recharts):\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Constants with var() - ONLY for library props\nconst CHART_COLORS = {\n  primary: \"var(--color-primary)\",\n  secondary: \"var(--color-secondary)\",\n  text: \"var(--color-text)\",\n  gridLine: \"var(--color-border)\",\n};\n\n// Usage with Recharts (can''t use className)\n<XAxis tick={{ fill: CHART_COLORS.text }} />\n<CartesianGrid stroke={CHART_COLORS.gridLine} />\n```\n\n## Dynamic Values\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ style prop for truly dynamic values\n<div style={{ width: `${percentage}%` }} />\n<div style={{ opacity: isVisible ? 1 : 0 }} />\n\n// ✅ CSS custom properties for theming\n<div style={{ \"--progress\": `${value}%` } as React.CSSProperties} />\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Flexbox\n\n```typescript\n<div className=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\" />\n<div className=\"flex flex-col gap-2\" />\n<div className=\"inline-flex items-center\" />\n```\n\n### Grid\n\n```typescript\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4\" />\n<div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\" />\n```\n\n### Spacing\n\n```typescript\n// Padding\n<div className=\"p-4\" />           // All sides\n<div className=\"px-4 py-2\" />     // Horizontal, vertical\n<div className=\"pt-4 pb-2\" />     // Top, bottom\n\n// Margin\n<div className=\"m-4\" />\n<div className=\"mx-auto\" />       // Center horizontally\n<div className=\"mt-8 mb-4\" />\n```\n\n### Typography\n\n```typescript\n<h1 className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white\" />\n<p className=\"text-sm text-slate-400\" />\n<span className=\"text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide\" />\n```\n\n### Borders & Shadows\n\n```typescript\n<div className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-700\" />\n<div className=\"rounded-full shadow-lg\" />\n<div className=\"ring-2 ring-blue-500 ring-offset-2\" />\n```\n\n### States\n\n```typescript\n<button className=\"hover:bg-blue-600 focus:ring-2 active:scale-95\" />\n<input className=\"focus:border-blue-500 focus:outline-none\" />\n<div className=\"group-hover:opacity-100\" />\n```\n\n### Responsive\n\n```typescript\n<div className=\"w-full md:w-1/2 lg:w-1/3\" />\n<div className=\"hidden md:block\" />\n<div className=\"text-sm md:text-base lg:text-lg\" />\n```\n\n### Dark Mode\n\n```typescript\n<div className=\"bg-white dark:bg-slate-900\" />\n<p className=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white\" />\n```\n\n## Arbitrary Values (Escape Hatch)\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ OK for one-off values not in design system\n<div className=\"w-[327px]\" />\n<div className=\"top-[117px]\" />\n<div className=\"grid-cols-[1fr_2fr_1fr]\" />\n\n// ❌ Don''t use for colors - use theme instead\n<div className=\"bg-[#1e293b]\" />  // NO\n```\n\n## Keywords\ntailwind, css, styling, cn, utility classes, responsive\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:46:05.785Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing streamlined CSS styling with Tailwind classes","zh":"非常适合需要简化CSS样式的前端代理，使用Tailwind类","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがストリームライン化されたCSSスタイリングをTailwindクラスで実現するのに最適","ko":"프론트엔드 에이전트가 Tailwind 클래스를 사용하여 CSS 스타일을 간소화해야 하는 경우에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de frontend que necesitan una estilización CSS optimizada con clases de Tailwind","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend nécessitant une personnalisation CSS simplifiée avec des classes Tailwind","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine optimierte CSS-Stilierung mit Tailwind-Klassen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Frontend Agents que necessitam de uma estilização de CSS simplificada com classes do Tailwind","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходим упрощенный CSS-стиль с классами Tailwind","ar":"مثالي ل Frontend Agents الذين يحتاجون إلى استيلات CSS مبسطة مع فصول Tailwind"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to dynamically style components using Tailwind classes, conditional styles with cn(), and static styles, while avoiding var() in className for compatibility with various libraries and frameworks like React","zh":"赋予代理动态样式化组件的能力，使用Tailwind类、条件样式cn()和静态样式，同时避免在className中使用var()以确保与React等各种库和框架的兼容性","ja":"エージェントがTailwindクラス、条件スタイルcn()、静的スタイルを使用してコンポーネントを動的にスタイル化できるようにし、Reactなどの様々なライブラリやフレームワークとの互換性を保つために、classNameでvar()を使用しない","ko":"에이전트가 Tailwind 클래스, 조건부 스타일 cn(), 정적 스타일을 사용하여 컴포넌트를 동적으로 스타일링 할 수 있도록 하며, React 등의 다양한 라이브러리 및 프레임워크와의 호환성을 유지하기 위해 className에서 var()를 사용하지 않음","es":"Habilita a los agentes a dar estilo a componentes de forma dinámica utilizando clases de Tailwind, estilos condicionales con cn() y estilos estáticos, evitando var() en className para mantener la compatibilidad con varias bibliotecas y frameworks como React","fr":"Permet aux agents de personnaliser dynamiquement les composants en utilisant des classes Tailwind, des styles conditionnels avec cn() et des styles statiques, tout en évitant var() dans className pour assurer la compatibilité avec diverses bibliothèques et frameworks comme React","de":"Ermöglich es den Agenten, Komponenten dynamisch mit Tailwind-Klassen, bedingten Stilen mit cn() und statischen Stilen zu stylen, während var() in className vermieden wird, um die Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Bibliotheken und Frameworks wie React zu gewährleisten","pt":"Empodera agentes a estilizar componentes dinamicamente usando classes do Tailwind, estilos condicionais com cn() e estilos estáticos, evitando var() em className para compatibilidade com bibliotecas e frameworks como React","ru":"Эмпирует агентов динамически стилизовать компоненты с помощью классов Tailwind, условных стилей с cn() и статических стилей, избегая var() в className для совместимости с библиотеками и фреймворками, такими как React","ar":"يمكن agent من استيلات组 件ات دینامیکی باستخدام Tailwind classes, styles conditionals مع cn() و styles static, evitando var() em className para compatibilidade com bibliotecas e frameworks como React"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating CSS class generation for responsive designs","Generating conditional styles for dynamic user interfaces","Debugging CSS styling issues with Tailwind''s utility-first approach"],"zh":["为响应式设计自动生成CSS类","为动态用户界面生成条件样式","使用Tailwind的实用优先方法调试CSS样式问题"],"ja":["レスポンシブデザインのCSSクラスを自動生成する","動的ユーザーインターフェイスの条件スタイルを生成する","Tailwindのユーティリティファーストアプローチを使用してCSSスタイリングの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["반응형 디자인을 위한 CSS 클래스 자동 생성","동적 사용자 인터페이스에 대한 조건부 스타일 생성","Tailwind의 유틸리티 우선 접근 방식을 사용하여 CSS 스타일링 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la generación de clases CSS para diseños responsivos","Generar estilos condicionales para interfaces de usuario dinámicas","Depurar problemas de estilización CSS con el enfoque de utilidad primero de Tailwind"],"fr":["Automatiser la génération de classes CSS pour les conceptions responsives","Générer des styles conditionnels pour les interfaces utilisateur dynamiques","Déboguer les problèmes de personnalisation CSS avec l''approche d''utilité première de Tailwind"],"de":["Automatisieren der Generierung von CSS-Klassen für responsive Designs","Generieren von bedingten Stilen für dynamische Benutzeroberflächen","Debuggen von CSS-Stilierungsproblemen mit dem utility-first-Ansatz von Tailwind"],"pt":["Automando a geração de classes CSS para designs responsivos","Gerando estilos condicionais para interfaces de usuário dinâmicas","Debugando problemas de estilização de CSS com a abordagem utility-first do Tailwind"],"ru":["Автоматизируя генерацию классов CSS для адаптивных дизайнов","Генерируя условные стили для динамических интерфейсов пользователя","Отладка проблем стилизации CSS с помощью подхода utility-first Tailwind"],"ar":["تأمل في تلقيم classes CSS ل designs responsivos","تأمل في تلقيم styles conditionals ل interfaces de usuário dinâmicas","تأمل في تلقيم проблемы de estilização de CSS com a abordagem utility-first do Tailwind"]},"limitations":{"en":["Never use var() in className","Requires understanding of Tailwind class naming conventions","Limited to applications using CSS styling"],"zh":["不应在className中使用var()","需要了解Tailwind类命名约定","仅限于使用CSS样式的应用"],"ja":["classNameでvar()を使用しない","Tailwindクラス命名規約を理解する必要がある","CSSスタイリングを使用するアプリケーションに限定される"],"ko":["className에서 var()를 사용하지 않음","Tailwind 클래스 명명 규칙을 이해해야 함","CSS 스타일링을 사용하는 애플리케이션에만 제한됨"],"es":["Nunca usar var() en className","Requiere comprensión de las convenciones de nomenclatura de clases de Tailwind","Limitado a aplicaciones que utilizan estilización CSS"],"fr":["Ne jamais utiliser var() dans className","Exige une compréhension des conventions de dénomination de classes de Tailwind","Limité aux applications utilisant la personnalisation CSS"],"de":["Niemals var() in className verwenden","Erfordert das Verständnis der Namenskonventionen von Tailwind-Klassen","Begrenzt auf Anwendungen, die CSS-Stilierung verwenden"],"pt":["Nunca use var() em className","Requer entendimento das convenções de nomeação de classes do Tailwind","Limitado a aplicações que usam estilização de CSS"],"ru":["Никогда не используйте var() в className","Требует понимания конвенций именования классов Tailwind","Ограничен для приложений, которые используют стилизацию CSS"],"ar":["لا تستخدم var() في className","يتطلب فهم Naming conventions of Tailwind classes","محدود لapplications التي تستخدم estilização de CSS"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7dbf1477e95ef24f8685a989479ea3b5c525e61d94f2ca496887cecb7ceb4c9c","qualityScore":48}');
