":["Comunicación ROS 2 sin entorno ROS2","SDK de Python para ROS 2","Integración con Zenoh","Uso efectivo de ROS 2","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas"],"fr":["Communication ROS 2 sans environnement ROS2","SDK Python pour ROS 2","Intégration avec Zenoh","Utilisation efficace de ROS 2","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Kommunikation ROS 2 ohne ROS2-Umgebung","Python-SDK für ROS 2","Integration mit Zenoh","Effektive Verwendung von ROS 2","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicações ROS 2 sem ambiente ROS2","Utilização do Python SDK via Zenoh","Criação de exemplos e projetos com ROS 2","Integração com outros frameworks e bibliotecas","Suporte a múltiplos sistemas operacionais"],"ru":["Разработка приложений ROS 2 без среды ROS2","Использование Python SDK через Zenoh","Создание примеров и проектов с ROS 2","Интеграция с другими фреймворками и библиотеками","Поддержка нескольких операционных систем"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات ROS 2 بدون بيئة ROS2","استخدام SDK بايثون عبر Zenoh","إنشاء أمثلة ومشاريع مع ROS 2","التكامل مع إطارات عمل وиблиوتيكات أخرى","دعم أنظمة تشغيل متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Create Example","什么是ROS 2通信","Create Example安装","Create Example设置指南","ROS 2通信教程","Python SDK使用","Zenoh数据传输","Create Example替代品","Create Example vs ROS2"],"ja":["Create Exampleの使用方法","ROS 2通信とは","Create Exampleのインストール","Create Exampleの設定ガイド","ROS 2通信チュートリアル","Python SDKの使用","Zenohデータ転送","Create Exampleの代替","Create Example vs ROS2"],"ko":["Create Example 사용 방법","ROS 2 통신이란","Create Example 설치","Create Example 설정 가이드","ROS 2 통신 튜토리얼","Python SDK 사용","Zenoh 데이터 전송","Create Example 대체","Create Example vs ROS2"],"es":["ROS 2","Zenoh","SDK de Python","Agente de inteligencia artificial","Cómo utilizar ROS 2","ROS 2 vs ROS","Instalación de ROS 2","Guía de configuración de ROS 2"],"fr":["ROS 2","Zenoh","SDK Python","Agent IA","Comment utiliser ROS 2","ROS 2 vs ROS","Installation de ROS 2","Guide de configuration de ROS 2"],"de":["ROS 2","Zenoh","Python-SDK","KI-Agent","Wie man ROS 2 verwendet","ROS 2 vs ROS","Installation von ROS 2","Konfigurationsanleitung für ROS 2"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","python sdk para ros 2","desenvolvimento de aplicações ros 2","zenoh","ros 2 sem ambiente ros2","criar exemplos com python","guias de instalação do python sdk","alternativas ao ros2"],"ru":["ии агенты","python sdk для ros 2","разработка приложений ros 2","zenoh","ros 2 без среды ros2","создание примеров с python","руководства по установке python sdk","альтернативы ros2"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","python sdk لros 2","تطوير تطبيقات ros 2","zenoh","ros 2 بدون بيئة ros2","إنشاء أمثلة باستخدام بايثون","دلائل تركيب python sdk","بديلات ros2"]}},"owner":"ROBOTIS-GIT","repo":"zenoh_ros2_sdk","repoPath":"ROBOTIS-GIT/zenoh_ros2_sdk","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.721Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-example","description":"Create new publish/subscribe examples for ROS2 message types. Use when the user wants to add a new example, create pub/sub for a new message type, or add trajectory/sensor/geometry message examples.","bodyPreview":"# Create Example\n\nThis skill guides you through creating new publish/subscribe examples for the zenoh-ros2-sdk.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User wants to add a new example for a message type\n- User wants to create publisher/subscriber for a new ROS2 message\n- Adding support for trajectory, sensor, geometry, or other message types\n\n## Project Structure\n\nExamples are in `examples/` with numbered filenames:\n- Odd numbers: publishers (e.g., `11_publish_*.py`)\n- Even numbers: subscribers (e.g., `12_subscribe_","body":"# Create Example\n\nThis skill guides you through creating new publish/subscribe examples for the zenoh-ros2-sdk.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User wants to add a new example for a message type\n- User wants to create publisher/subscriber for a new ROS2 message\n- Adding support for trajectory, sensor, geometry, or other message types\n\n## Project Structure\n\nExamples are in `examples/` with numbered filenames:\n- Odd numbers: publishers (e.g., `11_publish_*.py`)\n- Even numbers: subscribers (e.g., `12_subscribe_*.py`)\n\n## 1. Determine Next Example Numbers\n\nCheck existing examples in `examples/` directory. Use the next available odd number for publisher, next even for subscriber.\n\n## 2. Look Up Message Definition\n\nFind the ROS2 message definition. Key resources:\n- https://docs.ros2.org/foxy/api/{package}/msg/{MessageName}.html\n- Common packages: `std_msgs`, `geometry_msgs`, `sensor_msgs`, `trajectory_msgs`, `nav_msgs`\n\n## 3. Publisher Template\n\nCreate `examples/{NN}_publish_{msg_name}.py`:\n\n```python\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\n{NN} - Publish {MessageName} Messages\n\nDemonstrates how to publish {package}/msg/{MessageName} messages to a ROS2 topic.\n{Brief description of what this message type is used for.}\n\"\"\"\nimport time\nimport numpy as np\n\nfrom zenoh_ros2_sdk import ROS2Publisher, get_message_class\n\n\ndef main():\n    print(\"{NN} - Publish {MessageName} Messages\")\n    print(\"Publishing to /{topic_name} topic...\\n\")\n\n    # Get message classes for easy object creation\n    Header = get_message_class(\"std_msgs/msg/Header\")\n    Time = get_message_class(\"builtin_interfaces/msg/Time\")\n    {MessageName} = get_message_class(\"{package}/msg/{MessageName}\")\n    # Add nested message classes as needed\n\n    if not all([Header, Time, {MessageName}]):\n        print(\"Error: Failed to get message classes\")\n        return\n\n    # Create publisher\n    pub = ROS2Publisher(\n        topic=\"/{topic_name}\",\n        msg_type=\"{package}/msg/{MessageName}\"\n    )\n\n    try:\n        print(\"Publishing {MessageName} messages...\")\n        print(\"Press Ctrl+C to stop\\n\")\n\n        counter = 0\n        while True:\n            # Get current time\n            now = time.time()\n            sec = int(now)\n            nanosec = int((now - sec) * 1e9)\n\n            # Create header with timestamp\n            header = Header(\n                stamp=Time(sec=sec, nanosec=nanosec),\n                frame_id=\"base_link\"\n            )\n\n            # Create and populate message fields\n            # Note: Arrays need to be numpy arrays for proper serialization\n\n            # Publish message - pass fields as kwargs matching message structure\n            pub.publish(\n                header=header,\n                # ... other fields\n            )\n\n            print(f\"Published {MessageName} {counter}\")\n            counter += 1\n            time.sleep(0.1)  # 10 Hz\n\n    except KeyboardInterrupt:\n        print(\"\\nInterrupted by user\")\n    finally:\n        pub.close()\n        print(\"Publisher closed\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 4. Subscriber Template\n\nCreate `examples/{NN+1}_subscribe_{msg_name}.py`:\n\n```python\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"\n{NN+1} - Subscribe to {MessageName} Messages\n\nDemonstrates how to subscribe to a ROS2 topic and receive {package}/msg/{MessageName} messages.\n{Brief description of what this message type is used for.}\n\"\"\"\nimport time\n\nfrom zenoh_ros2_sdk import ROS2Subscriber\n\n\ndef main():\n    print(\"{NN+1} - Subscribe to {MessageName} Messages\")\n    print(\"Subscribing to /{topic_name} topic...\\n\")\n\n    message_count = [0]  # Use list to allow modification in nested function\n\n    def on_message(msg):\n        \"\"\"Callback function called when a {MessageName} message is received.\"\"\"\n        message_count[0] += 1\n\n        # Extract information from the message\n        timestamp = msg.header.stamp\n        frame_id = msg.header.frame_id\n        # ... extract other fields\n\n        # Display received data\n        print(f\"\\n--- {MessageName} Message #{message_count[0]} ---\")\n        print(f\"Timestamp: {timestamp.sec}.{timestamp.nanosec:09d}\")\n        print(f\"Frame ID: {frame_id}\")\n        # ... print other fields\n\n    # Create subscriber\n    sub = ROS2Subscriber(\n        topic=\"/{topic_name}\",\n        msg_type=\"{package}/msg/{MessageName}\",\n        callback=on_message\n    )\n\n    try:\n        print(\"Waiting for {MessageName} messages... Press Ctrl+C to stop\")\n        while True:\n            time.sleep(0.1)\n    except KeyboardInterrupt:\n        print(\"\\nInterrupted by user\")\n    finally:\n        sub.close()\n        print(\"Subscriber closed\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\n## 5. Update README\n\nAdd entries to `examples/README.md`:\n\n```markdown\n### [`{NN}_publish_{msg_name}.py`]({NN}_publish_{msg_name}.py)\nDemonstrates how to publish `{package}/msg/{MessageName}` messages. {Description}.\n\n**Usage:**\n\\```bash\npython3 examples/{NN}_publish_{msg_name}.py\n\\```\n\n### [`{NN+1}_subscribe_{msg_name}.py`]({NN+1}_subscribe_{msg_name}.py)\nDemonstrates how to subscribe to `{package}/msg/{MessageName}` messages. {Description}.\n\n**Usage:**\n\\```bash\npython3 examples/{NN+1}_subscribe_{msg_name}.py\n\\```\n```\n\n## 6. Key Patterns\n\n### Arrays\nUse numpy arrays for proper CDR serialization:\n```python\npositions = np.array([0.0, 0.1, 0.2], dtype=np.float64)\n```\n\n### Nested Messages\nGet nested message classes and construct them:\n```python\nPoint = get_message_class(\"trajectory_msgs/msg/JointTrajectoryPoint\")\nDuration = get_message_class(\"builtin_interfaces/msg/Duration\")\n\npoint = Point(\n    positions=np.array([0.0, 0.1], dtype=np.float64),\n    time_from_start=Duration(sec=1, nanosec=0)\n)\n```\n\n### Common Topic Names\n- `/joint_states` - JointState\n- `/cmd_vel` - Twist\n- `/joint_trajectory` - JointTrajectory\n- `/odom` - Odometry\n- `/tf` - TransformStamped\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:51:43.626Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for ROS 2 Development Agents needing seamless Zenoh communication via Python SDK","zh":"非常适合需要通过Python SDK实现ROS 2开发代理与Zenoh无缝通信的场景","ja":"ROS 2開発エージェントがPython SDKを介してZenohとシームレスに通信する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"Python SDK를 통해 Zenoh와의無縫 통신이 필요한 ROS 2 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de ROS 2 que necesitan una comunicación Zenoh sin problemas a través de Python SDK","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ROS 2 nécessitant une communication Zenoh transparente via Python SDK","de":"Perfekt für ROS 2-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine nahtlose Zenoh-Kommunikation über Python SDK benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento do ROS 2 que precisam de uma comunicação Zenoh sem problemas via Python SDK","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки ROS 2, которым требуется бесперебойная связь Zenoh через Python SDK","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النمطية ROS 2 الذين يحتاجون إلى اتصال Zenoh بدون مشاكل عبر Python SDK"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create publish/subscribe examples for various ROS2 message types, including trajectory, sensor, and geometry, using the zenoh-ros2-sdk, facilitating efficient communication without a ROS2 environment","zh":"赋予代理创建各种ROS2消息类型（包括轨迹、传感器和几何）的发布/订阅示例的能力，使用zenoh-ros2-sdk，无需ROS2环境即可实现高效的通信","ja":"エージェントがzenoh-ros2-sdkを使用して、トラジェクトリ、センサー、幾何学などのさまざまなROS2メッセージタイプのパブリッシュ/サブスクライブの例を作成できるようにし、ROS2環境を必要とせずに効率的な通信を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 zenoh-ros2-sdk를 사용하여 다양한 ROS2 메시지 유형(트라젝토리, 센서, 기하학 등)의 发布/订阅 예를 만들 수 있도록 하여, ROS2 환경 없이 효율적인 통신을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear ejemplos de publicación/suscripción para varios tipos de mensajes ROS2, incluyendo trayectoria, sensor y geometría, utilizando el zenoh-ros2-sdk, lo que facilita una comunicación eficiente sin un entorno ROS2","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des exemples de publication/abonnement pour différents types de messages ROS2, notamment la trajectoire, le capteur et la géométrie, en utilisant le zenoh-ros2-sdk, ce qui facilite une communication efficace sans environnement ROS2","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Veröffentlichungs-/Abonnentenbeispiele für verschiedene ROS2-Nachrichtentypen zu erstellen, einschließlic