的无缝请求路由，支持标准JSON响应和实时令牌流","ja":"Docker AIエージェントスキルは、LLMバックエンドのリクエストルーティングをシームレスに実現します","ko":"Docker AI 에이전트 스킬은 LLM 后端의 요청 라우팅을 無縫적으로 구현합니다","es":"LLMProxy maneja solicitudes de modelos de lenguaje con Docker, permitiendo respuestas JSON y streaming en tiempo real","fr":"LLMProxy gère les requêtes de modèles de langage avec Docker, permettant des réponses JSON et un streaming en temps réel","de":"LLMProxy verwaltet Anfragen von Sprachmodellen mit Docker, ermöglicht JSON-Antworten und Echtzeit-Streaming","pt":"O Docker permite a roteação de solicitações para backends de LLM de forma eficiente com LLMProxy","ru":"Docker позволяет эффективно маршрутизировать запросы к бэкэндам LLM с помощью LLMProxy","ar":"يسمح Docker بتوجيه الطلبات إلى الخوادم الخلفية ل LLM بفعالية باستخدام LLMProxy","en":"Seamlessly route requests to your LLM backends—whether you''re using stream=false for standard JSON responses or stream=true for real-time token streaming via..."},"definition":{"en":"Seamlessly route requests to your LLM backends—whether you''re using stream=false for standard JSON responses or stream=true for real-time token streaming via Server-Sent Events (SSE). LLMProxy handles both modes out of the box, with zero buffering on streams, intelligent load balancing, and OpenAI-compatible API routing."},"features":{"zh":["支持标准JSON响应","支持实时令牌流","智能负载均衡","OpenAI兼容API路由"],"ja":["標準JSONレスポンスのサポート","リアルタイムトークンストリーミングのサポート","インテリジェントな負荷分散","OpenAI互換APIルーティング"],"ko":["표준 JSON 응답 지원","실시간 토큰 스트리밍 지원","지능형 로드 밸런싱","OpenAI 호환 API 라우팅"],"es":["Enrutamiento de solicitudes a backends de LLM","Compatibilidad con respuestas JSON y streaming en tiempo real","Equilibrio de carga inteligente","Enrutamiento de API compatible con OpenAI"],"fr":["Acheminement des requêtes vers les backends de LLM","Compatibilité avec les réponses JSON et le streaming en temps réel","Équilibrage de charge intelligent","Acheminement d''API compatible avec OpenAI"],"de":["Weiterleitung von Anfragen an LLM-Backends","Unterstützung für JSON-Antworten und Echtzeit-Streaming","Intelligente Lastverteilung","OpenAI-kompatibles API-Weiterleitung"],"pt":["Roteamento de solicitações para backends de LLM","Suporte a stream=false e stream=true","Balanceamento de carga inteligente","Compatibilidade com API do OpenAI"],"ru":["Маршрутизация запросов к бэкэндам LLM","Поддержка stream=false и stream=true","Интеллектуальное балансирование нагрузки","Совместимость с API OpenAI"],"ar":["توجيه الطلبات إلى الخوادم الخلفية ل LLM","دعم stream=false و stream=true","توزع حمولة ذكي","توافق مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات OpenAI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Docker AI代理技能","LLM后端请求路由","标准JSON响应","实时令牌流","智能负载均衡","OpenAI兼容API路由","如何使用Docker AI代理技能","Docker AI代理技能安装"],"ja":["Docker AIエージェントスキル","LLMバックエンドのリクエストルーティング","標準JSONレスポンス","リアルタイムトークンストリーミング","インテリジェントな負荷分散","OpenAI互換APIルーティング","Docker AIエージェントスキルの使い方","Docker AIエージェントスキルのインストール"],"ko":["Docker AI 에이전트 스킬","LLM 后端의 요청 라우팅","표준 JSON 응답","실시간 토큰 스트리밍","지능형 로드 밸런싱","OpenAI 호환 API 라우팅","Docker AI 에이전트 스킬 사용법","Docker AI 에이전트 스킬 설치"],"es":["cómo usar Docker con LLMProxy","qué es LLMProxy","Docker vs Kubernetes","instalación de Docker","guía de configuración de LLMProxy","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser Docker avec LLMProxy","quoi est LLMProxy","Docker vs Kubernetes","installation de Docker","guide de configuration de LLMProxy","outils d''IA pour développeurs"],"de":["wie man Docker mit LLMProxy verwendet","was ist LLMProxy","Docker vs Kubernetes","Docker-Installation","LLMProxy-Konfigurationsanleitung","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","docker para llmproxy","roteamento de solicitações","llmproxy alternative","llmproxy vs openai","instalar llmproxy","guia de configuração do llmproxy"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","docker для llmproxy","маршрутизация запросов","альтернатива llmproxy","llmproxy vs openai","установить llmproxy","руководство по настройке llmproxy"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","docker ل llmproxy","توجيه الطلبات","بديل llmproxy","llmproxy مقابل openai","تثبيت llmproxy","دليل إعداد llmproxy"]}},"owner":"aiyuekuang","repo":"LLMProxy","repoPath":"aiyuekuang/LLMProxy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.855Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"docker","description":"Docker and containerization best practices. Use for Dockerfile creation, docker-compose, multi-stage builds, and container optimization.","bodyPreview":"# Docker Skill\n\nContainer best practices for development, building, and deployment.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing Dockerfiles\n- Configuring docker-compose\n- Optimizing container images\n- Container security\n- Multi-stage builds\n\n---\n\n# 📦 Dockerfile Best Practices\n\n## Multi-Stage Build (Go)\n\n```dockerfile\n# Build stage\nFROM golang:1.22-alpine AS builder\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\n# Cache dependencies\nCOPY go.mod go.sum ./\nRUN go mod download\n\n# Build\nCOPY . .\nRUN CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=linux go build -ld","body":"# Docker Skill\n\nContainer best practices for development, building, and deployment.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Writing Dockerfiles\n- Configuring docker-compose\n- Optimizing container images\n- Container security\n- Multi-stage builds\n\n---\n\n# 📦 Dockerfile Best Practices\n\n## Multi-Stage Build (Go)\n\n```dockerfile\n# Build stage\nFROM golang:1.22-alpine AS builder\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\n# Cache dependencies\nCOPY go.mod go.sum ./\nRUN go mod download\n\n# Build\nCOPY . .\nRUN CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=linux go build -ldflags=\"-w -s\" -o /app/server ./cmd/main.go\n\n# Runtime stage\nFROM alpine:3.19\n\nRUN apk --no-cache add ca-certificates tzdata\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\n# Copy binary from builder\nCOPY --from=builder /app/server .\nCOPY --from=builder /app/config.yaml .\n\n# Non-root user\nRUN adduser -D -g '''' appuser\nUSER appuser\n\nEXPOSE 8080\n\nENTRYPOINT [\"./server\"]\n```\n\n## Multi-Stage Build (Node.js)\n\n```dockerfile\n# Dependencies stage\nFROM node:20-alpine AS deps\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY package.json yarn.lock ./\nRUN yarn install --frozen-lockfile\n\n# Build stage\nFROM node:20-alpine AS builder\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY --from=deps /app/node_modules ./node_modules\nCOPY . .\nRUN yarn build\n\n# Runtime stage\nFROM node:20-alpine AS runner\nWORKDIR /app\n\nENV NODE_ENV=production\n\nRUN addgroup -g 1001 -S nodejs\nRUN adduser -S nextjs -u 1001\n\nCOPY --from=builder /app/public ./public\nCOPY --from=builder --chown=nextjs:nodejs /app/.next/standalone ./\nCOPY --from=builder --chown=nextjs:nodejs /app/.next/static ./.next/static\n\nUSER nextjs\n\nEXPOSE 3000\nENV PORT 3000\n\nCMD [\"node\", \"server.js\"]\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🔧 Layer Optimization\n\n## Order Matters\n\n```dockerfile\n# ✅ Good: Least changing files first\nCOPY go.mod go.sum ./\nRUN go mod download\n\nCOPY . .\nRUN go build -o app\n\n# ❌ Bad: COPY all invalidates cache\nCOPY . .\nRUN go mod download\nRUN go build -o app\n```\n\n## Reduce Layers\n\n```dockerfile\n# ❌ Bad: Multiple RUN commands\nRUN apt-get update\nRUN apt-get install -y curl\nRUN apt-get install -y git\nRUN rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*\n\n# ✅ Good: Single RUN command\nRUN apt-get update && \\\n    apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \\\n        curl \\\n        git && \\\n    rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*\n```\n\n## Use .dockerignore\n\n```dockerignore\n# Git\n.git\n.gitignore\n\n# Dependencies\nnode_modules\nvendor\n\n# Build artifacts\ndist\nbuild\n*.exe\n\n# Development files\n*.md\n*.log\n.env.local\n.vscode\n.idea\n\n# Tests\n*_test.go\n__tests__\ncoverage\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🐳 Docker Compose\n\n## Development Setup\n\n```yaml\nversion: ''3.8''\n\nservices:\n  app:\n    build:\n      context: .\n      dockerfile: Dockerfile.dev\n    ports:\n      - \"8080:8080\"\n    volumes:\n      - .:/app\n      - /app/node_modules  # Exclude node_modules\n    environment:\n      - DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:pass@db:5432/app\n      - REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379\n    depends_on:\n      db:\n        condition: service_healthy\n      redis:\n        condition: service_started\n\n  db:\n    image: postgres:16-alpine\n    environment:\n      POSTGRES_USER: user\n      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: pass\n      POSTGRES_DB: app\n    volumes:\n      - postgres_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data\n    ports:\n      - \"5432:5432\"\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD-SHELL\", \"pg_isready -U user -d app\"]\n      interval: 5s\n      timeout: 5s\n      retries: 5\n\n  redis:\n    image: redis:7-alpine\n    ports:\n      - \"6379:6379\"\n    volumes:\n      - redis_data:/data\n\nvolumes:\n  postgres_data:\n  redis_data:\n```\n\n## Production Setup\n\n```yaml\nversion: ''3.8''\n\nservices:\n  app:\n    image: ${REGISTRY}/app:${VERSION}\n    deploy:\n      replicas: 3\n      resources:\n        limits:\n          cpus: ''1''\n          memory: 512M\n        reservations:\n          cpus: ''0.5''\n          memory: 256M\n      restart_policy:\n        condition: on-failure\n        delay: 5s\n        max_attempts: 3\n    environment:\n      - DATABASE_URL=${DATABASE_URL}\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD\", \"curl\", \"-f\", \"http://localhost:8080/health\"]\n      interval: 30s\n      timeout: 10s\n      retries: 3\n      start_period: 40s\n    logging:\n      driver: \"json-file\"\n      options:\n        max-size: \"10m\"\n        max-file: \"3\"\n\n  nginx:\n    image: nginx:alpine\n    ports:\n      - \"80:80\"\n      - \"443:443\"\n    volumes:\n      - ./nginx.conf:/etc/nginx/nginx.conf:ro\n      - ./certs:/etc/nginx/certs:ro\n    depends_on:\n      - app\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🔒 Security\n\n## Run as Non-Root\n\n```dockerfile\n# Create non-root user\nRUN addgroup -g 1001 -S appgroup && \\\n    adduser -u 1001 -S appuser -G appgroup\n\n# Change ownership\nCOPY --chown=appuser:appgroup . .\n\n# Switch to non-root user\nUSER appuser\n```\n\n## Scan for Vulnerabilities\n\n```bash\n# Using Docker Scout\ndocker scout cves myimage:latest\n\n# Using Trivy\ntrivy image myimage:latest\n\n# Using Snyk\nsnyk container test myimage:latest\n```\n\n## Read-Only Filesystem\n\n```yaml\nservices:\n  app:\n    read_only: true\n    tmpfs:\n      - /tmp\n      - /var/run\n```\n\n---\n\n# 📊 Health Checks\n\n```dockerfile\nHEALTHCHECK --interval=30s --timeout=10s --start-period=5s --retries=3 \\\n  CMD curl -f http://localhost:8080/health || exit 1\n```\n\n```go\n// Health endpoint\nfunc (h *Handler) Health(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n    checks := map[string]string{\n        \"database\": h.checkDB(),\n        \"redis\":    h.checkRedis(),\n    }\n    \n    healthy := true\n    for _, status := range checks {\n        if status != \"ok\" {\n            healthy = false\n            break\n        }\n    }\n    \n    if healthy {\n        w.WriteHeader(http.StatusOK)\n    } else {\n        w.WriteHeader(http.StatusServiceUnavailable)\n    }\n    json.NewEncoder(w).Encode(checks)\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🛠️ Useful Commands\n\n```bash\n# Build\ndocker build -t myapp:latest .\ndocker build --no-cache -t myapp:latest .  # Fresh build\n\n# Run\ndocker run -d -p 8080:8080 --name myapp myapp:latest\ndocker run --rm -it myapp:latest /bin/sh  # Interactive\n\n# Logs\ndocker logs -f myapp\ndocker logs --tail 100 myapp\n\n# Exec into container\ndocker exec -it myapp /bin/sh\n\n# Cleanup\ndocker system prune -a  # Remove all unused\ndocker volume prune     # Remove unused volumes\ndocker image prune      # Remove dangling images\n\n# Inspect\ndocker stats            # Resource usage\ndocker inspect myapp    # Container details\ndocker history myapp    # Image layers\n```\n\n---\n\n# 📚 References\n\n- [Docker Best Practices](https://docs.docker.com/develop/develop-images/dockerfile_best-practices/)\n- [Docker Security](https://docs.docker.com/engine/security/)\n- [dmmulroy/cloudflare-skill](https://github.com/dmmulroy/cloudflare-skill)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:51:12.257Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps Agents requiring containerization and efficient deployment of applications using Dockerfiles and docker-compose.","zh":"适用于需要容器化和使用Dockerfiles及docker-compose高效部署应用程序的DevOps代理。","ja":"Dockerfilesおよびdocker-composeを使用したコンテナ化およびアプリケーションの効率的なデプロイを必要とするDevOpsエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Dockerfiles 및 docker-compose를 사용하여 컨테이너화 및 애플리케이션의 효율적인 배포가 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que requieren contenedorización y despliegue eficiente de aplicaciones utilizando Dockerfiles y docker-compose.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps nécessitant une conteneurisation et un déploiement efficace d''applications à l''aide de Dockerfiles et docker-compose.","de":"Ideal für DevOps-Agents, die eine Containterisierung und einen effizienten Einsatz von Anwendungen mithilfe von Dockerfiles und docker-compose erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes DevOps que exigem contêinerização e implantação eficiente de aplicações usando Dockerfiles e docker-compose.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, требующих контейнеризации и эффективного развертывания приложений с помощью Dockerfiles и docker-compose.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل DevOps التي تتطلب حاويات وتركيب تطبيقات فعال باستخدام Dockerfiles و docker-compose."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline container development, building, and deployment with best practices for Dockerfiles, intelligent load balancing, and multi-stage builds using protocols like Server-Sent Events (SSE) for real-time token streaming.","zh":"赋予代理流线型容器开发、构建和部署的能力，遵循Dockerfiles的最佳实践，智能负载均衡，并使用诸如Server-Sent Events (SSE)的协议进行实时令牌流式传输，支持多阶段构建。","ja":"エージェントに、Dockerfilesのベストプラクティスに従ったコンテナ開発、ビルド、デプロイのストリーミング、インテリジェントな負荷分散、およびServer-Sent Events (SSE)などのプロトコルを使用したリアルタイムトークンストリーミング、そしてマルチステージビルドをサポートする機能を付与します。","ko":"에이전트에 Dockerfiles의 모범 사례를 따르는 컨테이너 개발, 빌드 및 배포의 스트리밍, 지능형 부하 분산 및 Server-Sent Events(SSE)와 같은 프로토콜을 사용한 실시간 토큰 스트리밍, 그리고 멀티 스테이지 빌드를 지원하는 기능을 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar el desarrollo, la creación y el despliegue de contenedores con las mejores prácticas para Dockerfiles, equilibrio de carga inteligente y compilaciones multietapa utilizando protocolos como Server-Sent Events (SSE) para la transmisión de tokens en tiempo real.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rationaliser le développement, la construction et le déploiement de conteneurs avec les meilleures pratiques pour les Dockerfiles, l''équilibrage de charge intelligent et les builds multietapas en utilisant des protocoles comme Server-Sent Events (SSE) pour le streaming de jetons en temps réel.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die Containerentwicklung, -erstellung und -bereitstellung mit den besten Praktiken für Dockerfiles, intelligenter Lastverteilung und Mehrstufenbuilds unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie Server-Sent Events (SSE) für Echtzeit-Token-Streaming zu optimieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar o desenvolvimento de contêineres, compilação e implantação com as melhores práticas para Dockerfiles, balanceamento de carga inteligente e compilações em várias etapas usando protocolos como Server-Sent Events (SSE) para transmissão de tokens em tempo real.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать разработку контейнеров, сборку и развертывание с использованием лучших практик для Dockerfiles, интеллектуального балансирования нагрузки и сборки в несколько этапов с использованием протоколов, таких как Server-Sent Events (SSE) для потоковой передачи токенов в режиме реального времени.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من简ification وتطوير الحاويات وإنشائها وتركيبها بأفضل الممارسات لملفات Docker وتركيب الحمل الذكي والبناء المتعدد المراحل باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل Server-Sent Events (SSE) لنقل الرموز في الوقت الفعلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Writing optimized Dockerfiles for Go applications","Configuring and managing docker-compose for multi-container deployments","Optimizing container images for reduced size and improved security","Implementing container security best practices","Utilizing multi-stage builds for efficient application packaging"],"zh":["为Go应用程序编写优化的Dockerfiles","配置和管理docker-compose以进行多容器部署","优化容器镜像以减小大小和提高安全性","实施容器安全的最佳实践","使用多阶段构建进行高效的应用程序打包"],"ja":["Goアプリケーション用の最適化されたDockerfilesの作成","docker-composeの設定と管理によるマルチコンテナデプロイ","コンテナイメージの最適化によるサイズの削減とセキュリティの向上","コンテナセキュリティのベストプラクティスの実施","マルチステージビルドを使用した効率的なアプリケーションパッケージング"],"ko":["Go 애플리케이션을 위한 최적화된 Dockerfiles 작성","docker-compose 설정 및 관리를 통한 멀티 컨테이너 배포","컨테이너 이미지 최적화를 통한 크기 감소 및 보안성 향상","컨테이너 보안 모범 사례 구현","멀티 스테이지 빌드를 통한 효율적인 애플리케이션 패키징"],"es":["Escribir Dockerfiles optimizados para aplicaciones Go","Configurar y administrar docker-compose para despliegues de contenedores múltiples","Optimizar imágenes de contenedores para reducir el tamaño y mejorar la seguridad","Implementar las mejores prácticas de seguridad de contenedores","Utilizar compilaciones multietapa para un empaquetado de aplicaciones eficiente"],"fr":["Écrire des Dockerfiles optimisés pour les applications Go","Configurer et gérer docker-compose pour les déploiements de conteneurs multiples","Optimiser les images de conteneurs pour réduire la taille et améliorer la sécurité","Mettre en œuvre les meilleures pratiques de sécurité des conteneurs","Utiliser des builds multietapas pour un empaquetage d''applications efficace"],"de":["Optimierte Dockerfiles für Go-Anwendungen schreiben","Konfigurieren und Verwalten von docker-compose für Mehrcontainer-Bereitstellungen","Container-Images optimieren, um die Größe zu reduzieren und die Sicherheit zu verbessern","Die besten Praktiken für die Containerrichtlinie implementieren","Mehrstufige Builds verwenden, um eine effiziente Anwendungspackaging zu ermöglichen"],"pt":["Escrita de Dockerfiles otimizados para aplicações Go","Configuração e gerenciamento de docker-compose para implantações de contêineres múltiplos","Otimização de imagens de contêiner para tamanho reduzido e segurança aprimorada","Implementação de práticas de segurança de contêiner","Utilização de compilações em várias etapas para embalagem de aplicações eficiente"],"ru":["Написание оптимизированных Dockerfiles для приложений Go","Настройка и управление docker-compose для развертывания нескольких контейнеров","Оптимизация образов контейнеров для уменьшения размера и улучшения безопасности","Реализация лучших практик безопасности контейнеров","Использование сборки в несколько этапов для эффективной упаковки приложений"],"ar":["كتابة Dockerfiles محسّنة للتطبيقات Go","تهيئة وإدارة docker-compose لتركيب حاويات متعددة","تحسين صور الحاويات لتحقيق حجم مخفّض وتحسين الأمان","تنفيذ ممارسات أمان الحاويات","استخدام عمليات البناء المتعددة المراحل لتحقيق تجميع تطبيقات فعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Docker installation and configuration","Dependent on specific base images like golang:1.22-alpine for builds"],"zh":["需要Docker的安装和配置","依赖于特定的基准镜像，如golang:1.22-alpine用于构建"],"ja":["Dockerのインストールと設定が必要","特定のベースイメージ（例：golang:1.22-alpine）に依存してビルドする"],"ko":["Docker 설치 및 구성이 필요","特정 베이스 이미지(golang:1.22-alpine 등) 에 의존하여 빌드"],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de Docker","Dependiente de imágenes base específicas como golang:1.22-alpine para compilaciones"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation et la configuration de Docker","Dépend de images de base spécifiques comme golang:1.22-alpine pour les builds"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation und Konfiguration von Docker","Abhängig von bestimmten Basisbildern wie golang:1.22-alpine für Builds"],"pt":["Exige instalação e configuração do Docker","Depende de imagens base específicas, como golang:1.22-alpine, para compilações"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки Docker","Зависит от конкретных базовых изображений, таких как golang:1.22-alpine, для сборки"],"ar":["يتطلب تركيب وتهيئة Docker","يعتمد على صور قاعدة محددة، مثل golang:1.22-alpine، للبناء"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a5b8a7bb8b36a74334248ee523ec338cbe966c98f197c7dddf0bc2b342fcfcd1","qualityScore":48}');
