iewModel","Generación de campos para la vista","Compatibilidad con Swift","Facilidad de uso y configuración"],"fr":["Prise en charge de macOS, iOS, Windows et Linux","Implémentation du modèle Model-View-ViewModel","Génération de champs pour la vue","Compatibilité avec Swift","Facilité d''utilisation et de configuration"],"de":["Unterstützung für macOS, iOS, Windows und Linux","Implementierung des Musters Model-View-ViewModel","Generierung von Feldern für die Ansicht","Kompatibilität mit Swift","Einfachheit bei der Verwendung und Konfiguration"],"pt":["Suporte ao padrão Model-View-ViewModel","Compatibilidade com macOS, iOS, Windows e Linux","Desenvolvimento em Swift","Facilita a criação de aplicações","Melhora a organização do código"],"ru":["Поддержка шаблона Model-View-ViewModel","Совместимость с macOS, iOS, Windows и Linux","Разработка на Swift","Облегчает создание приложений","Улучшает организацию кода"],"ar":["دعم لنمط Model-View-ViewModel","توافق مع ماك، iOS، Windows، Linux","التطوير باستخدام Swift","تسهيل إنشاء التطبيقات","تحسين تنظيم الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Fosmvvm-Fields-Generator","Model-View-ViewModel模式","Swift库","macOS开发","iOS开发","Windows开发","Linux开发","如何使用Fosmvvm-Fields-Generator","Fosmvvm-Fields-Generator教程"],"ja":["Fosmvvm-Fields-Generator","Model-View-ViewModelパターン","Swiftライブラリ","macOS開発","iOS開発","Windows開発","Linux開発","Fosmvvm-Fields-Generatorの使い方","Fosmvvm-Fields-Generatorチュートリアル"],"ko":["Fosmvvm-Fields-Generator","모델-뷰-뷰 모델 패턴","Swift 라이브러리","macOS 개발","iOS 개발","Windows 개발","Linux 개발","Fosmvvm-Fields-Generator 사용법","Fosmvvm-Fields-Generator 튜토리얼"],"es":["herramientas de AI para Swift","fosmvvm-fields-generator tutorial","patrón Model-View-ViewModel en Swift","alternativas a fosmvvm-fields-generator","cómo usar fosmvvm-fields-generator","instalación de fosmvvm-fields-generator","guía de configuración de fosmvvm-fields-generator"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour Swift","tutoriel fosmvvm-fields-generator","modèle Model-View-ViewModel en Swift","alternatives à fosmvvm-fields-generator","comment utiliser fosmvvm-fields-generator","installation de fosmvvm-fields-generator","guide de configuration de fosmvvm-fields-generator"],"de":["KI-Tools für Swift","fosmvvm-fields-generator-Tutorial","Muster Model-View-ViewModel in Swift","Alternativen zu fosmvvm-fields-generator","wie man fosmvvm-fields-generator verwendet","Installation von fosmvvm-fields-generator","Konfigurationsanleitung für fosmvvm-fields-generator"],"pt":["como usar fosmvvm-fields-generator","o que é Model-View-ViewModel","fosmvvm-fields-generator alternativa","fosmvvm-fields-generator vs outros frameworks","instalar fosmvvm-fields-generator","guia de configuração do fosmvvm-fields-generator"],"ru":["как использовать fosmvvm-fields-generator","что такое Model-View-ViewModel","fosmvvm-fields-generator альтернатива","fosmvvm-fields-generator vs другие фреймворки","установить fosmvvm-fields-generator","руководство по настройке fosmvvm-fields-generator"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام fosmvvm-fields-generator","ما هو نمط Model-View-ViewModel","fosmvvm-fields-generator بديل","fosmvvm-fields-generator مقابل إطارات أخرى","تثبيت fosmvvm-fields-generator","دليل إعداد fosmvvm-fields-generator"]}},"owner":"foscomputerservices","repo":"FOSUtilities","repoPath":"foscomputerservices/FOSUtilities","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.927Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fosmvvm-fields-generator","description":"Generate FOSMVVM Fields protocols with validation rules, FormField definitions, and localized messages. Define form contracts once, validate everywhere.","bodyPreview":"# FOSMVVM Fields Generator\n\nGenerate Form Specifications following FOSMVVM patterns.\n\n## Conceptual Foundation\n\n> For full architecture context, see [FOSMVVMArchitecture.md](../../docs/FOSMVVMArchitecture.md) | [OpenClaw reference]({baseDir}/references/FOSMVVMArchitecture.md)\n\nA **Form Specification** (implemented as a `{Name}Fields` protocol) is the **single source of truth** for user input. It answers:\n\n1. **What data** can the user provide? (properties)\n2. **How should it be presented?** (For","body":"# FOSMVVM Fields Generator\n\nGenerate Form Specifications following FOSMVVM patterns.\n\n## Conceptual Foundation\n\n> For full architecture context, see [FOSMVVMArchitecture.md](../../docs/FOSMVVMArchitecture.md) | [OpenClaw reference]({baseDir}/references/FOSMVVMArchitecture.md)\n\nA **Form Specification** (implemented as a `{Name}Fields` protocol) is the **single source of truth** for user input. It answers:\n\n1. **What data** can the user provide? (properties)\n2. **How should it be presented?** (FormField with type, keyboard, autofill semantics)\n3. **What constraints apply?** (validation rules)\n4. **What messages should be shown?** (localized titles, placeholders, errors)\n\n### Why This Matters\n\nThe Form Specification is **defined once, used everywhere**:\n\n```swift\n// Same protocol adopted by different consumers:\nstruct CreateIdeaRequestBody: ServerRequestBody, IdeaFields { ... }  // HTTP transmission\n@ViewModel struct IdeaFormViewModel: IdeaFields { ... }              // Form rendering\nfinal class Idea: Model, IdeaFields { ... }                          // Persistence validation\n```\n\nThis ensures:\n- **Consistent validation** - Same rules on client and server\n- **Shared localization** - One YAML file, used everywhere\n- **Single source of truth** - Change once, applies everywhere\n\n### Connection to FOSMVVM\n\nForm Specifications integrate with:\n- **Localization System** - FormField titles/placeholders and validation messages use `LocalizableString`\n- **Validation System** - Implements `ValidatableModel` protocol\n- **Request System** - RequestBody types adopt Fields for validated transmission\n- **ViewModel System** - ViewModels adopt Fields for form rendering\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Defining a new form (create, edit, filter, search)\n- Adding validation to a request body\n- Any type that needs to conform to `ValidatableModel`\n- When `fosmvvm-fluent-datamodel-generator` needs form fields for a DataModel\n\n## What This Skill Generates\n\nA complete Form Specification consists of **3 files**:\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `{Name}Fields.swift` | Protocol + FormField definitions + validation methods |\n| `{Name}FieldsMessages.swift` | `@FieldValidationModel` struct with `@LocalizedString` properties |\n| `{Name}FieldsMessages.yml` | YAML localization (titles, placeholders, error messages) |\n\n## Project Structure Configuration\n\nReplace placeholders with your project''s actual paths:\n\n| Placeholder | Description | Example |\n|-------------|-------------|---------|\n| `{ViewModelsTarget}` | Shared ViewModels SPM target | `ViewModels`, `SharedViewModels` |\n| `{ResourcesPath}` | Localization resources path | `Sources/Resources` |\n\n**Expected Structure:**\n```\nSources/\n  {ViewModelsTarget}/\n    FieldModels/\n      {Name}Fields.swift\n      {Name}FieldsMessages.swift\n  {ResourcesPath}/\n    FieldModels/\n      {Name}FieldsMessages.yml\n```\n\n## How to Use This Skill\n\n**Invocation:**\n/fosmvvm-fields-generator\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n- Form purpose understood from conversation context\n- Field requirements discussed (names, types, constraints)\n- Entity relationship identified (what is this form creating/editing)\n\n**Workflow integration:**\nThis skill is used when defining form validation and user input contracts. The skill references conversation context automatically—no file paths or Q&A needed. Often precedes fosmvvm-fluent-datamodel-generator for form-backed models.\n\n## Pattern Implementation\n\nThis skill references conversation context to determine Fields protocol structure:\n\n### Form Analysis\n\nFrom conversation context, the skill identifies:\n- **Form purpose** (create, edit, filter, login, settings)\n- **Entity relation** (User, Idea, Document - what''s being created/edited)\n- **Protocol naming** (CreateIdeaFields, UpdateProfile, LoginCredentials)\n\n### Field Design\n\nFor each field from requirements:\n- **Property specification** (name, type, optional vs required)\n- **Presentation type** (FormFieldType: text, textArea, select, checkbox)\n- **Input semantics** (FormInputType: email, password, tel, date)\n- **Constraints** (required, length range, value range, date range)\n- **Localization** (title, placeholder, validation error messages)\n\n### File Generation Order\n\n1. Fields protocol with FormField definitions and validation\n2. FieldsMessages struct with @LocalizedString properties\n3. FieldsMessages YAML with localized strings\n\n### Context Sources\n\nSkill references information from:\n- **Prior conversation**: Form requirements, field specifications discussed\n- **Specification files**: If Claude has read form specs into context\n- **Existing patterns**: From codebase analysis of similar Fields protocols\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### Protocol Structure\n\n```swift\npublic protocol {Name}Fields: ValidatableModel, Codable, Sendable {\n    var fieldName: FieldType { get set }\n    var {name}ValidationMessages: {Name}FieldsMessages { get }\n}\n```\n\n### FormField Definition\n\n```swift\nstatic var contentField: FormField<String?> { .init(\n    fieldId: .init(id: \"content\"),\n    title: .localized(for: {Name}FieldsMessages.self, propertyName: \"content\", messageKey: \"title\"),\n    placeholder: .localized(for: {Name}FieldsMessages.self, propertyName: \"content\", messageKey: \"placeholder\"),\n    type: .textArea(inputType: .text),\n    options: [\n        .required(value: true)\n    ] + FormInputOption.rangeLength(contentRange)\n) }\n```\n\n### FormField Types Reference\n\n| FormFieldType | Use Case |\n|---------------|----------|\n| `.text(inputType:)` | Single-line input |\n| `.textArea(inputType:)` | Multi-line input |\n| `.checkbox` | Boolean toggle |\n| `.select` | Dropdown selection |\n| `.colorPicker` | Color selection |\n\n### FormInputType Reference (common ones)\n\n| FormInputType | Keyboard/Autofill |\n|---------------|-------------------|\n| `.text` | Default keyboard |\n| `.emailAddress` | Email keyboard, email autofill |\n| `.password` | Secure entry |\n| `.tel` | Phone keyboard |\n| `.url` | URL keyboard |\n| `.date`, `.datetimeLocal` | Date picker |\n| `.givenName`, `.familyName` | Name autofill |\n\n### Validation Method Pattern\n\n```swift\ninternal func validateContent(_ fields: [FormFieldBase]?) -> [ValidationResult]? {\n    guard fields == nil || (fields?.contains(Self.contentField) == true) else {\n        return nil\n    }\n\n    var result = [ValidationResult]()\n\n    if content.isEmpty {\n        result.append(.init(\n            status: .error,\n            field: Self.contentField,\n            message: {name}ValidationMessages.contentRequiredMessage\n        ))\n    } else if !Self.contentRange.contains(NSString(string: content).length) {\n        result.append(.init(\n            status: .error,\n            field: Self.contentField,\n            message: {name}ValidationMessages.contentOutOfRangeMessage\n        ))\n    }\n\n    return result.isEmpty ? nil : result\n}\n```\n\n### Messages Struct Pattern\n\n```swift\n@FieldValidationModel public struct {Name}FieldsMessages {\n    @LocalizedString(\"content\", messageGroup: \"validationMessages\", messageKey: \"required\")\n    public var contentRequiredMessage\n\n    @LocalizedString(\"content\", messageGroup: \"validationMessages\", messageKey: \"outOfRange\")\n    public var contentOutOfRangeMessage\n}\n```\n\n### YAML Structure\n\n```yaml\nen:\n  {Name}FieldsMessages:\n    content:\n      title: \"Content\"\n      placeholder: \"Enter your content...\"\n      validationMessages:\n        required: \"Content is required\"\n        outOfRange: \"Content must be between 1 and 10,000 characters\"\n```\n\n## Naming Conventions\n\n| Concept | Convention | Example |\n|---------|------------|---------|\n| Protocol | `{Name}Fields` | `IdeaFields`, `CreateIdeaFields` |\n| Messages struct | `{Name}FieldsMessages` | `IdeaFieldsMessages` |\n| Messages property | `{name}ValidationMessages` | `ideaValidationMessages` |\n| Field definition | `{fieldName}Field` | `contentField` |\n| Range constant | `{fieldName}Range` | `contentRange` |\n| Validate method | `validate{FieldName}` | `validateContent` |\n| Required message | `{fieldName}RequiredMessage` | `contentRequiredMessage` |\n| OutOfRange message | `{fieldName}OutOfRangeMessage` | `contentOutOfRangeMessage` |\n\n## See Also\n\n- [FOSMVVMArchitecture.md](../../docs/FOSMVVMArchitecture.md) - Full FOSMVVM architecture reference\n- [fosmvvm-viewmodel-generator](../fosmvvm-viewmodel-generator/SKILL.md) - For ViewModels that adopt Fields\n- [fosmvvm-fluent-datamodel-generator](../fosmvvm-fluent-datamodel-generator/SKILL.md) - For Fluent DataModels that implement Fields\n- [reference.md](reference.md) - Complete file templates\n\n## Version History\n\n| Version | Date | Changes |\n|---------|------|---------|\n| 1.0 | 2024-12-24 | Initial skill |\n| 2.0 | 2024-12-26 | Rewritten with conceptual foundation; generalized from Kairos-specific |\n| 2.1 | 2026-01-24 | Update to context-aware approach (remove file-parsing/Q&A). Skill references conversation context instead of asking questions or accepting file paths. |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:05:58.377Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Model-View-ViewModel pattern-based AI Agents requiring automated Form Specifications generation on macOS, iOS, Windows, and Linux","zh":"适用于基于 Model-View-ViewModel 模式的 AI Agent，需要在 macOS、iOS、Windows 和 Linux 上自动生成表单规范","ja":"Model-View-ViewModel パターンに基づく AI エージェントに適しており、macOS、iOS、Windows、Linux で自動的にフォーム仕様を生成する必要があります","ko":"Model-View-ViewModel 패턴 기반의 AI 에이전트에 적합하며 macOS, iOS, Windows 및 Linux에서 자동으로 양식 사양을 생성해야 합니다","es":"Ideal para patrones de agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Model-View-ViewModel que requieren la generación automática de especificaciones de formularios en macOS, iOS, Windows y Linux","fr":"Idéal pour les modèles d''agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur le modèle Model-View-ViewModel nécessitant la génération automatique de spécifications de formulaires sur macOS, iOS, Windows et Linux","de":"Ideal für auf Model-View-ViewModel-Muster basierende KI-Agents, die die automatisierte Formularspezifikationsgenerierung auf macOS, iOS, Windows und Linux erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA baseados no padrão Model-View-ViewModel que exigem geração automática de especificações de formulários no macOS, iOS, Windows e Linux","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, основанных на шаблоне Model-View-ViewModel, требующих автоматической генерации спецификаций форм на macOS, iOS, Windows и Linux","ar":"مثالي لعميل الخصائص المستندة إلى نمط Model-View-ViewModel الذي يتطلب جيل آلي لمواصفات النماذج على macOS و iOS و Windows و Linux"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate Form Specifications following FOSMVVM patterns, utilizing Swift libraries to create a single source of truth for user input, defining what data can be provided and how it should be presented, using protocols like {Name}Fields","zh":"赋予代理生成表单规范的能力，遵循 FOSMVVM 模式，利用 Swift 库创建用户输入的单一真实来源，定义可以提供什么数据以及如何表示，使用诸如 {Name}Fields 的协议","ja":"FOSMVVM パターンに従ってフォーム仕様を生成する機能をエージェントに与え、Swift ライブラリを使用してユーザー入力の単一の真実の源を作成し、どのようなデータを提供し、どのように提示するかを定義し、{Name}Fields などのプロトコルを使用する","ko":"FOSMVVM 패턴을 따르는 양식 사양을 생성하는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하여 Swift 라이브러리를 사용하여 사용자 입력의 단일 진실 소스를 만들고 제공할 수 있는 데이터 및 표시 방법을 정의하며 {Name}Fields와 같은 프로토콜을 사용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes para generar especificaciones de formularios siguiendo patrones FOSMVVM, utilizando bibliotecas Swift para crear una sola fuente de verdad para la entrada del usuario, definiendo qué datos se pueden proporcionar y cómo deben presentarse, utilizando protocolos como {Name}Fields","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des spécifications de formulaires en suivant les modèles FOSMVVM, en utilisant des bibliothèques Swift pour créer une seule source de vérité pour la saisie utilisateur, en définissant quels données peuvent être fournies et comment elles doivent être présentées, en utilisant des protocoles comme {Name}Fields","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Formularspezifikationen gemäß FOSMVVM-Mustern zu generieren, indem Swift-Bibliotheken verwendet werden, um eine einzige Wahrheitsquelle für die Benutzereingabe zu erstellen, die definiert, welche Daten bereitgestellt werden können und wie sie präsentiert werden sollen, unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie {Name}Fields","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar especificações de formulários seguindo padrões FOSMVVM, utilizando bibliotecas Swift para criar uma fonte única de verdade para entrada do usuário, definindo quais dados podem ser fornecidos e como devem ser apresentados, usando protocolos como {Name}Fields","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать спецификации форм, следуя шаблонам FOSMVVM, используя библиотеки Swift для создания единого источника истинной информации для ввода пользователя, определяя, какие данные можно предоставить и как они должны быть представлены, используя протоколы như {Name}Fields","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من جيل مواصفات النماذج اتباعاً لأنماط FOSMVVM، مستخدمين مكتبات Swift لإنشاء مصدر وحيد للحقيقة للمدخلات المستخدم، وتحديد البيانات التي يمكن تقديمها وكيف يجب عرضها، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل {Name}Fields"},"useCases":{"en":["Generating Form Specifications for cross-platform applications","Automating user input validation based on FOSMVVM patterns","Creating {Name}Fields protocols for standardized data handling"],"zh":["为跨平台应用程序生成表单规范","基于 FOSMVVM 模式的自动用户输入验证","创建 {Name}Fields 协议以实现标准化数据处理"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォーム アプリケーションのフォーム仕様を生成する","FOSMVVM パターンに基づく自動ユーザー入力検証","標準化されたデータ処理のために {Name}Fields プロトコルを作成する"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 애플리케이션을 위한 양식 사양 생성","FOSMVVM 패턴을 기반으로 하는 자동 사용자 입력 검증","표준화된 데이터 처리를 위한 {Name}Fields 프로토콜 생성"],"es":["Generación de especificaciones de formularios para aplicaciones multiplataforma","Automatización de la validación de la entrada del usuario basada en patrones FOSMVVM","Creación de protocolos {Name}Fields para el manejo de datos estandarizados"],"fr":["Génération de spécifications de formulaires pour les applications multiplateformes","Automatisation de la validation de la saisie utilisateur basée sur les modèles FOSMVVM","Création de protocoles {Name}Fields pour la gestion de données standardisées"],"de":["Generierung von Formularspezifikationen für Cross-Plattform-Anwendungen","Automatisierung der Benutzereingabe-Validierung basierend auf FOSMVVM-Mustern","Erstellung von {Name}Fields-Protokollen für standardisierte Datenverwaltung"],"pt":["Geração de especificações de formulários para aplicações multiplataforma","Automação da validação da entrada do usuário com base em padrões FOSMVVM","Criação de protocolos {Name}Fields para tratamento de dados padronizado"],"ru":["Генерация спецификаций форм для кроссплатформенных приложений","Автоматизация проверки ввода пользователя на основе шаблонов FOSMVVM","Создание протоколов {Name}Fields для стандартизированного обработки данных"],"ar":["جيل مواصفات النماذج للتطبيقات متعددة المنصات","آليّة التحقق من المدخلات المستخدمة بالاعتماد على أنماط FOSMVVM","إنشاء بروتوكولات {Name}Fields لمعالجة البيانات المعيارية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of Model-View-ViewModel architecture","Specific to FOSMVVM patterns and Swift libraries","Needs access to FOSMVVMArchitecture documentation for full context"],"zh":["需要了解 Model-View-ViewModel 架构","特定于 FOSMVVM 模式和 Swift 库","需要访问 FOSMVVMArchitecture 文档以获取完整的上下文"],"ja":["Model-View-ViewModel アーキテクチャを理解する必要がある","FOSMVVM パターンと Swift ライブラリに特有","完全なコンテキストを得るために FOSMVVMArchitecture ドキュメントにアクセスする必要がある"],"ko":["Model-View-ViewModel 아키텍처를 이해해야 함","FOSMVVM 패턴 및 Swift 라이브러리에 특정","전체 문脈를 얻으려면 FOSMVVMArchitecture 문서에 액세스해야 함"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la arquitectura Model-View-ViewModel","Específico para patrones FOSMVVM y bibliotecas Swift","Necesita acceso a la documentación de FOSMVVMArchitecture para el contexto completo"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de l''architecture Model-View-ViewModel","Spécifique aux modèles FOSMVVM et bibliothèques Swift","Nécessite un accès à la documentation FOSMVVMArchitecture pour le contexte complet"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis der Model-View-ViewModel-Architektur","Spezifisch für FOSMVVM-Muster und Swift-Bibliotheken","Benötigt Zugriff auf die FOSMVVMArchitecture-Dokumentation für den vollständigen Kontext"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento da arquitetura Model-View-ViewModel","Específico para padrões FOSMVVM e bibliotecas Swift","Necessita acesso à documentação da arquitetura FOSMVVMArchitecture para contexto completo"],"ru":["Требует понимания архитектуры Model-View-ViewModel","Спецефичен для шаблонов FOSMVVM и библиотек Swift","Требует доступа к документации архитектуры FOSMVVMArchitecture для полного контекста"],"ar":["يتطلب فهمًا للهيكل المعماري Model-View-ViewModel","محدد لأنماط FOSMVVM ومكتبات Swift","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى توثيق هيكل FOSMVVMArchitecture للسياق الكامل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"195afd1053edd24681e5cb2d7f5cc0613254a83b60aa260dc511df82246caea6","qualityScore":48}');
