"개발과 테스트의 효율화","사용하기 쉬운 인터페이스"],"es":["Instalación y gestión de servidores MCP","Conexión a agentes de IA","Personalización de la API de ToolHive","Pruebas y depuración de la API","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas"],"fr":["Installation et gestion de serveurs MCP","Connexion à des agents d''IA","Personnalisation de l''API de ToolHive","Tests et débogage de l''API","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Installation und Verwaltung von MCP-Servern","Verbindung zu KI-Agents","Anpassung der ToolHive-API","Tests und Fehlerbehebung der API","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen"],"pt":["Instalação e gerenciamento de servidores MCP","Conexão a agentes de IA","Teste de API com ToolHive","Suporte a múltiplos servidores","Interface de usuário amigável"],"ru":["Установка и управление серверами MCP","Подключение к ИИ Агентам","Тестирование API с помощью ToolHive","Поддержка нескольких серверов","Дружественный интерфейс пользователя"],"ar":["تثبيت وإدارة خواديم MCP","ربط أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","اختبار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مع ToolHive","دعم خواديم متعددة","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用ToolHive","什么是API覆盖","ToolHive替代方案","ToolHive vs 其他工具","ToolHive安装","ToolHive设置指南","AI代理工具","MCP服务器管理"],"ja":["ToolHiveの使い方","AIエージェントのAPIオーバーライドとは","ToolHiveの代替","ToolHive vs 他のツール","ToolHiveのインストール","ToolHiveの設定ガイド","AIエージェントツール","MCPサーバーの管理"],"ko":["ToolHive 사용법","API 오버라이드란","ToolHive 대안","ToolHive vs 다른 도구","ToolHive 설치","ToolHive 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 도구","MCP 서버 관리"],"es":["herramientas de IA","testing-api-overrides","ToolHive","servidores MCP","agentes de IA","cómo usar ToolHive","qué es testing-api-overrides","alternativas a ToolHive","ToolHive vs otros","instalación de ToolHive"],"fr":["outils d''IA","testing-api-overrides","ToolHive","serveurs MCP","agents d''IA","comment utiliser ToolHive","qu''est-ce que testing-api-overrides","alternatives à ToolHive","ToolHive vs autres","installation de ToolHive"],"de":["KI-Tools","testing-api-overrides","ToolHive","MCP-Server","KI-Agents","wie man ToolHive verwendet","was ist testing-api-overrides","Alternativen zu ToolHive","ToolHive vs andere","Installation von ToolHive"],"pt":["como usar ToolHive","o que é teste de API","ToolHive alternativa","ToolHive vs competitors","instalar ToolHive","guia de configuração do ToolHive","desenvolvimento de API","ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["как использовать ToolHive","что такое тестирование API","ToolHive альтернатива","ToolHive vs конкуренты","установить ToolHive","руководство по настройке ToolHive","разработка API","инструменты ИИ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ToolHive","ما هو اختبار واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","ToolHive بديل","ToolHive مقابل المنافسين","تثبيت ToolHive","دليل إعداد ToolHive","تطوير واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"stacklok","repo":"toolhive-studio","repoPath":"stacklok/toolhive-studio","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.747Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"testing-api-overrides","description":"Test that components send correct query parameters or request arguments. Use when testing filtering, sorting, pagination, or any read operation where request parameters matter. Use for test-scoped mock customization.","bodyPreview":"# Testing API Overrides\n\nTest that your code sends correct API parameters by using conditional overrides that respond differently based on the request. This approach tests actual user-facing behavior rather than inspecting internal request details.\n\n## Philosophy\n\n**Good tests verify what users see, not implementation details.**\n\nInstead of:\n\n1. ❌ Recording the request and checking query params\n2. ❌ Asserting on internal function calls\n\nDo this:\n\n1. ✅ Set up conditional mocks that respond based","body":"# Testing API Overrides\n\nTest that your code sends correct API parameters by using conditional overrides that respond differently based on the request. This approach tests actual user-facing behavior rather than inspecting internal request details.\n\n## Philosophy\n\n**Good tests verify what users see, not implementation details.**\n\nInstead of:\n\n1. ❌ Recording the request and checking query params\n2. ❌ Asserting on internal function calls\n\nDo this:\n\n1. ✅ Set up conditional mocks that respond based on params\n2. ✅ Verify the component renders the expected data\n\nIf the code sends wrong parameters, the mock returns wrong data, the UI shows wrong content, and the test fails. This catches real bugs.\n\n## When to Use Conditional Overrides\n\n- Testing list filtering (e.g., filter by group, status, search term)\n- Testing pagination parameters\n- Testing sort order\n- Any read operation where request parameters affect what data is returned\n\n**Note:** For mutations (create/update/delete), use `recordRequests()` instead. See the **testing-api-assertions** skill.\n\n## conditionalOverride()\n\nReturns different data based on request properties:\n\n```typescript\nimport { mockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads } from ''@mocks/fixtures/workloads/get''\n\nmockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads.conditionalOverride(\n  // Predicate: when should this override apply?\n  ({ query }) => query.group === ''archive'',\n  // Transform: what data to return?\n  (data) => ({\n    ...data,\n    workloads: [], // Archive group is empty\n  })\n)\n```\n\n### Predicate Function\n\nThe predicate receives parsed request info with easy access to query params, path params, body, and headers:\n\n```typescript\n;({ query, path, body, headers }) => {\n  // Query parameters (pre-parsed)\n  query.group // ''?group=archive'' -> ''archive''\n  query.status // ''?status=running'' -> ''running''\n\n  // Path parameters (from route like /workloads/:name)\n  path.name // for /workloads/:name\n\n  // Request body (for POST/PUT/DELETE)\n  body?.name // parsed JSON body\n\n  // Headers\n  headers.get(''Authorization'')\n\n  return true // or false\n}\n```\n\n### Transform Function\n\nThe transform receives default data and returns modified data:\n\n```typescript\n;(data) => ({\n  ...data, // Spread defaults\n  workloads: data.workloads?.filter(\n    // Modify as needed\n    (w) => w.status === ''running''\n  ),\n})\n```\n\n## Example: Testing Group Filter\n\n```typescript\nimport { mockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads } from ''@mocks/fixtures/workloads/get''\n\nit(''shows only workloads from the selected group'', async () => {\n  // Default mock returns workloads from multiple groups\n  // Add conditional override for ''production'' group\n  mockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads.conditionalOverride(\n    ({ query }) => query.group === ''production'',\n    (data) => ({\n      ...data,\n      workloads: [\n        { name: ''prod-server-1'', group: ''production'', status: ''running'' },\n        { name: ''prod-server-2'', group: ''production'', status: ''running'' },\n      ],\n    })\n  )\n\n  render(<WorkloadsList group=\"production\" />)\n\n  // If component sends ?group=production, it gets the filtered data\n  // If component forgets the param, it gets default data with mixed groups\n  await waitFor(() => {\n    expect(screen.getByText(''prod-server-1'')).toBeVisible()\n    expect(screen.getByText(''prod-server-2'')).toBeVisible()\n  })\n\n  // These would appear if the filter param wasn''t sent correctly\n  expect(screen.queryByText(''dev-server'')).not.toBeInTheDocument()\n})\n```\n\n## Example: Testing Empty State\n\n```typescript\nit(''shows empty message when group has no workloads'', async () => {\n  mockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads.conditionalOverride(\n    ({ query }) => query.group === ''empty-group'',\n    () => ({ workloads: [] })\n  )\n\n  render(<WorkloadsList group=\"empty-group\" />)\n\n  await waitFor(() => {\n    expect(screen.getByText(/no workloads found/i)).toBeVisible()\n  })\n})\n```\n\n## Multiple Conditional Overrides\n\nChain multiple overrides for different conditions:\n\n```typescript\nmockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads\n  .conditionalOverride(\n    ({ query }) => query.group === ''production'',\n    () => ({ workloads: productionWorkloads })\n  )\n  .conditionalOverride(\n    ({ query }) => query.group === ''staging'',\n    () => ({ workloads: stagingWorkloads })\n  )\n```\n\nLater overrides wrap earlier ones. If no predicate matches, the default fixture data is returned.\n\n## Simple Overrides (No Condition)\n\nFor test-scoped data changes without conditions, use `.override()`:\n\n```typescript\n// Override for entire test - no condition\nmockedGetApiV1BetaGroups.override(() => ({\n  groups: [{ name: ''only-group'', registered_clients: [] }],\n}))\n\n// Modify default data\nmockedGetApiV1BetaGroups.override((data) => ({\n  ...data,\n  groups: data.groups?.slice(0, 1),\n}))\n```\n\n## Error Responses\n\nUse `.overrideHandler()` for full control over the response:\n\n```typescript\nimport { HttpResponse } from ''msw''\n\n// Return error\nmockedGetApiV1BetaGroups.overrideHandler(() =>\n  HttpResponse.json({ error: ''Server error'' }, { status: 500 })\n)\n\n// Network failure\nmockedGetApiV1BetaGroups.overrideHandler(() => HttpResponse.error())\n```\n\n## Automatic Reset\n\nAll overrides are automatically reset before each test via `resetAllAutoAPIMocks()` in `vitest.setup.ts`. No cleanup needed.\n\n## Reusable Scenarios\n\nWhen the same response override is needed across many tests, define it as a scenario in the fixture instead of duplicating `.override()` calls.\n\n### Defining Scenarios (in fixtures)\n\n```typescript\n// In fixtures/workloads/get.ts\nexport const mockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads = AutoAPIMock<...>({\n  workloads: [/* default data */],\n}).scenario(''empty'', (mock) => mock.override(() => ({ workloads: [] })))\n```\n\n### Using Scenarios (in tests)\n\n```typescript\nmockedGetApiV1BetaWorkloads.activateScenario(''empty'')\n```\n\nScenario names are defined in `renderer/src/common/mocks/scenarioNames.ts`. Use existing names when possible to keep scenarios consolidated.\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **testing-with-api-mocks** - Auto-generated mocks and fixture basics\n- **testing-api-assertions** - Verifying mutations with `recordRequests()` (create/update/delete only)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:09:58.023Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT needing robust API testing capabilities with conditional overrides.","zh":"非常适合像 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT 这样的高级 AI Agent，需要强大的 API 测试功能，包括条件覆盖。","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの高度な AI エージェントに適しており、条件付きのオーバーライドを含む強力な API テスト機能が必要です。","ko":"Claude Code 및 AutoGPT와 같은 고급 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 조건부 오버라이드를 포함한 강력한 API 테스트 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA avanzados como Claude Code y AutoGPT que necesitan capacidades de prueba de API robustas con anulaciones condicionales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA avancés comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant des capacités de test d''API robustes avec des substitutions conditionnelles.","de":"Perfekt für fortschrittliche KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die robuste API-Testfunktionen mit bedingten Überschreibungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de inteligência artificial avançados como Claude Code e AutoGPT que necessitam de capacidades robustas de teste de API com overrides condicionais.","ru":"Идеально для продвинутых агентов ИИ, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, которые нуждаются в надежных возможностях тестирования API с условными переопределениями.","ar":"مثلي للوكلاء الذكية المتقدمة مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT التي تحتاج إلى قدرات اختبار API قوية مع overrides condicionais."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to verify user-facing behavior by setting up conditional mocks that respond based on API requests, utilizing protocols and libraries for comprehensive testing, including API parameter validation and response mocking.","zh":"使得代理能够通过设置基于 API 请求的条件模拟来验证用户面向的行为，利用协议和库进行全面测试，包括 API 参数验证和响应模拟。","ja":"エージェントが API リクエストに基づいて条件付きモックを設定してユーザー向けの動作を検証できるようにし、プロトコルとライブラリを使用して包括的なテストを行い、API パラメータの検証とレスポンスのモックを含みます。","ko":"에이전트가 API 요청에 기반한 조건부 모의를 설정하여 사용자 중심의 동작을 검증할 수 있도록 하며, 프로토콜 및 라이브러리를 사용하여 포괄적인 테스트를 수행하며, API 매개변수 검증 및 응답 모의를 포함합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar el comportamiento orientado al usuario configurando simulacros condicionales que responden en función de las solicitudes de API, utilizando protocolos y bibliotecas para pruebas exhaustivas, incluida la validación de parámetros de API y la simulación de respuestas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier le comportement orienté vers l''utilisateur en configurant des simulations conditionnelles qui répondent en fonction des requêtes API, en utilisant des protocoles et des bibliothèques pour des tests complets, y compris la validation des paramètres d''API et la simulation de réponses.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, das benutzerorientierte Verhalten zu überprüfen, indem bedingte Mocks eingerichtet werden, die auf API-Anfragen basieren, wobei Protokolle und Bibliotheken für umfassende Tests verwendet werden, einschließlich API-Parameter-Validierung und Antwort-Mocking.","pt":"Empodera os agentes a verificar o comportamento de frente ao usuário por meio de configurações de mocks condicionais que respondem com base em solicitações de API, utilizando protocolos e bibliotecas para testes abrangentes, incluindo validação de parâmetros de API e simulação de respostas.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность проверить поведение пользователя путем настройки условных.mocks, которые отвечают на основе запросов API, используя протоколы и библиотеки для всестороннего тестирования, включая валидацию параметров API и симуляцию ответов.","ar":"تمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التحقق من поведكة الوجهة للمستخدم عن طريق إعداد configurações de mocks condicionais التي ترد على أساس solições de API, استخدام protocols و bibliotecas لاختبار شامل, بما في ذلك validação de parâmetros de API و simulação de respostas."},"useCases":{"en":["Testing API overrides for MCP servers","Validating API parameters with conditional mocks","Debugging user-facing behavior with mock responses"],"zh":["MCP 服务器的 API 覆盖测试","使用条件模拟验证 API 参数","使用模拟响应调试用户面向的行为"],"ja":["MCP サーバーの API オーバーライドのテスト","条件付きモックを使用した API パラメータの検証","モック応答を使用したユーザー向けの動作のデバッグ"],"ko":["MCP 서버의 API 오버라이드 테스트","조건부 모의를 사용한 API 매개변수 검증","모의 응답을 사용한 사용자 중심의 동작 디버깅"],"es":["Pruebas de anulaciones de API para servidores MCP","Validación de parámetros de API con simulacros condicionales","Depuración del comportamiento orientado al usuario con respuestas simuladas"],"fr":["Test des substitutions d''API pour les serveurs MCP","Validation des paramètres d''API avec des simulations conditionnelles","Débogage du comportement orienté vers l''utilisateur avec des réponses simulées"],"de":["Testen von API-Überschreibungen für MCP-Server","Validierung von API-Parametern mit bedingten Mocks","Fehlersuche für benutzerorientiertes Verhalten mit simulierten Antworten"],"pt":["Testar overrides de API para servidores MCP","Validar parâmetros de API com mocks condicionais","Depurar o comportamento de frente ao usuário com respostas de mock"],"ru":["Тестировать переопределения API для серверов MCP","Валидировать параметры API с помощью условных.mocks","Отладить поведение пользователя с помощью ответов-моков"],"ar":["اختبار overrides de API لخادم MCP","تحقق من parameters de API مع mocks condicionais","ت调masının user-facing behavior مع respostas de mock"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires API access and mock setup","Conditional overrides must be manually configured"],"zh":["需要 API 访问和模拟设置","条件覆盖必须手动配置"],"ja":["API アクセスとモックの設定が必要","条件付きオーバーライドは手動で構成する必要があります"],"ko":["API 접근 및 모의 설정이 필요","조건부 오버라이드는 수동으로 구성해야 함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a API y configuración de simulacro","Las anulaciones condicionales deben configurarse manualmente"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API et une configuration de simulation","Les substitutions conditionnelles doivent être configurées manuellement"],"de":["Benötigt API-Zugriff und Mock-Setup","Bedingte Überschreibungen müssen manuell konfiguriert werden"],"pt":["Requer acesso de API e configuração de mock","Overrides condicionais devem ser configurados manualmente"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API и настройки mock","Условные переопределения должны быть настроены вручную"],"ar":["يتطلب acceso de API و configuração de mock","Overrides condicionais devem ser configurados manualmente"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"db8ec95881acc231201437d8793f86bf9456fc5fd63c1a38f15c86c32c30fae7","qualityScore":48}');
