自動同期","414以上のスキル","38のエージェント","57のコマンド"],"ko":["스마트 기술 감지","프로젝트별 설치","자동 동기화","414개 이상의 스킬","38개의 에이전트","57개의 명령"],"es":["Detección de tecnologías inteligente","Instalación por proyecto","Sincronización automática desde fuentes de upstream","414+ habilidades","38 agentes","57 comandos"],"fr":["Détection de technologies intelligente","Installation par projet","Synchronisation automatique depuis les sources de upstream","414+ compétences","38 agents","57 commandes"],"de":["Intelligente Technologie-Erkennung","Installation pro Projekt","Automatische Synchronisation von Upstream-Quellen","414+ Fähigkeiten","38 Agenten","57 Befehle"],"pt":["Sistema de habilidades de agente de IA unificado","414+ habilidades de codificação","38 agentes de IA","Detecção de tecnologia inteligente","Instalação por projeto","Sincronização automática de fontes"],"ru":["Единая система навыков ИИ-агентов","414+ навыков кодирования","38 агентов ИИ","Умное обнаружение технологий","Установка по проекту","Автоматическая синхронизация источников"],"ar":["نظام موحد لخبرات وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أكثر من 414 مهارة برمجة","38 وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي","الكشف الذكي عن التكنولوجيا","التثبيت حسب المشروع","التزامن التلقائي للمصادر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["cpp-pro","AI智能代理","代码编写助手","如何使用cpp-pro","cpp-pro安装","cpp-pro设置指南","cpp-pro替代品","cpp-pro vs 其他工具"],"ja":["cpp-pro","AIエージェント","コード作成アシスタント","cpp-proの使い方","cpp-proのインストール","cpp-proの設定ガイド","cpp-proの代替","cpp-pro vs 他のツール"],"ko":["cpp-pro","AI 에이전트","코드 작성 도우미","cpp-pro 사용법","cpp-pro 설치","cpp-pro 설정 가이드","cpp-pro 대체","cpp-pro vs 다른 도구"],"es":["cómo usar cpp-pro","qué es un agente de IA","alternativas a cpp-pro","cpp-pro vs Copilot","instalación de cpp-pro","guía de configuración de cpp-pro","desarrollo de habilidades de agente de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser cpp-pro","qu''est-ce qu''un agent IA","alternatives à cpp-pro","cpp-pro vs Copilot","installation de cpp-pro","guide de configuration de cpp-pro","développement de compétences d''agent IA"],"de":["wie man cpp-pro verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternativen zu cpp-pro","cpp-pro vs Copilot","Installation von cpp-pro","Konfigurationsanleitung für cpp-pro","Entwicklung von KI-Agent-Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["como usar cpp-pro","o que é cpp-pro","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","alternativas ao github copilot","cpp-pro vs cursor","instalar cpp-pro","guias de configuração do cpp-pro"],"ru":["как использовать cpp-pro","что такое cpp-pro","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","альтернативы github copilot","cpp-pro vs cursor","установить cpp-pro","руководства по настройке cpp-pro"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام cpp-pro","ما هو cpp-pro","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","بديل لجيت هاب كوبيلوت","cpp-pro مقابل كارسر","تثبيت cpp-pro","دليل إعداد cpp-pro"]}},"owner":"ngxtm","repo":"devkit","repoPath":"ngxtm/devkit","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.669Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cpp-pro","description":"Use when building C++ applications requiring modern C++20/23 features, template metaprogramming, or high-performance systems. Invoke for concepts, ranges, coroutines, SIMD optimization, memory management.","bodyPreview":"# C++ Pro\n\nSenior C++ developer with deep expertise in modern C++20/23, systems programming, high-performance computing, and zero-overhead abstractions.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior C++ engineer with 15+ years of systems programming experience. You specialize in modern C++20/23, template metaprogramming, performance optimization, and building production-grade systems with emphasis on safety, efficiency, and maintainability. You follow C++ Core Guidelines and leverage cutting-edge langua","body":"# C++ Pro\n\nSenior C++ developer with deep expertise in modern C++20/23, systems programming, high-performance computing, and zero-overhead abstractions.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior C++ engineer with 15+ years of systems programming experience. You specialize in modern C++20/23, template metaprogramming, performance optimization, and building production-grade systems with emphasis on safety, efficiency, and maintainability. You follow C++ Core Guidelines and leverage cutting-edge language features.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building high-performance C++ applications\n- Implementing template metaprogramming solutions\n- Optimizing memory-critical systems\n- Developing concurrent and parallel algorithms\n- Creating custom allocators and memory pools\n- Systems programming and embedded development\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze architecture** - Review build system, compiler flags, performance requirements\n2. **Design with concepts** - Create type-safe interfaces using C++20 concepts\n3. **Implement zero-cost** - Apply RAII, constexpr, and zero-overhead abstractions\n4. **Verify quality** - Run sanitizers, static analysis, and performance benchmarks\n5. **Optimize** - Profile, measure, and apply targeted optimizations\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Modern C++ Features | `references/modern-cpp.md` | C++20/23 features, concepts, ranges, coroutines |\n| Template Metaprogramming | `references/templates.md` | Variadic templates, SFINAE, type traits, CRTP |\n| Memory & Performance | `references/memory-performance.md` | Allocators, SIMD, cache optimization, move semantics |\n| Concurrency | `references/concurrency.md` | Atomics, lock-free structures, thread pools, coroutines |\n| Build & Tooling | `references/build-tooling.md` | CMake, sanitizers, static analysis, testing |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Follow C++ Core Guidelines\n- Use concepts for template constraints\n- Apply RAII universally\n- Use `auto` with type deduction\n- Prefer `std::unique_ptr` and `std::shared_ptr`\n- Enable all compiler warnings (-Wall -Wextra -Wpedantic)\n- Run AddressSanitizer and UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer\n- Write const-correct code\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Use raw `new`/`delete` (prefer smart pointers)\n- Ignore compiler warnings\n- Use C-style casts (use static_cast, etc.)\n- Mix exception and error code patterns inconsistently\n- Write non-const-correct code\n- Use `using namespace std` in headers\n- Ignore undefined behavior\n- Skip move semantics for expensive types\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing C++ features, provide:\n1. Header file with interfaces and templates\n2. Implementation file (when needed)\n3. CMakeLists.txt updates (if applicable)\n4. Test file demonstrating usage\n5. Brief explanation of design decisions and performance characteristics\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nC++20/23, concepts, ranges, coroutines, modules, template metaprogramming, SFINAE, type traits, CRTP, smart pointers, custom allocators, move semantics, RAII, SIMD, atomics, lock-free programming, CMake, Conan, sanitizers, clang-tidy, cppcheck, Catch2, GoogleTest\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **Rust Engineer** - Memory safety with different approach\n- **Performance Engineer** - Profiling and optimization\n- **Systems Architect** - Low-level system design\n- **Embedded Systems** - Resource-constrained environments\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:22:24.955Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Coding Agents like Claude Code and Cursor requiring advanced C++20/23 development capabilities.","zh":"适合于像 Claude Code 和 Cursor 这样的 AI 编码代理，需要高级 C++20/23 开发能力。","ja":"Claude Code や Cursor などの AI コーディングエージェントに適しており、先進的な C++20/23 開発機能が必要です。","ko":"Claude Code와 Cursor 같은 AI 코딩 에이전트에 적합하며, 고급 C++20/23 개발 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de codificación de IA como Claude Code y Cursor que requieren capacidades de desarrollo avanzadas de C++20/23.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de codage IA comme Claude Code et Cursor nécessitant des capacités de développement avancées C++20/23.","de":"Ideal für AI-Coding-Agenten wie Claude Code und Cursor, die erweiterte C++20/23-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Codificação de IA como Claude Code e Cursor que requerem capacidades de desenvolvimento avançadas em C++20/23.","ru":"Идеально для агентов кодирования ИИ, таких как Claude Code и Cursor, требующих продвинутых возможностей разработки на C++20/23.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الترميز بالذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude Code و Cursor الذي يتطلب khảيات تطوير متقدمة في C++20/23."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop high-performance systems with modern C++20/23, leveraging template metaprogramming, zero-overhead abstractions, and following C++ Core Guidelines for safety and efficiency.","zh":"赋予代理开发高性能系统的能力，利用现代 C++20/23、模板元编程、零开销抽象，并遵循 C++ Core Guidelines 以确保安全性和效率。","ja":"モダンな C++20/23、テンプレートメタプログラミング、ゼロオーバーヘッド抽象を利用し、C++ Core Guidelines に従って安全性と効率を確保した高性能システムの開発をエージェントに可能にします。","ko":"최신 C++20/23, 템플릿 메타 프로그래밍, 제로 오버헤드 추상화를 활용하여 안전성과 효율성을 보장하는 C++ Core Guidelines에 따라 고성능 시스템 개발을 에이전트에게 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar sistemas de alto rendimiento con C++20/23 moderno, aprovechando la metaprogramación de plantillas, las abstracciones sin sobrecarga y siguiendo las C++ Core Guidelines para la seguridad y la eficiencia.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des systèmes haute performance avec C++20/23 moderne, en exploitant la métaprogrammation de modèles, les abstractions sans surcharge et en suivant les directives C++ Core pour la sécurité et l''efficacité.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Hochleistungssysteme mit modernem C++20/23 zu entwickeln, indem sie die Template-Metaprogrammierung, Overhead-freie Abstraktionen nutzen und den C++-Kernleitfaden für Sicherheit und Effizienz befolgen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver sistemas de alto desempenho com C++20/23 moderno, aproveitando a metaprogramação de templates, abstrações sem sobrecarga e seguindo as Diretrizes Centrais do C++ para segurança e eficiência.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать высокопроизводительные системы с помощью современного C++20/23, используя метапрограммирование шаблонов, абстракции без накладных расходов и следуя Руководящим принципам ядра C++ для безопасности и эффективности.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تطوير أنظمة عالية الأداء باستخدام C++20/23 الحديث، واستخدام برنامج ميتا للقوالب، والتجريدات بدون الحمل الزائد، واتباع إرشادات النواة من C++ من أجل السلامة والكفاءة."},"useCases":{"en":["Developing production-grade systems with emphasis on safety and maintainability","Optimizing C++ code for high-performance computing applications","Implementing zero-overhead abstractions for efficient systems programming"],"zh":["开发注重安全性和可维护性的生产级系统","为高性能计算应用优化 C++ 代码","实现零开销抽象以进行高效的系统编程"],"ja":["安全性とメンテナンス性に重点を置いた生産レベルのシステムの開発","高性能コンピューティングアプリケーション向けの C++ コードの最適化","効率的なシステムプログラミングのためのゼロオーバーヘッド抽象の実装"],"ko":["안전성과 유지보수성을 강조하는 생산급 시스템 개발","고성능 컴퓨팅 애플리케이션을 위한 C++ 코드 최적화","효율적인 시스템 프로그래밍을 위한 제로 오버헤드 추상화 구현"],"es":["Desarrollar sistemas de grado de producción con énfasis en la seguridad y la mantenibilidad","Optimizar el código C++ para aplicaciones de computación de alto rendimiento","Implementar abstracciones sin sobrecarga para la programación de sistemas eficientes"],"fr":["Développer des systèmes de grade de production avec l''accent sur la sécurité et la maintenabilité","Optimiser le code C++ pour les applications de calcul haute performance","Mettre en œuvre des abstractions sans surcharge pour la programmation de systèmes efficaces"],"de":["Produktionsreife Systeme mit Schwerpunkt auf Sicherheit und Wartbarkeit entwickeln","C++-Code für High-Performance-Computing-Anwendungen optimieren","Overhead-freie Abstraktionen für effizientes Systemprogramming implementieren"],"pt":["Desenvolver sistemas de produção com ênfase na segurança e manutenibilidade","Otimizar código C++ para aplicações de computação de alto desempenho","Implementar abstrações sem sobrecarga para programação de sistemas eficiente"],"ru":["Разработка систем производственного уровня с упором на безопасность и поддерживаемость","Оптимизация кода C++ для приложений высокопроизводительных вычислений","Реализация абстракций без накладных расходов для эффективного системного программирования"],"ar":["تطوير أنظمة الإنتاج مع التركيز على السلامة والصيانة","تحسين كود C++ لتطبيقات الحوسبة عالية الأداء","تنفيذ التجريدات بدون الحمل الزائد من أجل برمجة أنظمة كفؤة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires deep expertise in systems programming and C++20/23","Limited to C++ development only"],"zh":["需要深入的系统编程和 C++20/23 的专业知识","仅限 C++ 开发"],"ja":["システムプログラミングと C++20/23 に対する深い専門知識が必要","C++ 開発のみに限定される"],"ko":["시스템 프로그래밍과 C++20/23에 대한 깊은 전문 지식이 필요","C++ 개발만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una profunda experiencia en programación de sistemas y C++20/23","Limitado solo al desarrollo de C++"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise approfondie en programmation de systèmes et C++20/23","Limité uniquement au développement C++"],"de":["Benötigt tiefes Fachwissen in der Systemprogrammierung und C++20/23","Begrenzt auf C++-Entwicklung only"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento profundo em programação de sistemas e C++20/23","Limitado apenas ao desenvolvimento em C++"],"ru":["Требует глубокого опыта в системном программировании и C++20/23","Ограничен только разработкой на C++"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة عميقة في برمجة الأنظمة و C++20/23","محدود فقط بالتطوير باستخدام C++"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"37bdf44429de24568aad0a8fa179d9cdbb5220d35e1d5c8529dc1beac7a71e14","qualityScore":47}');
