INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('flutter-it/get_it/flutter-architecture-expert', 'flutter-architecture-expert', 'flutter-it', 'get_it', 'community', 'flutter-architecture-expert flutter-it get_it community Flutter架构专家提供简单的服务定位器，解耦接口和具体实现 Flutterアーキテクチャ専門家は、シンプルなサービスロケータを提供して、インターフェースと具体的な実装を解除 Flutter 아키텍처 전문가는 간단한 서비스 로케이터를 제공하여 인터페이스와 구체적인 구현을 분리 El experto en arquitectura Flutter es un localizador de servicios simple que permite desacoplar la interfaz de una implementación concreta L''expert en architecture Flutter est un localisateur de services simple qui permet de découpler l''interface d''une implémentation concrète Der Expert für Flutter-Architektur ist ein einfacher Service-Locator, der es ermöglicht, die Schnittstelle von einer konkreten Implementierung zu entkoppeln O especialista em arquitetura Flutter é uma ferramenta de IA que simplifica a criação de aplicações móveis, permitindo a decoupling da interface da implementação concreta Эксперт по архитектуре Flutter - это инструмент ИИ, который упрощает создание мобильных приложений, позволяя декуплировать интерфейс от конкретной реализации خبير هندسة Flutter هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي يسهل إنشاء التطبيقات المحمولة، مما يسمح بفصل الواجهة عن التنفيذ المحدد Get It - Simple direct Service Locator that allows to decouple the interface from a concrete implementation and to access the concrete implementation from everywhere in your App. Maintainer: @escamoteur 如何使用Flutter架构专家 什么是服务定位器 Flutter架构专家替代品 Flutter架构专家与其他工具的比较 安装Flutter架构专家 Flutter架构专家设置指南 Flutter开发 移动应用开发 Get It - Simple direct Service Locator that allows to decouple the interface from a concrete implementation and to access the concrete implementation from everywhere in your App. Maintainer: @escamoteur');
