sonalizados de SEO"],"ru":["Анализ SEO с помощью ИИ агентов","Выявление проблем SEO","Улучшение стратегии SEO","Интеграция с инструментами SEO","Пользовательские отчеты SEO"],"ar":["تحليل التدقيق الإلكتروني مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحديد مشاكل التدقيق الإلكتروني","تحسين استراتيجية التدقيق الإلكتروني","التكامل مع أدوات التدقيق الإلكتروني","تقارير مخصصة للتدقيق الإلكتروني"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用seo-audit工具","什么是AI智能代理","seo-audit工具下载","seo-audit工具教程","seo-audit工具替代品","seo-audit工具安装","seo-audit工具设置指南"],"ja":["seo-auditツールの使い方","AIエージェントとは","seo-auditツールのダウンロード","seo-auditツールのチュートリアル","seo-auditツールの代替","seo-auditツールのインストール","seo-auditツールの設定ガイド"],"ko":["seo-audit 도구 사용 방법","AI 에이전트란","seo-audit 도구 다운로드","seo-audit 도구 튜토리얼","seo-audit 도구 대체","seo-audit 도구 설치","seo-audit 도구 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de auditoría SEO","agentes de IA","optimización de código","mejores prácticas de SEO","desarrollo de agentes de IA","análisis de rendimiento","identificación de problemas de SEO","cómo usar herramientas de auditoría SEO","alternativas a herramientas de auditoría SEO"],"fr":["outils d''audit SEO","agents d''IA","optimisation de code","meilleures pratiques de SEO","développement d''agents d''IA","analyse de performances","identification des problèmes de SEO","comment utiliser des outils d''audit SEO","alternatives aux outils d''audit SEO"],"de":["SEO-Audit-Tools","KI-Agents","Code-Optimierung","Best Practices für SEO","Entwicklung von KI-Agents","Leistungsanalyse","Identifizierung von SEO-Problemen","wie man SEO-Audit-Tools verwendet","Alternativen zu SEO-Audit-Tools"],"pt":["como usar agentes de IA para SEO","o que é agente de IA para SEO","ferramentas de SEO para desenvolvedores","SEO para desenvolvedores","audit SEO com agentes de IA","melhorias de SEO com agentes de IA"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ агентов для SEO","что такое ИИ агент для SEO","инструменты SEO для разработчиков","SEO для разработчиков","аудит SEO с помощью ИИ агентов","улучшение SEO с помощью ИИ агентов"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي للتدقيق الإلكتروني","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي للتدقيق الإلكتروني","أدوات التدقيق الإلكتروني للمطورين","التدقيق الإلكتروني للمطورين","تدقيق التدقيق الإلكتروني مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين التدقيق الإلكتروني مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"pelan05","repo":"vscode_agents_folder","repoPath":"pelan05/vscode_agents_folder","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.677Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"seo-audit","description":"When the user wants to audit, review, or diagnose SEO issues on their site. Also use when the user mentions SEO audit, technical SEO, why am I not ranking, SEO issues, on-page SEO, meta tags review, or SEO health check. For building pages at scale to target keywords, see programmatic-seo. For adding structured data, see schema-markup.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (Sa","body":"# SEO Audit\n\nYou are an expert in search engine optimization. Your goal is to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance.\n\n## Initial Assessment\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nBefore auditing, understand:\n\n1. **Site Context**\n   - What type of site? (SaaS, e-commerce, blog, etc.)\n   - What''s the primary business goal for SEO?\n   - What keywords/topics are priorities?\n\n2. **Current State**\n   - Any known issues or concerns?\n   - Current organic traffic level?\n   - Recent changes or migrations?\n\n3. **Scope**\n   - Full site audit or specific pages?\n   - Technical + on-page, or one focus area?\n   - Access to Search Console / analytics?\n\n---\n\n## Audit Framework\n\n### Priority Order\n1. **Crawlability & Indexation** (can Google find and index it?)\n2. **Technical Foundations** (is the site fast and functional?)\n3. **On-Page Optimization** (is content optimized?)\n4. **Content Quality** (does it deserve to rank?)\n5. **Authority & Links** (does it have credibility?)\n\n---\n\n## Technical SEO Audit\n\n### Crawlability\n\n**Robots.txt**\n- Check for unintentional blocks\n- Verify important pages allowed\n- Check sitemap reference\n\n**XML Sitemap**\n- Exists and accessible\n- Submitted to Search Console\n- Contains only canonical, indexable URLs\n- Updated regularly\n- Proper formatting\n\n**Site Architecture**\n- Important pages within 3 clicks of homepage\n- Logical hierarchy\n- Internal linking structure\n- No orphan pages\n\n**Crawl Budget Issues** (for large sites)\n- Parameterized URLs under control\n- Faceted navigation handled properly\n- Infinite scroll with pagination fallback\n- Session IDs not in URLs\n\n### Indexation\n\n**Index Status**\n- site:domain.com check\n- Search Console coverage report\n- Compare indexed vs. expected\n\n**Indexation Issues**\n- Noindex tags on important pages\n- Canonicals pointing wrong direction\n- Redirect chains/loops\n- Soft 404s\n- Duplicate content without canonicals\n\n**Canonicalization**\n- All pages have canonical tags\n- Self-referencing canonicals on unique pages\n- HTTP → HTTPS canonicals\n- www vs. non-www consistency\n- Trailing slash consistency\n\n### Site Speed & Core Web Vitals\n\n**Core Web Vitals**\n- LCP (Largest Contentful Paint): < 2.5s\n- INP (Interaction to Next Paint): < 200ms\n- CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift): < 0.1\n\n**Speed Factors**\n- Server response time (TTFB)\n- Image optimization\n- JavaScript execution\n- CSS delivery\n- Caching headers\n- CDN usage\n- Font loading\n\n**Tools**\n- PageSpeed Insights\n- WebPageTest\n- Chrome DevTools\n- Search Console Core Web Vitals report\n\n### Mobile-Friendliness\n\n- Responsive design (not separate m. site)\n- Tap target sizes\n- Viewport configured\n- No horizontal scroll\n- Same content as desktop\n- Mobile-first indexing readiness\n\n### Security & HTTPS\n\n- HTTPS across entire site\n- Valid SSL certificate\n- No mixed content\n- HTTP → HTTPS redirects\n- HSTS header (bonus)\n\n### URL Structure\n\n- Readable, descriptive URLs\n- Keywords in URLs where natural\n- Consistent structure\n- No unnecessary parameters\n- Lowercase and hyphen-separated\n\n---\n\n## On-Page SEO Audit\n\n### Title Tags\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique titles for each page\n- Primary keyword near beginning\n- 50-60 characters (visible in SERP)\n- Compelling and click-worthy\n- Brand name placement (end, usually)\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate titles\n- Too long (truncated)\n- Too short (wasted opportunity)\n- Keyword stuffing\n- Missing entirely\n\n### Meta Descriptions\n\n**Check for:**\n- Unique descriptions per page\n- 150-160 characters\n- Includes primary keyword\n- Clear value proposition\n- Call to action\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Duplicate descriptions\n- Auto-generated garbage\n- Too long/short\n- No compelling reason to click\n\n### Heading Structure\n\n**Check for:**\n- One H1 per page\n- H1 contains primary keyword\n- Logical hierarchy (H1 → H2 → H3)\n- Headings describe content\n- Not just for styling\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Multiple H1s\n- Skip levels (H1 → H3)\n- Headings used for styling only\n- No H1 on page\n\n### Content Optimization\n\n**Primary Page Content**\n- Keyword in first 100 words\n- Related keywords naturally used\n- Sufficient depth/length for topic\n- Answers search intent\n- Better than competitors\n\n**Thin Content Issues**\n- Pages with little unique content\n- Tag/category pages with no value\n- Doorway pages\n- Duplicate or near-duplicate content\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n**Check for:**\n- Descriptive file names\n- Alt text on all images\n- Alt text describes image\n- Compressed file sizes\n- Modern formats (WebP)\n- Lazy loading implemented\n- Responsive images\n\n### Internal Linking\n\n**Check for:**\n- Important pages well-linked\n- Descriptive anchor text\n- Logical link relationships\n- No broken internal links\n- Reasonable link count per page\n\n**Common issues:**\n- Orphan pages (no internal links)\n- Over-optimized anchor text\n- Important pages buried\n- Excessive footer/sidebar links\n\n### Keyword Targeting\n\n**Per Page**\n- Clear primary keyword target\n- Title, H1, URL aligned\n- Content satisfies search intent\n- Not competing with other pages (cannibalization)\n\n**Site-Wide**\n- Keyword mapping document\n- No major gaps in coverage\n- No keyword cannibalization\n- Logical topical clusters\n\n---\n\n## Content Quality Assessment\n\n### E-E-A-T Signals\n\n**Experience**\n- First-hand experience demonstrated\n- Original insights/data\n- Real examples and case studies\n\n**Expertise**\n- Author credentials visible\n- Accurate, detailed information\n- Properly sourced claims\n\n**Authoritativeness**\n- Recognized in the space\n- Cited by others\n- Industry credentials\n\n**Trustworthiness**\n- Accurate information\n- Transparent about business\n- Contact information available\n- Privacy policy, terms\n- Secure site (HTTPS)\n\n### Content Depth\n\n- Comprehensive coverage of topic\n- Answers follow-up questions\n- Better than top-ranking competitors\n- Updated and current\n\n### User Engagement Signals\n\n- Time on page\n- Bounce rate in context\n- Pages per session\n- Return visits\n\n---\n\n## Common Issues by Site Type\n\n### SaaS/Product Sites\n- Product pages lack content depth\n- Blog not integrated with product pages\n- Missing comparison/alternative pages\n- Feature pages thin on content\n- No glossary/educational content\n\n### E-commerce\n- Thin category pages\n- Duplicate product descriptions\n- Missing product schema\n- Faceted navigation creating duplicates\n- Out-of-stock pages mishandled\n\n### Content/Blog Sites\n- Outdated content not refreshed\n- Keyword cannibalization\n- No topical clustering\n- Poor internal linking\n- Missing author pages\n\n### Local Business\n- Inconsistent NAP\n- Missing local schema\n- No Google Business Profile optimization\n- Missing location pages\n- No local content\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n### Audit Report Structure\n\n**Executive Summary**\n- Overall health assessment\n- Top 3-5 priority issues\n- Quick wins identified\n\n**Technical SEO Findings**\nFor each issue:\n- **Issue**: What''s wrong\n- **Impact**: SEO impact (High/Medium/Low)\n- **Evidence**: How you found it\n- **Fix**: Specific recommendation\n- **Priority**: 1-5 or High/Medium/Low\n\n**On-Page SEO Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Content Findings**\nSame format as above\n\n**Prioritized Action Plan**\n1. Critical fixes (blocking indexation/ranking)\n2. High-impact improvements\n3. Quick wins (easy, immediate benefit)\n4. Long-term recommendations\n\n---\n\n## References\n\n- [AI Writing Detection](references/ai-writing-detection.md): Common AI writing patterns to avoid (em dashes, overused phrases, filler words)\n- [AEO & GEO Patterns](references/aeo-geo-patterns.md): Content patterns optimized for answer engines and AI citation\n\n---\n\n## Tools Referenced\n\n**Free Tools**\n- Google Search Console (essential)\n- Google PageSpeed Insights\n- Bing Webmaster Tools\n- Rich Results Test\n- Mobile-Friendly Test\n- Schema Validator\n\n**Paid Tools** (if available)\n- Screaming Frog\n- Ahrefs / Semrush\n- Sitebulb\n- ContentKing\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What pages/keywords matter most?\n2. Do you have Search Console access?\n3. Any recent changes or migrations?\n4. Who are your top organic competitors?\n5. What''s your current organic traffic baseline?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **programmatic-seo**: For building SEO pages at scale\n- **schema-markup**: For implementing structured data\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pages for conversion (not just ranking)\n- **analytics-tracking**: For measuring SEO performance\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:24:17.438Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Digital Marketing Agents requiring in-depth website analysis and SEO optimization expertise.","zh":"适合需要对网站进行深入分析和 SEO 优化专家的数字营销代理","ja":"デジタル マーケティング エージェントが深入な Web サイト分析と SEO 最適化の専門知識を必要とする場合に適しています","ko":"디지털 마케팅 에이전트가 웹사이트 분석 및 SEO 최적화를 위한 전문 지식을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de marketing digital que requieren un análisis profundo de sitios web y experiencia en optimización de SEO.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de marketing numérique nécessitant une analyse approfondie de sites web et une expertise en optimisation de SEO.","de":"Ideal für digitale Marketingagenten, die eine umfassende Website-Analyse und SEO-Optimierungs-Expertise erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Marketing Digital que exigem análise aprofundada de sites e especialização em otimização de SEO.","ru":"Идеально для цифровых маркетинговых агентов, требующих глубокого анализа сайтов и экспертизы в области оптимизации SEO.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل الإعلام الرقمية التي تتطلب تحليلًا متعمقًا لمواقع الويب وخبيرًا في تحسين محركات البحث SEO."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify SEO issues and provide actionable recommendations to improve organic search performance by analyzing site context, product marketing context, and technical SEO aspects like site type and structure, leveraging files like ''.claude/product-marketing-context.md'' for context.","zh":"通过分析网站上下文、产品营销上下文和技术 SEO 方面（如网站类型和结构），并利用类似 ''.claude/product-marketing-context.md'' 的文件来获取上下文，能够使代理识别 SEO 问题并提供可行的建议来提高有机搜索性能","ja":"サイトのコンテキスト、プロダクト マーケティング コンテキスト、技術 SEO の側面（例：サイトの種類と構造）を分析し、''.claude/product-marketing-context.md'' のようなファイルを使用してコンテキストを取得することで、エージェントが SEO の問題を識別し、有機的な検索パフォーマンスを改善するための実行可能な推奨を提供できるようにします","ko":"사이트의 콘텍스트, 프로덕트 마케팅 콘텍스트, 기술 SEO의 측면(예: 사이트의 유형과 구조)을 분석하고, ''.claude/product-marketing-context.md''와 같은 파일을 사용하여 콘텍스트를 얻는 것으로, 에이전트가 SEO 문제를 식별하고 유기적인 검색 성능을 개선하기 위한 실현 가능한 추천을 제공할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar problemas de SEO y brindar recomendaciones concretas para mejorar el rendimiento de búsqueda orgánica analizando el contexto del sitio, el contexto de marketing de productos y los aspectos técnicos de SEO como el tipo y la estructura del sitio, utilizando archivos como ''.claude/product-marketing-context.md'' para contexto.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier les problèmes de SEO et de fournir des recommandations concrètes pour améliorer les performances de recherche organique en analysant le contexte du site, le contexte de marketing de produits et les aspects techniques de SEO comme le type et la structure du site, en utilisant des fichiers comme ''.claude/product-marketing-context.md'' pour le contexte.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, SEO-Probleme zu identifizieren und handhabbare Empfehlungen zu geben, um die organische Suchleistung zu verbessern, indem sie den Kontext der Website, den Kontext des Produktmarketings und die technischen SEO-Aspekte wie den Typ und die Struktur der Website analysieren, unter Verwendung von Dateien wie ''.claude/product-marketing-context.md'' für den Kontext.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar problemas de SEO e fornecer recomendações práticas para melhorar o desempenho de busca orgânica, analisando o contexto do site, o contexto de marketing de produtos e os aspectos técnicos de SEO, como o tipo e a estrutura do site, utilizando arquivos como ''.claude/product-marketing-context.md'' para contexto.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять проблемы SEO и предоставлять действенные рекомендации для улучшения органического поискового выступления, анализируя контекст сайта, контекст маркетинга продукции и технические аспекты SEO, такие как тип и структура сайта, используя файлы, такие как ''.claude/product-marketing-context.md'', для контекста.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من تحديد مشاكل تحسين محركات البحث SEO و تقديم توصيات قابلة للتنفيذ لتحسين أداء البحث العضوية من خلال تحليل سياق الموقع و سياق تسويق المنتج و الجوانب الفنية لتحسين محركات البحث مثل نوع هيكل الموقع، مستخدمين ملفات مثل ''.claude/product-marketing-context.md'' للسياق."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing website structures for SEO compliance","Analyzing product marketing context for optimization opportunities","Identifying technical SEO issues hindering search performance"],"zh":["网站结构的 SEO 合规性审计","产品营销上下文的优化机会分析","搜索性能受限的技术 SEO 问题的识别"],"ja":["SEO 対応性を確保するための Web サイト構造の監査","最適化の機会を分析するためのプロダクト マーケティング コンテキスト","検索パフォーマンスを妨げる技術 SEO の問題の識別"],"ko":["SEO 준수성을 보장하기 위한 웹사이트 구조의 감사","최적화를 위한 기회를 분석하기 위한 프로덕트 마케팅 콘텍스트","검색 성능을 제한하는 기술 SEO 문제의 식별"],"es":["Auditoría de estructuras de sitios web para cumplimiento de SEO","Análisis del contexto de marketing de productos para oportunidades de optimización","Identificación de problemas técnicos de SEO que obstaculizan el rendimiento de búsqueda"],"fr":["Audit de structures de sites web pour la conformité SEO","Analyse du contexte de marketing de produits pour les opportunités d''optimisation","Identification des problèmes techniques de SEO qui entravent les performances de recherche"],"de":["Prüfung von Website-Strukturen auf SEO-Konformität","Analyse des Produktmarketing-Kontexts für Optimierungsmöglichkeiten","Identifizierung von technischen SEO-Problemen, die die Suchleistung behindern"],"pt":["Auditoria de estruturas de sites para conformidade com SEO","Análise do contexto de marketing de produtos para oportunidades de otimização","Identificação de problemas técnicos de SEO que impedem o desempenho de busca"],"ru":["Проверка структуры сайтов на соответствие требованиям SEO","Анализ контекста маркетинга продукции для выявления возможностей оптимизации","Выявление технических проблем SEO, препятствующих поисковому выступлению"],"ar":["تدقيق هياكل المواقع للامتثال لتحسين محركات البحث SEO","تحليل سياق تسويق المنتج لفرص التحسين","تحديد مشاكل فنية في تحسين محركات البحث التي تعوق أداء البحث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to site context and product marketing context files","Limited to analyzing provided site and marketing context information"],"zh":["需要访问网站上下文和产品营销上下文文件","仅限于分析提供的网站和营销上下文信息"],"ja":["サイトのコンテキストとプロダクト マーケティング コンテキスト ファイルへのアクセスが必要です","提供されたサイトとマーケティング コンテキスト情報のみを分析することができます"],"ko":["사이트의 콘텍스트와 프로덕트 마케팅 콘텍스트 파일에 접근해야 합니다","제공된 사이트와 마케팅 콘텍스트 정보만 분석할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de contexto de sitio y contexto de marketing de productos","Limitado a analizar la información de contexto de sitio y marketing proporcionada"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux fichiers de contexte de site et de contexte de marketing de produits","Limité à l''analyse des informations de contexte de site et de marketing fournies"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Dateien des Website-Kontexts und des Produktmarketing-Kontexts","Begrenzt auf die Analyse der bereitgestellten Website- und Marketingkontext-Informationen"],"pt":["Exige acesso a arquivos de contexto do site e contexto de marketing de produtos","Limitado à análise das informações de contexto do site e marketing fornecidas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам контекста сайта и контекста маркетинга продукции","Ограничен анализом предоставленной информации контекста сайта и маркетинга"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات سياق الموقع و سياق تسويق المنتج","محدود بتحليل المعلومات المُقدمة حول سياق الموقع و التسويق"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"51fdd3616ae1dd1209e0f7344582e76bed640c182118df9824859470249031d7","qualityScore":47}');
