واق المالية لإيثريوم","سهلة الاستخدام والتركيب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用open-eth-terminal-action-generator","什么是以太坊金融市场研究","open-eth-terminal-action-generator安装","open-eth-terminal-action-generator设置指南","open-eth-terminal-action-generator替代品","open-eth-terminal-action-generator vs 其他工具"],"ja":["open-eth-terminal-action-generatorの使い方","イーサリアム金融市場の研究とは","open-eth-terminal-action-generatorのインストール","open-eth-terminal-action-generatorの設定ガイド","open-eth-terminal-action-generatorの代替品","open-eth-terminal-action-generator vs 他のツール"],"ko":["open-eth-terminal-action-generator 사용법","이더리움 금융 시장 연구란","open-eth-terminal-action-generator 설치","open-eth-terminal-action-generator 설정 가이드","open-eth-terminal-action-generator 대체품","open-eth-terminal-action-generator vs 다른 도구"],"es":["herramienta de agregación de datos","traders minoristas de Ethereum","investigación financiera","CLI","Node.js","mercados financieros de Ethereum","cómo usar open-eth-terminal-action-generator","alternativas a open-eth-terminal-action-generator","open-eth-terminal-action-generator vs competidores","instalación de open-eth-terminal-action-generator","guía de configuración de open-eth-terminal-action-generator"],"fr":["outil d''aggrégation de données","traders de détail Ethereum","recherche financière","CLI","Node.js","marchés financiers Ethereum","comment utiliser open-eth-terminal-action-generator","alternatives à open-eth-terminal-action-generator","open-eth-terminal-action-generator vs concurrents","installation de open-eth-terminal-action-generator","guide de configuration de open-eth-terminal-action-generator"],"de":["Datenaggregations-Tool","Ethereum-Privatanleger","Finanzforschung","CLI","Node.js","Finanzmärkte von Ethereum","wie man open-eth-terminal-action-generator verwendet","Alternativen zu open-eth-terminal-action-generator","open-eth-terminal-action-generator vs Wettbewerber","Installation von open-eth-terminal-action-generator","Konfigurationshandbuch für open-eth-terminal-action-generator"],"pt":["como usar open-eth-terminal-action-generator","o que é open-eth-terminal-action-generator","ferramentas de agregação de dados em Ethereum","open-eth-terminal-action-generator alternativa","open-eth-terminal-action-generator vs outras ferramentas","instalar open-eth-terminal-action-generator","guia de configuração do open-eth-terminal-action-generator","open-eth-terminal-action-generator para traders retais"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент open-eth-terminal-action-generator","что такое ИИ Агент open-eth-terminal-action-generator","инструменты сбора данных для рынков Ethereum","ИИ Агент open-eth-terminal-action-generator альтернатива","ИИ Агент open-eth-terminal-action-generator vs другие инструменты","установка ИИ Агента open-eth-terminal-action-generator","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента open-eth-terminal-action-generator","ИИ Агент open-eth-terminal-action-generator для розничных трейдеров"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أداة تجميع البيانات open-eth-terminal-action-generator","ما هي أداة تجميع البيانات open-eth-terminal-action-generator","أدوات تجميع البيانات للأسواق المالية لإيثريوم","أداة تجميع البيانات open-eth-terminal-action-generator بديلة","أداة تجميع البيانات open-eth-terminal-action-generator مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت أداة تجميع البيانات open-eth-terminal-action-generator","دليل إعداد أداة تجميع البيانات open-eth-terminal-action-generator","أداة تجميع البيانات open-eth-terminal-action-generator لتجار التجزئة"]}},"owner":"jfarid27","repo":"open-eth-terminal","repoPath":"jfarid27/open-eth-terminal","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.892Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"open-eth-terminal-action-generator","description":"","version":"0.0.1","bodyPreview":"# Open Eth Terminal Action Generator\n\nYou are an expert action generator for the open-eth-terminal application.\nYour goal is to assist users in creating new actions for the application.\n\n## Context\n\n\n### Introduction\n\nPlease look at the README.md file for more information about the application and familiarize yourself\nwith the goal of the application, which is to be a CLI interface to organize and access information\nabout Financial Markets. Most of the code is focused on bundling API access to v","body":"# Open Eth Terminal Action Generator\n\nYou are an expert action generator for the open-eth-terminal application.\nYour goal is to assist users in creating new actions for the application.\n\n## Context\n\n\n### Introduction\n\nPlease look at the README.md file for more information about the application and familiarize yourself\nwith the goal of the application, which is to be a CLI interface to organize and access information\nabout Financial Markets. Most of the code is focused on bundling API access to various data sources\ninto a CLI interface users can download. They may also specify API keys for some services.\n\nYour task is to generate boilerplate code for an action and work with the\nuser to generate the appropriate code for the action.\n\n### Code Structure\n\nThe open-eth-terminal application is a CLI interface to Ethereum Financial Markets. The overall\nstructure of the application is as follows:\n\n```bash\nOpenEthTerminal/\n├── deno.json\n├── open-eth-terminal/\n│   ├── index.ts        -- Main terminal application entry point.\n│   ├── [Menu]          -- Namespaced Menu folders for logical menu groupings.\n│   ├──     [SubMenu]/  -- Possible submenus within the namespace for the menu.\n│   ├──         [...]\n│   ├──     actions/   -- Action code for commands that fetch or show data.\n│   ├──     model/     -- Model code that abstracts data fetching necessary to show data.\n│   ├──     types.ts   -- Typescript Typings for the specific menu.\n│   ├──     utils.ts   -- Utilities for the specific menu.\n│   ├──     index.ts\n│   ├── utils.ts   -- Utilities for the application.\n│   ├── types.ts   -- Typescript Typings for the application.\n├── package.json\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── scripts/             -- OpenEthTerminal scripts folder.\n│   ├── script1.txt\n│   └── script2.txt\n├── skills/              -- Skills for the application.\n├── README.md            -- README for the application.\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\nWhen users call on this agent, follow this workflow:\n\n1.  **Prospecting**: Show a general greeting found in the [./references/greeting.md](./references/greeting.md) file.\n    Ask the user for a description of the action they would like to create. If they wish to create a new menu, prepare to generate a menu with multiple submenus and actions associated with the submenus. \n    \n    Ask the user for the name of the new command and suggest a structure\n    if the command is a new submenu. Also query the user for any API code as well as\n    any suggested output you would like to generate for the user when the action is executed.\n2.  **Generating**:\n    After confirming the user''s request, generate the appropriate code for the action.\n    \n    There are template files for a menu and submenu in the\n    [./references/templates/](./references/templates/) folder.\n    At the top level, there is a MockMenu folder that contains a\n    template for a menu and submenu.\n    \n    For environment variable linking, please do these steps:\n    \n    - Look at the (./../../open_eth_terminal/types.ts) file and add the\n      environment variables to the TerminalUserStateConfig interface. Also\n      add the environment variable to the APIKeyType enum.\n    - Look at the (./../../open_eth_terminal/index.ts) file and add the\n      environment variables to the instantiation of the TerminalUserStateConfig object when the application starts.\n    - Notify the user that the environment variables must be added to\n      the .env file in the root directory of the application. It is likely\n      you do not have access to this file, due to security reasons, so \n      please make it clear to the user that they will need to add the\n      environment variables to the .env file manually with the correct\n      name.\n      \n    After environment variables are linked, generate the appropriate code for the action.\n    \n    Note that the import links in the template files are relative to the\n    open_eth_terminal folder using standard deno import paths. You will\n    need to modify the links to point to the correct location of the\n    files.\n    \n3.  **Confirmation**:\n    After generating the appropriate files, generate a short summary of\n    your actions and show the user areas where they will need to generate\n    custom code. The boilerplate will be expected to not be perfect and\n    generate mock code that the user will need to modify.\n\n4.  **Feedback**: Once the code is generated, you may ask the user if the\n    output was what they expected or if they would like to modify it.\n    If the user is satisfied with the output, ask them if they would like to exit or continue the conversation.\n\n    If the user would like to modify the output, ask them appropriate questions to clarify their goal, and return\n    to step 1.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:55:03.830Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Financial Analysis Agents needing advanced Ethereum market data aggregation and CLI interface capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级以太坊市场数据聚合和CLI接口功能的金融分析代理。","ja":"高度なEthereum市場データの集約とCLIインターフェースの機能が必要な金融分析エージェントに最適。","ko":"고급 이더리움 시장 데이터 집계 및 CLI 인터페이스 기능이 필요한 금융 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis Financiero que necesitan una agregación avanzada de datos del mercado de Ethereum y capacidades de interfaz de línea de comandos (CLI).","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse Financière ayant besoin d''une aggregation avancée de données du marché Ethereum et de capacités d''interface de ligne de commande (CLI).","de":"Perfekt für Finanzanalyse-Agents, die eine erweiterte Ethereum-Marktdaten-Aggregation und CLI-Schnittstellenfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Financeira que precisam de agregação avançada de dados de mercado Ethereum e capacidades de interface CLI.","ru":"Идеально подходит для финансовых аналитических агентов, которым необходима продвинутая агрегация данных рынка Ethereum и возможности интерфейса CLI.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل التحليل المالي التي تحتاج إلى تجميع بيانات سوق إيثريوم المتقدمة وقدرات واجهة CLI."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate high-quality research actions for Ethereum financial markets, utilizing API access and CLI interface to organize and access financial market information, with a focus on bundling API access to various data sources.","zh":"赋予代理生成以太坊金融市场高质量研究行动的能力，利用API访问和CLI接口组织和访问金融市场信息，重点是将API访问绑定到各种数据源。","ja":"Ethereum金融市場の高品質な研究アクションを生成するエージェントの能力を与え、APIアクセスとCLIインターフェースを使用して金融市場情報にアクセスし、組織化し、様々なデータソースへのAPIアクセスをバンドルすることに重点を置く。","ko":"에이전트가 이더리움 금융 시장의 고급 연구 동작을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 API 액세스 및 CLI 인터페이스를 사용하여 금융 시장 정보에 액세스하고 구성하며 다양한 데이터 소스에 대한 API 액세스를 묶는 데 중점을 둡니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar acciones de investigación de alta calidad para los mercados financieros de Ethereum, utilizando el acceso a la API y la interfaz de línea de comandos (CLI) para organizar y acceder a la información del mercado financiero, con un enfoque en la agrupación del acceso a la API a varias fuentes de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des actions de recherche de haute qualité pour les marchés financiers Ethereum, en utilisant l''accès à l''API et l''interface de ligne de commande (CLI) pour organiser et accéder à l''information du marché financier, avec un focus sur le regroupement de l''accès à l''API à différentes sources de données.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, hochwertige Forschungsaktionen für die Ethereum-Finanzmärkte zu generieren, indem es den Zugriff auf die API und die CLI-Schnittstelle nutzt, um Finanzmarktdaten zu organisieren und zu zugreifen, mit Fokus auf die Bündelung des API-Zugriffs auf verschiedene Datenquellen.","pt":"Habilita agentes a gerar ações de pesquisa de alta qualidade para mercados financeiros Ethereum, utilizando acesso à API e interface CLI para organizar e acessar informações do mercado financeiro, com foco em embalar o acesso à API a várias fontes de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать высококачественные исследовательские действия для финансовых рынков Ethereum, используя доступ к API и интерфейс командной строки для организации и доступа к информации финансового рынка, с фокусом на объединении доступа к API различных источников данных.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من生成 إجراءات بحث عالية الجودة لأسواق إيثريوم المالية، باستخدام وصول إلى API وواجهة CLI لتنظيم الوصول إلى معلومات السوق المالية، مع التركيز على حزمة وصول API إلى مصادر بيانات متعددة."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating new actions for the open-eth-terminal application","Aggregating data from multiple Ethereum financial market APIs","Creating custom CLI interfaces for retail traders to access financial market information"],"zh":["为open-eth-terminal应用程序生成新的动作","从多个Ethereum金融市场API聚合数据","为零售交易者创建自定义CLI接口以访问金融市场信息"],"ja":["open-eth-terminalアプリケーション用の新しいアクションを生成する","複数のEthereum金融市場APIからのデータを集約する","小売りトレーダーが金融市場情報にアクセスするためのカスタムCLIインターフェースを作成する"],"ko":["open-eth-terminal 애플리케이션에 대한 새로운 동작 생성","複数의 이더리움 금융 시장 API에서 데이터를 집계","소매 투자자가 금융 시장 정보에 액세스할 수 있는 사용자 지정 CLI 인터페이스 생성"],"es":["Generación de nuevas acciones para la aplicación open-eth-terminal","Agregación de datos de múltiples APIs de mercados financieros de Ethereum","Creación de interfaces de línea de comandos (CLI) personalizadas para que los traders minoristas accedan a la información del mercado financiero"],"fr":["Génération de nouvelles actions pour l''application open-eth-terminal","Aggregation de données de plusieurs API de marchés financiers Ethereum","Création d''interfaces de ligne de commande (CLI) personnalisées pour que les traders de détail accèdent à l''information du marché financier"],"de":["Generierung neuer Aktionen für die open-eth-terminal-Anwendung","Agrregation von Daten aus mehreren Ethereum-Finanzmarkt-APIs","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten CLI-Schnittstellen für Einzelhändler, um auf Finanzmarktdaten zuzugreifen"],"pt":["Geração de novas ações para o aplicativo open-eth-terminal","Agregação de dados de várias APIs de mercados financeiros Ethereum","Criação de interfaces CLI personalizadas para comerciantes varejistas acessarem informações do mercado financeiro"],"ru":["Генерация новых действий для приложения open-eth-terminal","Агрегация данных из нескольких API финансовых рынков Ethereum","Создание пользовательских интерфейсов командной строки для розничных торговцев для доступа к информации финансового рынка"],"ar":["جديد إجراءات لتطبيق open-eth-terminal","تجميع البيانات من واجهات برمجة تطبيقات متعددة لأسواق إيثريوم المالية","إنشاء واجهات CLI مخصصة للسماسرة بالتجزئة للوصول إلى معلومات السوق المالية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires familiarity with the open-eth-terminal application and its README.md file","Focused on Ethereum financial markets, limiting its applicability to other markets","CLI-based, which may limit its usability for agents requiring graphical interfaces"],"zh":["需要熟悉open-eth-terminal应用程序及其README.md文件","仅限于以太坊金融市场，限制了其对其他市场的适用性","基于CLI的，这可能限制了需要图形界面的代理的可用性"],"ja":["open-eth-terminalアプリケーションとそのREADME.mdファイルに精通する必要がある","Ethereum金融市場のみに焦点を当てているため、他の市場への適用可能性が制限される","CLIベースであるため、グラフィカルインターフェースを必要とするエージェントの使用可能性が制限される可能性がある"],"ko":["open-eth-terminal 애플리케이션 및 해당 README.md 파일에 익숙해야 함","이더리움 금융 시장에만 중점을 두고 있어 다른 시장에 대한 적용 가능성이 제한됨","CLI 기반으로 그래픽 인터페이스를 필요로 하는 에이전트의 사용 가능성이 제한될 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere familiaridad con la aplicación open-eth-terminal y su archivo README.md","Se centra en los mercados financieros de Ethereum, lo que limita su aplicabilidad a otros mercados","Basado en la interfaz de línea de comandos (CLI), lo que puede limitar su usabilidad para los agentes que requieren interfaces gráficas"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de l''application open-eth-terminal et de son fichier README.md","Se concentre sur les marchés financiers Ethereum, ce qui limite son applicabilité à d''autres marchés","Basé sur l''interface de ligne de commande (CLI), ce qui peut limiter son utilisabilité pour les agents nécessitant des interfaces graphiques"],"de":["Benötigt Vertrautheit mit der open-eth-terminal-Anwendung und ihrer README.md-Datei","Konzentriert sich auf die Ethereum-Finanzmärkte, was ihre Anwendbarkeit auf andere Märkte einschränkt","Basierend auf der CLI-Schnittstelle, was ihre Benutzbarkeit für Agents, die grafische Schnittstellen benötigen, einschränken kann"],"pt":["Exige familiaridade com o aplicativo open-eth-terminal e seu arquivo README.md","Focado em mercados financeiros Ethereum, limitando sua aplicabilidade a outros mercados","Baseado em CLI, o que pode limitar sua usabilidade para agentes que exigem interfaces gráficas"],"ru":["Требует знакомства с приложением open-eth-terminal и его файлом README.md","Сосредоточен на финансовых рынках Ethereum, что ограничивает его применимость к другим рынкам","Основан на CLI, что может ограничить его удобство использования для агентов, требующих графических интерфейсов"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بتطبيق open-eth-terminal وملفه README.md","يركز على أسواق إيثريوم المالية، مما يحد من تطبيقه على أسواق أخرى","قائم على واجهة CLI، مما قد يحد من سهولة استخدامه对于 الوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى واجهات графية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"62464c0b63a8a66c46bac991ea9d0ab28ee3b8928a2771d2707f241e8ac34a80","qualityScore":47}');
