epo进行优化"],"ja":["効率的なmonorepo管理","フルスタックアプリの迅速な開発・カスタマイズ・デプロイ","柔軟なカスタマイズと拡張","Webとモバイルプラットフォームのサポート","Turborepoによる最適化"],"ko":["효율적인 모노리포 관리","풀스택 앱의 빠른 개발 및 배포","유연한 사용자 정의 및 확장","웹 및 모바일 플랫폼 지원","Turborepo를 통한 최적화"],"es":["Desarrollo rápido de aplicaciones de UI","Personalización y deploy en web y móviles","Gestión eficiente de monorepo con Turborepo","Inspiration en Expo para desarrollo de aplicaciones","Compatibilidad con tecnologías de vanguardia como React y Node.js"],"fr":["Développement rapide d''applications UI","Personnalisation et déploiement sur le web et les mobiles","Gestion efficace de monorepo avec Turborepo","Inspiré par Expo pour le développement d''applications","Compatibilité avec des technologies de pointe comme React et Node.js"],"de":["Schnelle Entwicklung von UI-Anwendungen","Anpassung und Bereitstellung auf Web und Mobilgeräten","Effizientes Monorepo-Management mit Turborepo","Von Expo inspirierte Entwicklung von Anwendungen","Kompatibilität mit modernen Technologien wie React und Node.js"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento rápido de aplicativos fullstack","Gestão de monorepo eficiente com Turborepo","Customização e deployment de apps em várias plataformas","Inspiração em Expo para desenvolvimento de aplicativos","Suporte a múltiplas plataformas, incluindo web e mobile"],"ru":["Быстрая разработка приложений на основе ИИ Агентов","Эффективное управление монорепозиторием с помощью Turborepo","Кастомизация и развертывание приложений на нескольких платформах","Вдохновлен Expo для разработки приложений","Поддержка нескольких платформ, включая веб и мобильные"],"ar":["إنشاء سريع لتطبيقات متعددة المنصات","إدارة مونو ريبوزиторي فعالة مع Turborepo","تخصيص وتنصيب تطبيقات على منصات متعددة","منصة شاملة لإنشاء تطبيقات متعددة المنصات","دعم لمنصات متعددة، بما في ذلك الويب والموبايل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用MagicAppDev","MagicAppDev是什么","MagicAppDev替代品","MagicAppDev vs Expo","MagicAppDev安装","MagicAppDev设置指南","全栈应用开发","monorepo管理"],"ja":["MagicAppDevの使い方","MagicAppDevとは","MagicAppDevの代替","MagicAppDev vs Expo","MagicAppDevのインストール","MagicAppDevの設定ガイド","フルスタックアプリ開発","monorepo管理"],"ko":["MagicAppDev 사용 방법","MagicAppDev란","MagicAppDev 대체품","MagicAppDev vs Expo","MagicAppDev 설치","MagicAppDev 설정 가이드","풀스택 앱 개발","모노리포 관리"],"es":["herramientas de UI","desarrollo de aplicaciones de UI","MagicAppDev","Turborepo","Expo","React","Node.js","cómo usar MagicAppDev","guía de instalación de MagicAppDev"],"fr":["outils d''UI","développement d''applications UI","MagicAppDev","Turborepo","Expo","React","Node.js","comment utiliser MagicAppDev","guide d''installation de MagicAppDev"],"de":["KI-Tools","Entwicklung von UI-Anwendungen","MagicAppDev","Turborepo","Expo","React","Node.js","wie man MagicAppDev verwendet","Installationsanleitung für MagicAppDev"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia para desenvolvimento de ui","desenvolvimento de aplicativos fullstack","turborepo","expo","desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","desenvolvimento de aplicativos web","como usar turborepo","o que é expo"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для построения UI","быстрая разработка приложений","эффективное управление монорепозиторием","turborepo","expo","разработка приложений на основе ИИ Агентов","как использовать turborepo","что такое expo"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لإنشاء واجهات المستخدم","إنشاء سريع لتطبيقات متعددة المنصات","إدارة مونو ريبوزиторي فعالة","turborepo","expo","إنشاء تطبيقات متعددة المنصات","كيفية استخدام turborepo","ما هي منصة expo"]}},"owner":"magicappdev","repo":"magicappdev","repoPath":"magicappdev/magicappdev","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.938Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"building-ui","description":"Complete guide for building beautiful apps with Expo Router. Covers fundamentals, styling, components, navigation, animations, patterns, and native tabs.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Expo UI Guidelines\n\n## References\n\nConsult these resources as needed:\n\n- ./references/route-structure.md -- Route file conventions, dynamic routes, query parameters, groups, and folder organization\n- ./references/tabs.md -- Native tab bar with NativeTabs, migration from JS tabs, iOS 26 features\n- ./references/icons.md -- SF Symbols with expo-symbols, common icon names, animations, and weights\n- ./references/controls.md -- Native iOS controls: Switch, Slider, SegmentedControl, DateTimePicker, P","body":"# Expo UI Guidelines\n\n## References\n\nConsult these resources as needed:\n\n- ./references/route-structure.md -- Route file conventions, dynamic routes, query parameters, groups, and folder organization\n- ./references/tabs.md -- Native tab bar with NativeTabs, migration from JS tabs, iOS 26 features\n- ./references/icons.md -- SF Symbols with expo-symbols, common icon names, animations, and weights\n- ./references/controls.md -- Native iOS controls: Switch, Slider, SegmentedControl, DateTimePicker, Picker\n- ./references/visual-effects.md -- Blur effects with expo-blur and liquid glass with expo-glass-effect\n- ./references/animations.md -- Reanimated animations: entering, exiting, layout, scroll-driven, and gestures\n- ./references/search.md -- Search bar integration with headers, useSearch hook, and filtering patterns\n- ./references/gradients.md -- CSS gradients using experimental_backgroundImage (New Architecture only)\n- ./references/media.md -- Media handling for Expo Router including camera, audio, video, and file saving\n- ./references/storage.md -- Data storage patterns including SQLite, AsyncStorage, and SecureStore\n- ./references/webgpu-three.md -- 3D graphics, games, and GPU-powered visualizations with WebGPU and Three.js\n\n## Running the App\n\n**CRITICAL: Always try Expo Go first before creating custom builds.**\n\nMost Expo apps work in Expo Go without any custom native code. Before running `npx expo run:ios` or `npx expo run:android`:\n\n1. **Start with Expo Go**: Run `npx expo start` and scan the QR code with Expo Go\n2. **Check if features work**: Test your app thoroughly in Expo Go\n3. **Only create custom builds when required** - see below\n\n### When Custom Builds Are Required\n\nYou need `npx expo run:ios/android` or `eas build` ONLY when using:\n\n- **Local Expo modules** (custom native code in `modules/`)\n- **Apple targets** (widgets, app clips, extensions via `@bacons/apple-targets`)\n- **Third-party native modules** not included in Expo Go\n- **Custom native configuration** that can''t be expressed in `app.json`\n\n### When Expo Go Works\n\nExpo Go supports a huge range of features out of the box:\n\n- All `expo-*` packages (camera, location, notifications, etc.)\n- Expo Router navigation\n- Most UI libraries (reanimated, gesture handler, etc.)\n- Push notifications, deep links, and more\n\n**If you''re unsure, try Expo Go first.** Creating custom builds adds complexity, slower iteration, and requires Xcode/Android Studio setup.\n\n## Code Style\n\n- Be cautious of unterminated strings. Ensure nested backticks are escaped; never forget to escape quotes correctly.\n- Always use import statements at the top of the file.\n- Always use kebab-case for file names, e.g. `comment-card.tsx`\n- Always remove old route files when moving or restructuring navigation\n- Never use special characters in file names\n- Configure tsconfig.json with path aliases, and prefer aliases over relative imports for refactors.\n\n## Routes\n\nSee `./references/route-structure.md` for detailed route conventions.\n\n- Routes belong in the `app` directory.\n- Never co-locate components, types, or utilities in the app directory. This is an anti-pattern.\n- Ensure the app always has a route that matches \"/\", it may be inside a group route.\n\n## Library Preferences\n\n- Never use modules removed from React Native such as Picker, WebView, SafeAreaView, or AsyncStorage\n- Never use legacy expo-permissions\n- `expo-audio` not `expo-av`\n- `expo-video` not `expo-av`\n- `expo-symbols` not `@expo/vector-icons`\n- `react-native-safe-area-context` not react-native SafeAreaView\n- `process.env.EXPO_OS` not `Platform.OS`\n- `React.use` not `React.useContext`\n- `expo-image` Image component instead of intrinsic element `img`\n- `expo-glass-effect` for liquid glass backdrops\n\n## Responsiveness\n\n- Always wrap root component in a scroll view for responsiveness\n- Use `<ScrollView contentInsetAdjustmentBehavior=\"automatic\" />` instead of `<SafeAreaView>` for smarter safe area insets\n- `contentInsetAdjustmentBehavior=\"automatic\"` should be applied to FlatList and SectionList as well\n- Use flexbox instead of Dimensions API\n- ALWAYS prefer `useWindowDimensions` over `Dimensions.get()` to measure screen size\n\n## Behavior\n\n- Use expo-haptics conditionally on iOS to make more delightful experiences\n- Use views with built-in haptics like `<Switch />` from React Native and `@react-native-community/datetimepicker`\n- When a route belongs to a Stack, its first child should almost always be a ScrollView with `contentInsetAdjustmentBehavior=\"automatic\"` set\n- Prefer `headerSearchBarOptions` in Stack.Screen options to add a search bar\n- Use the `<Text selectable />` prop on text containing data that could be copied\n- Consider formatting large numbers like 1.4M or 38k\n- Never use intrinsic elements like ''img'' or ''div'' unless in a webview or Expo DOM component\n\n# Styling\n\nFollow Apple Human Interface Guidelines.\n\n## General Styling Rules\n\n- Prefer flex gap over margin and padding styles\n- Prefer padding over margin where possible\n- Always account for safe area, either with stack headers, tabs, or ScrollView/FlatList `contentInsetAdjustmentBehavior=\"automatic\"`\n- Ensure both top and bottom safe area insets are accounted for\n- Inline styles not StyleSheet.create unless reusing styles is faster\n- Add entering and exiting animations for state changes\n- Use `{ borderCurve: ''continuous'' }` for rounded corners unless creating a capsule shape\n- ALWAYS use a navigation stack title instead of a custom text element on the page\n- When padding a ScrollView, use `contentContainerStyle` padding and gap instead of padding on the ScrollView itself (reduces clipping)\n- CSS and Tailwind are not supported - use inline styles\n\n## Text Styling\n\n- Add the `selectable` prop to every `<Text/>` element displaying important data or error messages\n- Counters should use `{ fontVariant: ''tabular-nums'' }` for alignment\n\n## Shadows\n\nUse CSS `boxShadow` style prop. NEVER use legacy React Native shadow or elevation styles.\n\n```tsx\n<View style={{ boxShadow: \"0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)\" }} />\n```\n\n''inset'' shadows are supported.\n\n# Navigation\n\n## Link\n\nUse `<Link href=\"/path\" />` from ''expo-router'' for navigation between routes.\n\n```tsx\nimport { Link } from ''expo-router'';\n\n// Basic link\n<Link href=\"/path\" />\n\n// Wrapping custom components\n<Link href=\"/path\" asChild>\n  <Pressable>...</Pressable>\n</Link>\n```\n\nWhenever possible, include a `<Link.Preview>` to follow iOS conventions. Add context menus and previews frequently to enhance navigation.\n\n## Stack\n\n- ALWAYS use `_layout.tsx` files to define stacks\n- Use Stack from ''expo-router/stack'' for native navigation stacks\n\n### Page Title\n\nSet the page title in Stack.Screen options:\n\n```tsx\n<Stack.Screen options={{ title: \"Home\" }} />\n```\n\n## Context Menus\n\nAdd long press context menus to Link components:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Link } from \"expo-router\";\n\n<Link href=\"/settings\" asChild>\n  <Link.Trigger>\n    <Pressable>\n      <Card />\n    </Pressable>\n  </Link.Trigger>\n  <Link.Menu>\n    <Link.MenuAction\n      title=\"Share\"\n      icon=\"square.and.arrow.up\"\n      onPress={handleSharePress}\n    />\n    <Link.MenuAction\n      title=\"Block\"\n      icon=\"nosign\"\n      destructive\n      onPress={handleBlockPress}\n    />\n    <Link.Menu title=\"More\" icon=\"ellipsis\">\n      <Link.MenuAction title=\"Copy\" icon=\"doc.on.doc\" onPress={() => {}} />\n      <Link.MenuAction\n        title=\"Delete\"\n        icon=\"trash\"\n        destructive\n        onPress={() => {}}\n      />\n    </Link.Menu>\n  </Link.Menu>\n</Link>;\n```\n\n## Link Previews\n\nUse link previews frequently to enhance navigation:\n\n```tsx\n<Link href=\"/settings\">\n  <Link.Trigger>\n    <Pressable>\n      <Card />\n    </Pressable>\n  </Link.Trigger>\n  <Link.Preview />\n</Link>\n```\n\nLink preview can be used with context menus.\n\n## Modal\n\nPresent a screen as a modal:\n\n```tsx\n<Stack.Screen name=\"modal\" options={{ presentation: \"modal\" }} />\n```\n\nPrefer this to building a custom modal component.\n\n## Sheet\n\nPresent a screen as a dynamic form sheet:\n\n```tsx\n<Stack.Screen\n  name=\"sheet\"\n  options={{\n    presentation: \"formSheet\",\n    sheetGrabberVisible: true,\n    sheetAllowedDetents: [0.5, 1.0],\n    contentStyle: { backgroundColor: \"transparent\" },\n  }}\n/>\n```\n\n- Using `contentStyle: { backgroundColor: \"transparent\" }` makes the background liquid glass on iOS 26+.\n\n## Common route structure\n\nA standard app layout with tabs and stacks inside each tab:\n\n```\napp/\n  _layout.tsx — <NativeTabs />\n  (index,search)/\n    _layout.tsx — <Stack />\n    index.tsx — Main list\n    search.tsx — Search view\n```\n\n```tsx\n// app/_layout.tsx\nimport { NativeTabs, Icon, Label } from \"expo-router/unstable-native-tabs\";\nimport { Theme } from \"../components/theme\";\n\nexport default function Layout() {\n  return (\n    <Theme>\n      <NativeTabs>\n        <NativeTabs.Trigger name=\"(index)\">\n          <Icon sf=\"list.dash\" />\n          <Label>Items</Label>\n        </NativeTabs.Trigger>\n        <NativeTabs.Trigger name=\"(search)\" role=\"search\" />\n      </NativeTabs>\n    </Theme>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nCreate a shared group route so both tabs can push common screens:\n\n```tsx\n// app/(index,search)/_layout.tsx\nimport { PlatformColor } from \"react-native\";\nimport { Stack } from \"expo-router/stack\";\n\nexport default function Layout({ segment }) {\n  const screen = segment.match(/\\((.*)\\)/)?.[1]!;\n  const titles: Record<string, string> = { index: \"Items\", search: \"Search\" };\n\n  return (\n    <Stack\n      screenOptions={{\n        headerTransparent: true,\n        headerShadowVisible: false,\n        headerLargeTitleShadowVisible: false,\n        headerLargeStyle: { backgroundColor: \"transparent\" },\n        headerTitleStyle: { color: PlatformColor(\"label\") },\n        headerLargeTitle: true,\n        headerBlurEffect: \"none\",\n        headerBackButtonDisplayMode: \"minimal\",\n      }}\n    >\n      <Stack.Screen name={screen} options={{ title: titles[screen] }} />\n      <Stack.Screen name=\"i/[id]\" options={{ headerLargeTitle: false }} />\n    </Stack>\n  );\n}\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:08:44.099Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Fullstack Agents needing rapid UI development and deployment across web and mobile platforms using Expo and Turborepo.","zh":"适合需要快速UI开发和部署的Fullstack代理，支持跨web和移动平台，使用Expo和Turborepo。","ja":"フルスタックエージェントがWebとモバイルプラットフォームで迅速にUI開発とデプロイを行う必要がある場合に最適です。ExpoとTurborepoを使用します。","ko":"웹과 모바일 플랫폼에서 빠른 UI 개발과 배포가 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다. Expo와 Turborepo를 사용합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Fullstack que necesitan un desarrollo y despliegue de UI rápido en plataformas web y móviles utilizando Expo y Turborepo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Fullstack ayant besoin d''un développement et d''un déploiement d''UI rapides sur les plateformes web et mobiles en utilisant Expo et Turborepo.","de":"Perfekt für Fullstack-Agents, die eine schnelle UI-Entwicklung und -Bereitstellung auf Web- und Mobilplattformen mit Expo und Turborepo benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes Fullstack que precisam de desenvolvimento e implantação de UI rápida em plataformas web e móveis usando Expo e Turborepo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Fullstack, которым требуется быстрая разработка и развертывание UI на веб- и мобильных платформах с использованием Expo и Turborepo.","ar":"مثالي لعميل.Fullstack الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير واجهة مستخدم سريع وتنفيذ عبر منصات الويب والأجهزة المحمولة باستخدام Expo و Turborepo."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build comprehensive monorepo-based fullstack apps with efficient route structure management, utilizing NativeTabs for native tab bars, and leveraging SF Symbols for icon customization, all while following Expo UI Guidelines.","zh":"赋予代理构建全面性的monorepo基础的全栈应用程序的能力，具有高效的路由结构管理，利用NativeTabs进行原生标签栏，并利用SF Symbols进行图标自定义，同时遵循Expo UI指南。","ja":"エージェントが包括的なモノレポベースのフルスタックアプリをビルドできるようにし、ネイティブタブバーのためのNativeTabsを利用し、SF Symbolsを利用してアイコンをカスタマイズし、Expo UIガイドラインに従います。","ko":"에이전트가 포괄적인 모노레포 기반의 풀스택 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 하여 효율적인 라우트 구조 관리를 제공하고, 네이티브 탭 바를 위한 NativeTabs와 SF Symbols를 활용하여 아이콘을 커스터마이징하며, Expo UI 지침을 따릅니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones fullstack monorepo completas con una gestión eficiente de la estructura de rutas, utilizando NativeTabs para barras de pestañas nativas y aprovechando SF Symbols para la personalización de iconos, todo mientras sigue las pautas de UI de Expo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications fullstack monorepo complètes avec une gestion efficace de la structure de routes, en utilisant NativeTabs pour les barres de onglets natives et en exploitant SF Symbols pour la personnalisation des icônes, le tout en suivant les directives de l''UI d''Expo.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, umfassende monorepo-basierte Fullstack-Apps mit effizienter Routenstrukturverwaltung zu erstellen, indem NativeTabs für native Reiterleisten verwendet und SF Symbols für die Anpassung von Symbolen genutzt werden, und dies alles unter Beachtung der Expo-UI-Richtlinien.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicativos fullstack abrangentes baseados em monorepo com gerenciamento eficiente da estrutura de rotas, utilizando NativeTabs para barras de guias nativas e aproveitando SF Symbols para personalização de ícones, seguindo as diretrizes de UI do Expo.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать всесторонние полнофункциональные приложения на основе monorepo с эффективным управлением структурой маршрутов, используя NativeTabs для родных панелей вкладок и использует SF Symbols для настройки иконок, при этом следуя руководящим принципам UI Expo.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من بناء تطبيقات كاملة النطاق قائمة على مستودع واحد مع إدارة كفؤة لهيكل المسار، باستخدام NativeTabs للشريط العلوي الأصلي وتعزيز SF Symbols لتعديل الأيقونات، مع اتباع إرشادات واجهة المستخدم في Expo."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating cross-platform UI components with Expo","Customizing native iOS controls like Switch and Slider","Deploying apps across web and mobile platforms using Turborepo"],"zh":["使用Expo生成跨平台UI组件","自定义原生iOS控件，如Switch和Slider","使用Turborepo跨web和移动平台部署应用"],"ja":["Expoを使用してクロスプラットフォームUIコンポーネントを生成する","ネイティブiOSコントロールをカスタマイズする、たとえばSwitchとSlider","Turborepoを使用してWebとモバイルプラットフォームでアプリをデプロイする"],"ko":["Expo를 사용하여 크로스 플랫폼 UI 컴포넌트를 생성하는 것","원生 iOS 컨트롤을 사용자 정의하는 것, 예를 들어 Switch와 Slider","Turborepo를 사용하여 웹과 모바일 플랫폼에서 애플리케이션을 배포하는 것"],"es":["Generar componentes de UI de plataforma cruzada con Expo","Personalizar controles nativos de iOS como Switch y Slider","Desplegar aplicaciones en plataformas web y móviles con Turborepo"],"fr":["Générer des composants d''UI de plateforme croisée avec Expo","Personnaliser les contrôles natifs d''iOS comme Switch et Slider","Déployer des applications sur les plateformes web et mobiles avec Turborepo"],"de":["Erzeugen von plattformübergreifenden UI-Komponenten mit Expo","Anpassen von nativen iOS-Steuerelementen wie Switch und Slider","Bereitstellen von Apps auf Web- und Mobilplattformen mit Turborepo"],"pt":["Gerar componentes de UI cross-platform com Expo","Personalizar controles nativos do iOS como Switch e Slider","Implantar aplicativos em plataformas web e móveis usando Turborepo"],"ru":["Генерировать компоненты UI для нескольких платформ с помощью Expo","Настроить родные элементы управления iOS, такие как Switch и Slider","Развертывать приложения на веб- и мобильных платформах с помощью Turborepo"],"ar":["генерировать مكونات واجهة المستخدم متعددة المنصات مع Expo","تخصيص عناصر التحكم الأصلية لنظام iOS مثل Switch و Slider","نشر التطبيقات عبر منصات الويب والأجهزة المحمولة باستخدام Turborepo"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Expo and Turborepo setup","Limited to iOS 26 features for NativeTabs","Dependent on SF Symbols for icon customization"],"zh":["需要Expo和Turborepo设置","仅限iOS 26功能用于NativeTabs","依赖于SF Symbols进行图标自定义"],"ja":["ExpoとTurborepoの設定が必要","ネイティブタブバーのためのNativeTabsはiOS 26の機能に限られる","SF Symbolsに依存してアイコンをカスタマイズする"],"ko":["Expo와 Turborepo 설정이 필요함","네이티브 탭 바를 위한 NativeTabs는 iOS 26 기능으로 제한됨","SF Symbols에 의존하여 아이콘을 커스터마이징함"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Expo y Turborepo","Limitado a características de iOS 26 para NativeTabs","Dependiente de SF Symbols para la personalización de iconos"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''Expo et de Turborepo","Limité aux fonctionnalités d''iOS 26 pour NativeTabs","Dépendant de SF Symbols pour la personnalisation des icônes"],"de":["Benötigt Expo- und Turborepo-Einrichtung","Begrenzt auf iOS-26-Features für NativeTabs","Abhängig von SF Symbols für die Anpassung von Symbolen"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Expo e Turborepo","Limitado a recursos do iOS 26 para NativeTabs","Dependente de SF Symbols para personalização de ícones"],"ru":["Требует настройки Expo и Turborepo","Ограничен функциями iOS 26 для NativeTabs","Зависит от SF Symbols для настройки иконок"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Expo و Turborepo","محدود بميزات iOS 26 ل NativeTabs","يعتمد على SF Symbols لتعديل الأيقونات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"6c480bb7eed58f573cb220652a3ca956a4c08eee8ee6ae0f717a1fe043c10efc","qualityScore":47}');
