ативы Hindsight-docs","Hindsight-docs vs другие","установить Hindsight-docs","руководство по настройке Hindsight-docs"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ذاكرة الوكيل","Hindsight-docs","كيفية استخدام Hindsight-docs","تهيئة Hindsight-docs","بديلات Hindsight-docs","Hindsight-docs مقابل أخرى","تثبيت Hindsight-docs","دليل إعداد Hindsight-docs"]}},"owner":"vectorize-io","repo":"hindsight","repoPath":"vectorize-io/hindsight","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.672Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"hindsight-docs","description":"Complete Hindsight documentation for AI agents. Use this to learn about Hindsight architecture, APIs, configuration, and best practices.","bodyPreview":"# Hindsight Documentation Skill\n\nComplete technical documentation for Hindsight - a biomimetic memory system for AI agents.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Understand Hindsight architecture and core concepts\n- Learn about retain/recall/reflect operations\n- Configure memory banks and dispositions\n- Set up the Hindsight API server (Docker, Kubernetes, pip)\n- Integrate with Python/Node.js/Rust SDKs\n- Understand retrieval strategies (semantic, BM25, graph, temporal)\n-","body":"# Hindsight Documentation Skill\n\nComplete technical documentation for Hindsight - a biomimetic memory system for AI agents.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Understand Hindsight architecture and core concepts\n- Learn about retain/recall/reflect operations\n- Configure memory banks and dispositions\n- Set up the Hindsight API server (Docker, Kubernetes, pip)\n- Integrate with Python/Node.js/Rust SDKs\n- Understand retrieval strategies (semantic, BM25, graph, temporal)\n- Debug issues or optimize performance\n- Review API endpoints and parameters\n- Find cookbook examples and recipes\n\n## Documentation Structure\n\nAll documentation is in `references/` organized by category:\n\n```\nreferences/\n├── developer/\n│   ├── api/          # Core operations: retain, recall, reflect, memory banks\n│   └── *.md          # Architecture, configuration, deployment, performance\n├── sdks/\n│   ├── *.md          # Python, Node.js, CLI, embedded\n│   └── integrations/ # LiteLLM, AI SDK, OpenClaw, MCP, skills\n└── cookbook/\n    ├── recipes/      # Usage patterns and examples\n    └── applications/ # Full application demos\n```\n\n## How to Find Documentation\n\n### 1. Find Files by Pattern (use Glob tool)\n\n```bash\n# Core API operations\nreferences/developer/api/*.md\n\n# SDK documentation\nreferences/sdks/*.md\nreferences/sdks/integrations/*.md\n\n# Cookbook examples\nreferences/cookbook/recipes/*.md\nreferences/cookbook/applications/*.md\n\n# Find specific topics\nreferences/**/configuration.md\nreferences/**/*python*.md\nreferences/**/*deployment*.md\n```\n\n### 2. Search Content (use Grep tool)\n\n```bash\n# Search for concepts\npattern: \"disposition\"        # Memory bank configuration\npattern: \"graph retrieval\"    # Graph-based search\npattern: \"helm install\"       # Kubernetes deployment\npattern: \"document_id\"        # Document management\npattern: \"HINDSIGHT_API_\"     # Environment variables\n\n# Search in specific areas\npath: references/developer/api/\npattern: \"POST /v1\"           # Find API endpoints\n\npath: references/cookbook/\npattern: \"def |async def \"    # Find Python examples\n```\n\n### 3. Read Full Documentation (use Read tool)\n\n```\nreferences/developer/api/retain.md\nreferences/sdks/python.md\nreferences/cookbook/recipes/per-user-memory.md\n```\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n- **Memory Banks**: Isolated memory stores (one per user/agent)\n- **Retain**: Store memories (auto-extracts facts/entities/relationships)\n- **Recall**: Retrieve memories (4 parallel strategies: semantic, BM25, graph, temporal)\n- **Reflect**: Disposition-aware reasoning using memories\n- **document_id**: Groups messages in a conversation (upsert on same ID)\n- **Dispositions**: Skepticism, literalism, empathy traits (1-5) affecting reflect\n- **Mental Models**: Consolidated knowledge synthesized from facts\n\n## Notes\n\n- Code examples are inlined from working examples\n- Configuration uses `HINDSIGHT_API_*` environment variables\n- Database migrations run automatically on startup\n- Multi-bank queries require client-side orchestration\n- Use `document_id` for conversation evolution (same ID = upsert)\n\n---\n\n**Auto-generated** from `hindsight-docs/docs/`. Run `./scripts/generate-docs-skill.sh` to update.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:23:14.559Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced biomimetic memory system configuration and integration with Hindsight.","zh":"适合需要高级仿生记忆系统配置和与Hindsight集成的AI代理","ja":"Hindsightと高度なバイオミメティックメモリーシステムの構成および統合が必要なAIエージェントに最適","ko":"하인사이트와 고급 바이오 믹메틱 메모리 시스템 구성 및 통합이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan una configuración avanzada del sistema de memoria biomimética y la integración con Hindsight.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant une configuration avancée du système de mémoire biomimétique et une intégration avec Hindsight.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die eine erweiterte Konfiguration des biomimetischen Gedächtnissystems und die Integration mit Hindsight benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA que precisam de configuração e integração avançadas do sistema de memória biomimética e Hindsight.","ru":"Идеально подходит для ИИ-агентов, которым требуется продвинутая настройка и интеграция с системой биомиметической памяти Hindsight.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكيل الذكية التي تحتاج إلى تكوين متقدم ونظام ذاكرة مشابه حيوياً وتكامل مع هينسايت."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to configure and integrate with Hindsight, a biomimetic memory system, using Python, Node.js, and Rust SDKs, and leveraging retrieval strategies like semantic, BM25, graph, and temporal.","zh":"赋予代理使用Python、Node.js和Rust SDK配置和与Hindsight集成的能力，利用语义、BM25、图和时间等检索策略","ja":"Python、Node.js、Rust SDKを使用して、Hindsightと統合し、構成するエージェントの能力を提供します。セマンティック、BM25、グラフ、時間などの検索戦略を利用","ko":"파이썬, 노드js, 러스트 SDK를 사용하여 하인사이트와 통합 및 구성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다. 의미, BM25, 그래프, 시간 등의 검색 전략을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a configurar e integrar con Hindsight, un sistema de memoria biomimética, utilizando SDKs de Python, Node.js y Rust, y aprovechando estrategias de recuperación como semántica, BM25, gráfica y temporal.","fr":"Permet aux agents de configurer et d''intégrer Hindsight, un système de mémoire biomimétique, en utilisant des SDK Python, Node.js et Rust, et en exploitant des stratégies de récupération comme sémantique, BM25, graphique et temporelle.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Hindsight, ein biomimetisches Gedächtnissystem, zu konfigurieren und zu integrieren, indem Python-, Node.js- und Rust-SDKs verwendet werden, und Retrieval-Strategien wie semantisch, BM25, Graph und temporal nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a configurar e integrar com Hindsight, um sistema de memória biomimética, usando SDKs Python, Node.js e Rust, e aproveitando estratégias de recuperação como semântica, BM25, gráfica e temporal.","ru":"Позволяет агентам настраивать и интегрироваться с Hindsight, системой биомиметической памяти, используя SDK Python, Node.js и Rust, и использует стратегии извлечения, такие как семантическая, BM25, графическая и временная.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تكوين وتكامل هينسايت، نظام ذاكرة مشابه حيوياً، باستخدام SDKs بايثون، نود.جس، وروست، واستخدام استراتيجيات استرجاع مثل البنيوية، بي إم 25، الرسومية، والزمنية."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring memory banks and dispositions for AI agents","Integrating with Python, Node.js, and Rust SDKs for Hindsight","Setting up the Hindsight API server using Docker, Kubernetes, or pip"],"zh":["为AI代理配置记忆库和Disposition","使用Python、Node.js和Rust SDK与Hindsight集成","使用Docker、Kubernetes或pip设置Hindsight API服务器"],"ja":["AIエージェントのメモリーバンクとDispositionの構成","Python、Node.js、Rust SDKを使用してHindsightと統合","Docker、Kubernetes、またはpipを使用してHindsight APIサーバーを設定"],"ko":["에이전트의 메모리 뱅크 및 디스포지션 구성","파이썬, 노드js, 러스트 SDK를 사용하여 하인사이트와 통합","도커, 쿠버네티스 또는 파이피를 사용하여 하인사이트 API 서버 설정"],"es":["Configuración de bancos de memoria y disposiciones para agentes de IA","Integración con SDKs de Python, Node.js y Rust para Hindsight","Configuración del servidor de la API de Hindsight con Docker, Kubernetes o pip"],"fr":["Configuration des banques de mémoire et des dispositions pour les agents IA","Intégration avec les SDK Python, Node.js et Rust pour Hindsight","Configuration du serveur d''API Hindsight à l''aide de Docker, Kubernetes ou pip"],"de":["Konfiguration von Speicherbänken und Dispositionen für KI-Agents","Integration mit Python-, Node.js- und Rust-SDKs für Hindsight","Einrichtung des Hindsight-API-Servers mit Docker, Kubernetes oder pip"],"pt":["Configurar bancos de memória e disposições para agentes de IA","Integrar com SDKs Python, Node.js e Rust para Hindsight","Configurar o servidor de API Hindsight usando Docker, Kubernetes ou pip"],"ru":["Настройка банков памяти и расположений для ИИ-агентов","Интеграция с SDK Python, Node.js и Rust для Hindsight","Настройка сервера API Hindsight с использованием Docker, Kubernetes или pip"],"ar":["تكوين بنوك الذاكرة والاتجاهات للوكيل الذكي","التكامل مع SDKs بايثون، نود.جس، وروست لهينسايت","تكوين خادم API هينسايت باستخدام دッカー، كوبرنيتس، أو بايب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python, Node.js, or Rust SDKs for integration","Limited to Hindsight biomimetic memory system"],"zh":["需要Python、Node.js或Rust SDK进行集成","仅限于Hindsight仿生记忆系统"],"ja":["統合にはPython、Node.js、またはRust SDKが必要","Hindsightのバイオミメティックメモリーシステムのみに限定"],"ko":["통합을 위해 파이썬, 노드js 또는 러스트 SDK가 필요","하인사이트의 바이오 믹메틱 메모리 시스템에만 한정"],"es":["Requiere SDKs de Python, Node.js o Rust para la integración","Limitado al sistema de memoria biomimética Hindsight"],"fr":["Nécessite des SDK Python, Node.js ou Rust pour l''intégration","Limité au système de mémoire biomimétique Hindsight"],"de":["Benötigt Python-, Node.js- oder Rust-SDKs für die Integration","Begrenzt auf das biomimetische Gedächtnissystem Hindsight"],"pt":["Requer SDKs Python, Node.js ou Rust para integração","Limitado ao sistema de memória biomimética Hindsight"],"ru":["Требует SDK Python, Node.js или Rust для интеграции","Ограничен системой биомиметической памяти Hindsight"],"ar":["يتطلب SDKs بايثون، نود.جس، أو روست للتكامل","محدود بنظام الذاكرة المشابه حيوياً هينسايت"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"fc63feafc302071af99de087339ffbcee5c548c045b8cf6d323d0de2c630bb7e","qualityScore":46}');
