ncionalidades de seguimiento y análisis"],"fr":["Intégration avec des applications mobiles React Native","Suivi de sommets et de défis de randonnée","Interaction avec des services externes via API","Développement d''applications mobiles personnalisées","Mise en œuvre de fonctionnalités de suivi et d''analyse"],"de":["Integration mit React Native Mobile Apps","Verfolgung von Berggipfeln und Wanderherausforderungen","Interaktion mit externen Diensten über API","Entwicklung von benutzerdefinierten Mobile Apps","Implementierung von Tracking- und Analysefunktionen"],"pt":["Crie aplicativos móveis de rastreamento de montanhas","Desenvolva desafios de caminhada personalizados","Integre a API com React Native","Aproveite a escalabilidade e flexibilidade da API","Melhore a experiência do usuário com a API"],"ru":["Создайте мобильные приложения для отслеживания горных вершин","Разработайте индивидуальные походные challengы","Интегрируйте API с React Native","Воспользуйтесь масштабируемостью и гибкостью API","Улучшите пользовательский опыт с помощью API"],"ar":["أنشئ تطبيقات موبايل لتعقب جبال","طور التحديات المتنقلة المخصصة","ادمج API مع React Native","استفد من قابلية التوسع ومرونة API","حسن تجربة المستخدم مع API"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用AI智能工具","什么是React Native","AI智能工具替代品","React Native与Flutter比较","AI智能工具安装","React Native应用设置指南","山峰追踪API","徒步挑战应用","山峰登顶记录追踪"],"ja":["AIエージェントの使い方","React Nativeとは","AIエージェントの代替品","React NativeとFlutterの比較","AIエージェントのインストール","React Nativeアプリの設定ガイド","山登り追跡API","ハイキングチャレンジアプリ","山頂到達記録追跡"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 사용법","리액트 네이티브란","AI 에이전트 대체품","리액트 네이티브와 플러터 비교","AI 에이전트 설치","리액트 네이티브 애플리케이션 설정 가이드","산 정상 추적 API","하이킹 챌린지 애플리케이션","산 정상 등정 기록 추적"],"es":["cómo usar API en React Native","qué es un agente de API","alternativas a API para aplicaciones móviles","API vs SDK para desarrolladores","instalación de API en React Native","guía de configuración de API para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser API dans React Native","qu''est-ce qu''un outil API","alternatives à API pour applications mobiles","API vs SDK pour développeurs","installation de API dans React Native","guide de configuration de API pour développeurs"],"de":["wie man API in React Native verwendet","was ist ein API-Tool","Alternativen zu API für Mobile Apps","API vs SDK für Entwickler","Installation von API in React Native","Handbuch zur Konfiguration von API für Entwickler"],"pt":["como usar api","o que é api","api para react native","ferramentas de api","desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","rastreamento de montanhas","desafios de caminhada"],"ru":["как использовать api","что такое ии агенты","ии агенты для реакт натива","инструменты ии агентов","разработка мобильных приложений","отслеживание горных вершин","походные challengы"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هي أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لرياكت نيتيف","أدوات.api","تطوير التطبيقات المتنقلة","تعقب جبال","التحديات المتنقلة"]}},"owner":"jvidalv","repo":"100cims","repoPath":"jvidalv/100cims","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.680Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"api","description":"Use when working on the backend API (packages/api). Covers Elysia routes, Drizzle ORM, TypeBox schemas, JWT authentication, S3 uploads, Google Sheets logging, and the Next.js hybrid setup.","bodyPreview":"# API Development Guide\n\nYou are working on the **100cims API** (`packages/api`), a Next.js + Elysia hybrid backend.\n\n## Key Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n| ---- | ------- |\n| `src/api/routes/index.ts` | Elysia app composition, error handling |\n| `src/app/api/[[...slugs]]/route.ts` | Next.js catch-all for Elysia |\n| `src/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle schema (source of truth) |\n| `src/db/index.ts` | Database client |\n| `src/api/routes/@shared/jwt.ts` | JWT middleware |\n| `src/api/routes/@shared/s3.ts` | S3","body":"# API Development Guide\n\nYou are working on the **100cims API** (`packages/api`), a Next.js + Elysia hybrid backend.\n\n## Key Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n| ---- | ------- |\n| `src/api/routes/index.ts` | Elysia app composition, error handling |\n| `src/app/api/[[...slugs]]/route.ts` | Next.js catch-all for Elysia |\n| `src/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle schema (source of truth) |\n| `src/db/index.ts` | Database client |\n| `src/api/routes/@shared/jwt.ts` | JWT middleware |\n| `src/api/routes/@shared/s3.ts` | S3 upload utilities |\n| `src/api/lib/sheets.ts` | Google Sheets logging |\n| `drizzle.config.ts` | Database connection config |\n\n## Architecture\n\n### Hybrid Stack\n\n- **Next.js 15** (App Router) for web pages and runtime\n- **Elysia 1.4** for API routes (mounted at `/api/*`)\n- **Drizzle ORM** with PostgreSQL\n- **TypeBox** for schema validation\n\n### Why This Hybrid?\n\nElysia provides excellent TypeScript inference, OpenAPI generation, and performance while Next.js handles the server runtime and potential web pages.\n\n### Directory Structure\n\n- `/src/api/`: All Elysia API code\n  - `/routes/`: Route handlers (public, protected, @shared)\n  - `/schemas/`: TypeBox validation schemas\n  - `/lib/`: Utilities (sheets, dates, images, slug)\n- `/src/db/`: Database schema and client\n- `/src/app/`: Next.js pages and API catch-all route\n\n### Shared Utilities\n\n| File | Purpose |\n| ---- | ------- |\n| `src/api/lib/slug.ts` | `generateSlug()` - URL-friendly slug generation |\n| `src/api/lib/images.ts` | `isBase64SizeValid()` - Image size validation |\n| `src/api/lib/sheets.ts` | Google Sheets logging utilities |\n| `src/api/lib/dates.ts` | Date formatting utilities |\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### Route Organization\n\n```\n/api/routes/\n├── @shared/          # Middleware, JWT, S3, types\n├── public/           # No auth required\n│   ├── mountains.route.ts\n│   ├── challenge.route.ts\n│   └── hiscores.route.ts\n├── protected/        # JWT required\n│   ├── summit.route.ts\n│   ├── user.route.ts\n│   ├── plan.route.ts\n│   ├── mountains/    # Folder-based organization\n│   │   ├── index.ts\n│   │   ├── my-list.route.ts\n│   │   └── update.route.ts\n│   └── community-challenge/\n│       ├── index.ts\n│       ├── create.route.ts\n│       ├── update.route.ts\n│       └── delete.route.ts\n└── index.ts          # Compose all routes\n```\n\n**Folder-based routes**: Group related endpoints in folders with an `index.ts` that composes them with a prefix. Each endpoint gets its own file.\n\n### Creating Routes\n\n```typescript\nimport { Elysia } from ''elysia'';\nimport { db } from ''@/db'';\nimport { userSchema } from ''@/api/schemas'';\n\nexport const userRoute = new Elysia({ prefix: ''/user'', tags: [''users''] })\n  .get(''/:id'', async ({ params }) => {\n    const user = await db.query.user.findFirst({\n      where: (u, { eq }) => eq(u.id, params.id)\n    });\n    return user;\n  }, {\n    detail: { summary: ''Get user by ID'' },\n    params: userSchema.params,\n    response: userSchema.response\n  });\n```\n\n### Protected Routes\n\n```typescript\nimport { jwt } from ''@/api/routes/@shared/jwt'';\nimport { store } from ''@/api/routes/@shared/store'';\n\nexport const summitRoute = new Elysia({ prefix: ''/summit'', tags: [''summits''] })\n  .use(jwt)\n  .use(store)\n  .derive(async ({ bearer, store }) => {\n    const payload = await bearer(bearer);\n    store.userId = payload.userId;\n  })\n  .post(''/'', async ({ body, store }) => {\n    // store.userId available from JWT\n    const summit = await db.insert(summitTable).values({\n      userId: store.userId,\n      mountainId: body.mountainId\n    });\n    return summit;\n  });\n```\n\n### Database Queries\n\n```typescript\nimport { db } from ''@/db'';\nimport { user, summit, mountain } from ''@/db/schema'';\nimport { eq, desc } from ''drizzle-orm'';\n\n// Simple query\nconst users = await db.select().from(user).where(eq(user.id, userId));\n\n// Join query\nconst summits = await db\n  .select({\n    id: summit.id,\n    mountainName: mountain.name,\n    date: summit.createdAt\n  })\n  .from(summit)\n  .leftJoin(mountain, eq(summit.mountainId, mountain.id))\n  .where(eq(summit.userId, userId))\n  .orderBy(desc(summit.createdAt));\n```\n\n### Schema Validation\n\n```typescript\nimport { t } from ''elysia'';\n\nexport const summitSchema = {\n  body: t.Object({\n    mountainId: t.String(),\n    date: t.Optional(t.String()),\n    image: t.Optional(t.String())\n  }),\n  response: {\n    200: t.Object({\n      id: t.String(),\n      mountainId: t.String(),\n      userId: t.String()\n    })\n  }\n};\n```\n\n### Pagination Pattern\n\nFor paginated endpoints, use this pattern for backwards compatibility:\n\n```typescript\n// Schema\nexport const PaginatedItemsSchema = t.Object({\n  items: t.Array(ItemSchema),\n  pagination: t.Object({\n    page: t.Number(),\n    pageSize: t.Number(),\n    totalItems: t.Number(),\n    totalPages: t.Number(),\n    hasMore: t.Boolean(),\n  }),\n});\n\n// Route handler - backwards compatible\nconst isPaginated = query.page !== undefined || query.limit !== undefined;\n\nif (isPaginated) {\n  // Return paginated results with count query\n  return { items: results, pagination: { page, pageSize, totalItems, totalPages, hasMore } };\n}\n\n// No pagination params = return ALL results (backwards compatible)\nreturn { items: results, pagination: { page: 1, pageSize: results.length, totalItems: results.length, totalPages: 1, hasMore: false } };\n```\n\n**Key**: Old clients without pagination params get all results. New clients can paginate.\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Add New Endpoint\n\n1. Create schema in `/api/schemas/`\n2. Create route file in `/routes/public/` or `/protected/`\n3. Import and use in `/routes/index.ts`\n4. Mobile app: Run `yarn generate-api-types`\n\n### Database Migration\n\n1. Update `/src/db/schema.ts`\n2. Run `yarn drizzle-kit push` (pushes to DB)\n3. Verify schema changes in database\n\n### Image Upload to S3\n\n```typescript\nimport { putImageOnS3 } from ''@/api/routes/@shared/s3'';\n\nconst key = `${process.env.APP_NAME}/user/avatar/${userId}.jpeg`;\nawait putImageOnS3(key, buffer);\n```\n\n### Log to Google Sheets\n\n```typescript\nimport { addRowToSheets, ERRORS_SPREADSHEET } from ''@/api/lib/sheets'';\n\nawait addRowToSheets(ERRORS_SPREADSHEET, [\n  ''error_type'',\n  ''status_code'',\n  ''url'',\n  ''message''\n]);\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n- `DATABASE_URL`: PostgreSQL connection string\n- `AUTH_SECRET`: JWT signing secret\n- `AWS_*`: S3 credentials (region, bucket, access keys)\n- `SHEETS_*`: Google service account credentials\n- `APP_NAME`: Application name (used in S3 paths)\n\nSee `.env.example` for complete list.\n\n## Swagger Documentation\n\nAvailable at `/api/swagger` during development. Auto-generated from:\n- Route tags\n- TypeBox schemas\n- OpenAPI metadata in route definitions\n\n## Database Schema\n\nSee `/src/db/schema.ts` for full schema. Key tables:\n- `user`: OAuth accounts\n- `mountain`: Peak data (name, lat/lng, elevation, difficulty)\n- `summit`: User summit logs\n- `plan`: Group hiking plans\n- `plan_attendee`: Plan participants\n- `plan_chat`: Chat messages\n- `challenge`: Curated challenges\n- `hiscores`: Leaderboard\n\n## Error Handling\n\nGlobal error handler in `/routes/index.ts`:\n- Logs all errors to Google Sheets\n- Returns appropriate HTTP status codes\n- Distinguishes ValidationError, ParseError, generic errors\n\n## Deployment\n\nVercel (configured in root `vercel.json`):\n- Builds from `packages/api`\n- Environment variables set in Vercel dashboard\n- Automatic deployments on main branch\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:24:29.781Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing hybrid backend development with Next.js and Elysia.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Next.js和Elysia进行混合后端开发的全栈代理","ja":"Next.jsとElysiaを使用したハイブリッドバックエンド開発が必要なフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"Next.js와 Elysia를 사용하여 하이브리드 백엔드 개발이 필요한 풀 스택 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan desarrollo de backend híbrido con Next.js y Elysia.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin d''un développement de backend hybride avec Next.js et Elysia.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die ein hybrides Backend-Development mit Next.js und Elysia benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que necessitam de desenvolvimento híbrido de backend com Next.js e Elysia.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full Stack, которым необходим гибридное развитие бэкэнда с использованием Next.js и Elysia.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء.Full Stack الذين يحتاجون إلى تطوير خلفي هجين مع Next.js و Elysia."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop scalable APIs using Next.js and Elysia, with features like JWT middleware for secure authentication and S3 integration for cloud storage, all while utilizing a Drizzle schema for database management.","zh":"赋予代理开发可扩展的API的能力，使用Next.js和Elysia，具有JWT中间件用于安全身份验证和S3集成用于云存储，所有这些都利用Drizzle模式进行数据库管理","ja":"Next.jsとElysiaを使用して、JWTミドルウェアによる安全な認証とS3統合によるクラウドストレージなど、機能を備えたスケーラブルなAPIを開発できるようにエージェントに権限を付与する、そしてDrizzleスキーマを使用してデータベースを管理する","ko":"Next.js와 Elysia를 사용하여 확장 가능한 API를 개발할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하며, JWT 미들웨어를 통한 보안 인증 및 S3 통합을 통한 클라우드 스토리지를 포함한 기능을 제공하며, 모든 것이 Drizzle 스키마를 사용하여 데이터베이스를 관리","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar APIs escalables con Next.js y Elysia, con características como middleware JWT para autenticación segura y integración de S3 para almacenamiento en la nube, todo mientras se utiliza un esquema Drizzle para la gestión de la base de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des APIs escalables avec Next.js et Elysia, avec des fonctionnalités comme le middleware JWT pour une authentification sécurisée et l''intégration de S3 pour un stockage en nuage, le tout en utilisant un schéma Drizzle pour la gestion de la base de données.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, skalierbare APIs mit Next.js und Elysia zu entwickeln, mit Funktionen wie JWT-Middleware für sichere Authentifizierung und S3-Integration für Cloud-Speicher, alles bei der Verwendung eines Drizzle-Schemas für die Datenbankverwaltung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver APIs escaláveis usando Next.js e Elysia, com recursos como middleware JWT para autenticação segura e integração do S3 para armazenamento em nuvem, tudo isso utilizando um esquema Drizzle para gerenciamento de banco de dados.","ru":"Позволяет агентам разрабатывать масштабируемые API с использованием Next.js и Elysia, с функциями такими как middleware JWT для безопасной аутентификации и интеграция с S3 для облачного хранилища, все это при использовании схемы Drizzle для управления базой данных.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تطوير واجهات برمجة تطبيقات قابلة للتوسعة باستخدام Next.js و Elysia، مع ميزات مثل وسيط JWT لتأمين المصادقة وتكامل S3 لتخزين السحابي، كل ذلك باستخدام مخطط Drizzle لإدارة قاعدة البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Building RESTful APIs with Elysia","Implementing JWT-based authentication for secure routes","Integrating S3 storage for cloud-based file management"],"zh":["使用Elysia构建RESTful API","实现基于JWT的身份验证以保护路由","集成S3存储以进行基于云的文件管理"],"ja":["Elysiaを使用してRESTful APIを構築する","JWTベースの認証を実装してセキュアなルートを保護する","S3ストレージを統合してクラウドベースのファイル管理を行う"],"ko":["Elysia를 사용하여 RESTful API를 구축","JWT 기반 인증을 구현하여 보안 라우팅을 보호","S3 스토리지를 통합하여 클라우드 기반 파일 관리를 수행"],"es":["Construcción de APIs RESTful con Elysia","Implementación de autenticación basada en JWT para rutas seguras","Integración de almacenamiento de S3 para gestión de archivos en la nube"],"fr":["Construction d''APIs RESTful avec Elysia","Mise en œuvre d''une authentification basée sur JWT pour des routes sécurisées","Intégration du stockage S3 pour la gestion de fichiers en nuage"],"de":["Erstellung von RESTful-APIs mit Elysia","Implementierung von JWT-basierter Authentifizierung für sichere Routen","Integration von S3-Speicher für cloudbasiertes Dateimanagement"],"pt":["Construção de APIs RESTful com Elysia","Implementação de autenticação baseada em JWT para rotas seguras","Integração do armazenamento S3 para gerenciamento de arquivos baseado em nuvem"],"ru":["Построение RESTful API с использованием Elysia","Реализация аутентификации на основе JWT для безопасных маршрутов","Интеграция хранилища S3 для облачного управления файлами"],"ar":["بناء واجهات برمجة تطبيقات RESTful باستخدام Elysia","تطبيق المصادقة القائمة على JWT للطرق الآمنة","تكامل تخزين S3 لإدارة الملفات القائمة على السحابي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Next.js and Elysia setup","Dependent on Drizzle schema for database operations","Needs AWS S3 credentials for cloud storage integration"],"zh":["需要Next.js和Elysia设置","依赖Drizzle模式进行数据库操作","需要AWS S3凭证进行云存储集成"],"ja":["Next.jsとElysiaの設定が必要","Drizzleスキーマに依存してデータベース操作を行う","AWS S3の資格情報が云ストレージ統合に必要"],"ko":["Next.js와 Elysia 설정이 필요","Drizzle 스키마에 의존하여 데이터베이스 작업을 수행","AWS S3 자격 증명이 클라우드 스토리지 통합에 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Next.js y Elysia","Dependiente del esquema Drizzle para operaciones de base de datos","Necesita credenciales de AWS S3 para la integración de almacenamiento en la nube"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Next.js et Elysia","Dépendant du schéma Drizzle pour les opérations de base de données","Nécessite des informations d''identification AWS S3 pour l''intégration du stockage en nuage"],"de":["Benötigt Next.js- und Elysia-Setup","Abhängig vom Drizzle-Schema für Datenbankoperationen","Benötigt AWS-S3-Zugangsdaten für die Integration von Cloud-Speicher"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Next.js e Elysia","Dependente do esquema Drizzle para operações de banco de dados","Necessita de credenciais AWS S3 para integração de armazenamento em nuvem"],"ru":["Требует настройки Next.js и Elysia","Зависит от схемы Drizzle для операций с базой данных","Требует учетных данных AWS S3 для интеграции с облачным хранилищем"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Next.js و Elysia","يعتمد على مخطط Drizzle لعمليات قاعدة البيانات","يحتاج إلى بيانات اعتماد AWS S3 لتكامل تخزين السحابي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f319902131b628a0730dc935ed7c13dfd26368eea6db96797b3c3df6df534878","qualityScore":46}');
