act, Python et Node.js"],"de":["Benutzerdefinierter Frontend- und Backend-Code","Integration mit KI-Tools","Automatisierung von Entwicklungsaufgaben","Verbesserung der Entwicklungseffizienz","Kompatibilität mit React, Python und Node.js"],"pt":["Geração de código frontend/backend","Integração com https://xeiaso.net","Melhoria da produtividade dos desenvolvedores","Suporte a React, Python e Node.js","Interface de linha de comando (CLI) fácil de usar"],"ru":["Генерация frontend/backend кода","Интеграция с https://xeiaso.net","Повышение производительности разработчиков","Поддержка React, Python и Node.js","Легко используемый интерфейс командной строки (CLI)"],"ar":["إنشاء رمز Frontend/Backend","التكامل مع https://xeiaso.net","تحسين إنتاجية المطورين","دعم React و Python و Node.js","واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI) سهلة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Blogpost Creator","什么是AI智能工具","Blogpost Creator替代品","Blogpost Creator vs 其他工具","Blogpost Creator安装","Blogpost Creator设置指南","React开发","Node.js开发"],"ja":["Blogpost Creatorの使用方法","AIエージェントとは","Blogpost Creatorの代替","Blogpost Creator vs 他のツール","Blogpost Creatorのインストール","Blogpost Creatorの設定ガイド","React開発","Node.js開発"],"ko":["Blogpost Creator 사용법","AI 에이전트란","Blogpost Creator 대체","Blogpost Creator vs 다른 도구","Blogpost Creator 설치","Blogpost Creator 설정 가이드","React 개발","Node.js 개발"],"es":["cómo utilizar herramientas de IA","qué es un Agente de IA","xeiaso.net alternativa","xeiaso.net vs competidores","instalación de herramientas de IA","guía de configuración de herramientas de IA","desarrollo de aplicaciones con herramientas de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils d''IA","qu''est-ce qu''un Outil d''IA","xeiaso.net alternative","xeiaso.net vs concurrents","installation d''outils d''IA","guide de configuration d''outils d''IA","développement d''applications avec des outils d''IA"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","xeiaso.net Alternative","xeiaso.net vs Wettbewerber","Installation von KI-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für KI-Tools","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit KI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar criador de blog post","o que é criador de blog post","criador de blog post alternative","criador de blog post vs wordpress","instalar criador de blog post","guias de configuração do criador de blog post"],"ru":["как использовать создатель блог постов","что такое создатель блог постов","создатель блог постов альтернатива","создатель блог постов vs wordpress","установить создатель блог постов","руководства по настройке создателя блог постов"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام مخلق منشورات المدونة","ما هو مخلق منشورات المدونة","مخلق منشورات المدونة بديل","مخلق منشورات المدونة مقابل ووردبريس","تثبيت مخلق منشورات المدونة","دليل إعداد مخلق منشورات المدونة"]}},"owner":"Xe","repo":"site","repoPath":"Xe/site","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.720Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"blogpost-creator","description":"Create new blogposts from a template or linkposts using the hydrate command.","bodyPreview":"# Blog Post Creator\n\nCreate new blog posts for Xe''s site using the hydrate command.\n\n## Usage\n\nInvoke this skill when you want to create a new blog post. The skill will prompt you for:\n\n- **Post type**: blog, linkpost, note, talk, or xecast\n- **Title**: The title of your post (for linkposts, can auto-fetch from URL)\n- **Description**: A brief description/summary (for linkposts, can auto-fetch from URL)\n- **Link URL**: (required for linkposts) The URL this post should redirect to\n- **Publication","body":"# Blog Post Creator\n\nCreate new blog posts for Xe''s site using the hydrate command.\n\n## Usage\n\nInvoke this skill when you want to create a new blog post. The skill will prompt you for:\n\n- **Post type**: blog, linkpost, note, talk, or xecast\n- **Title**: The title of your post (for linkposts, can auto-fetch from URL)\n- **Description**: A brief description/summary (for linkposts, can auto-fetch from URL)\n- **Link URL**: (required for linkposts) The URL this post should redirect to\n- **Publication date**: (optional, for linkposts can auto-extract from the page, defaults to today if not found)\n- **Custom slug**: (optional, for linkposts will auto-extract from URL basename if not provided)\n\n## What it does\n\n1. **For linkposts**: Extracts slug from URL basename if no custom slug provided (e.g., https://example.com/blog/my-post becomes \"my-post\")\n2. **For other post types**: Generates a URL-friendly slug from your title (or uses your custom slug)\n3. **For linkposts**: Can auto-fetch title, description, and publication date from the provided URL\n4. Validates that linkposts have a URL provided (prompts if missing)\n5. Runs `go run ./cmd/hydrate <kind> <slug>` with the appropriate parameters\n6. For linkposts: Updates the `redirect_to` field in the frontmatter with the provided URL\n7. **For linkposts**: Adds fetched summary to the post body if available\n8. Opens the created file in VS Code for editing\n9. Shows you the file location for reference\n\n## File structure\n\nBlog posts are created in:\n\n- `lume/src/blog/<year>/<slug>.mdx` for blog and linkpost\n- `lume/src/notes/<year>/<slug>.mdx` for notes\n- `lume/src/talks/<year>/<slug>.mdx` for talks\n- `lume/src/xecast/<year>/<slug>.mdx` for xecast\n\n## Frontmatter templates\n\nEach post type has its own frontmatter template:\n\n**Blog posts** include hero image configuration:\n\n```yaml\n---\ntitle: \"\"\ndesc: \"\"\ndate: YYYY-MM-DD\nhero:\n  ai: \"\"\n  file: \"\"\n  prompt: \"\"\n  social: false\n---\n```\n\n**Link posts** include a redirect URL:\n\n```yaml\n---\ntitle: \"\"\ndate: YYYY-MM-DD\nredirect_to: \"https://example.com\"\n---\n```\n\n**Other types** (notes, talks, xecast) have simpler frontmatter:\n\n```yaml\n---\ntitle: \"\"\ndesc: \"\"\ndate: YYYY-MM-DD\n---\n```\n\n## Linkpost Special Features\n\nLinkposts have enhanced functionality:\n\n1. **Automatic slug extraction**: If no custom slug is provided, the skill will extract the basename from the URL (e.g., `https://example.com/blog/my-post` becomes `my-post`)\n\n2. **Auto-fetching content**: The skill can automatically fetch the webpage to extract:\n   - The page title (used as the post title)\n   - A summary/description (added to the post body)\n   - The publication date (used as the post date, defaults to today if not found)\n   - This saves time and ensures accurate representation of the linked content\n\nUse the extract-meta.js file in this folder to extract meta-information from webpages:\n\n```bash\nnode extract-meta.js <url>\n```\n\n3. **URL handling**: The skill handles redirects and will follow them to get the final content for title/description extraction\n\n## Example Linkpost Workflow\n\nWhen creating a linkpost with a URL like `https://anubis.techaro.lol/blog/2025/file-abuse-reports`:\n\n1. Skill detects it''s a linkpost with a URL\n2. Extracts slug \"file-abuse-reports\" from URL basename\n3. Fetches the webpage to get:\n   - The actual title: \"Taking steps to end traffic from abusive cloud providers\"\n   - A summary of the content for the post body\n   - The publication date from the page (e.g., \"2025-01-15\")\n4. Creates the post with auto-generated slug, fetched title, and extracted date\n5. Adds the summary to the post body for context\n6. Updates the redirect_to field with the provided URL\n\n## Date Extraction Details\n\nThe skill will look for publication dates in various formats:\n\n- **Meta tags**: `<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-01-15\">`\n- **JSON-LD structured data**: `\"datePublished\": \"2025-01-15\"`\n- **HTML5 semantic elements**: `<time datetime=\"2025-01-15\">`\n- **Common date patterns in the page content**\n- **URL patterns**: Extracts date from URL structure like `/blog/2025/my-post`\n\nIf no date is found, it defaults to today''s date.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:51:35.110Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Content Creation Agents needing automated blog post generation with customizable post types and hydrate command functionality.","zh":"适合需要自动博客文章生成和自定义文章类型以及hydrate命令功能的内容创作代理。","ja":"自動ブログ投稿生成とカスタマイズ可能な投稿タイプ、およびhydrateコマンドの機能性が必要なコンテンツ作成エージェントに適しています。","ko":"자동 블로그 게시물 생성 및 맞춤형 게시물 유형 및 hydrate 명령 기능이 필요한 콘텐츠 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de creación de contenido que necesitan generación automática de publicaciones de blog con tipos de publicaciones personalizables y funcionalidad de comando hydrate.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de création de contenu ayant besoin d''une génération automatique de billets de blog avec des types de billets personnalisables et une fonctionnalité de commande hydrate.","de":"Ideal für Content-Erstellung-Agenten, die eine automatisierte Blog-Beitrag-Generierung mit anpassbaren Beitragstypen und Hydrate-Befehlsfunktion benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Criação de Conteúdo que necessitam de geração automática de posts de blog com tipos de post personalizáveis e funcionalidade de comando hydrate.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по созданию контента, которым требуется автоматическая генерация записей в блоге с настраиваемыми типами записей и функциональностью команды hydrate.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد تلقائي للمشاركات على المدونة مع أنواع منشورات قابلة للتعديل ووظيفة أوامر الـ hydrate."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create new blog posts with auto-fetch capabilities for titles, descriptions, and link URLs, utilizing protocols like HTTPS and supporting various post formats such as blog, linkpost, note, talk, or xecast.","zh":"赋予代理创建新博客文章的能力，具有自动获取标题、描述和链接URL的功能，利用HTTPS等协议，并支持各种文章格式，如博客、链接文章、笔记、谈话或xeCast。","ja":"エージェントが新しいブログ投稿を作成する能力を提供し、HTTPSなどのプロトコルを利用し、タイトル、説明、リンクURLを自動で取得し、ブログ、リンク投稿、ノート、トーク、またはxeCastなどのさまざまな投稿形式をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 새 블로그 게시물 생성을 가능하게 하고 HTTPS 등의 프로토콜을 사용하며 제목, 설명, 링크 URL을 자동으로 가져오고 블로그, 링크 게시물, 노트, 대화 또는 xeCast 등의 다양한 게시물 형식을 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear nuevos billets de blog con capacidades de auto-búsqueda para títulos, descripciones y URLs de enlaces, utilizando protocolos como HTTPS y admitiendo varios formatos de publicación como blog, linkpost, nota, charla o xecast.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer de nouveaux billets de blog avec des capacités de récupération automatique pour les titres, les descriptions et les URLs de liens, en utilisant des protocoles comme HTTPS et en prenant en charge différents formats de publication tels que blog, linkpost, note, conférence ou xecast.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, neue Blog-Beiträge mit Auto-Suchfunktionen für Titel, Beschreibungen und Link-URLs zu erstellen, indem Protokolle wie HTTPS verwendet und verschiedene Beitragsformate wie Blog, Linkpost, Notiz, Vortrag oder Xecast unterstützt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar novos posts de blog com capacidades de auto-busca para títulos, descrições e URLs de links, utilizando protocolos como HTTPS e suportando vários formatos de post, como blog, linkpost, nota, talk ou xecast.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать новые записи в блоге с функциями автоматического получения заголовков, описаний и URL-адресов ссылок, используя протоколы, такие как HTTPS, и поддерживая различные форматы записей, такие как блог, linkpost, заметка, talk или xecast.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء منشورات مدونة جديدة مع القدرة على استرجاع التイトل ووصف وروابط URL تلقائيًا، مستخدمين بروتوكولات مثل HTTPS ودعم تنسيقات منشورات مختلفة مثل مدونة و linkpost وملحوظة ومحادثة أو xecast."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating blog post creation for Xe''s site","Generating linkposts with auto-fetched metadata","Creating customized blog content using the hydrate command"],"zh":["为Xe的网站自动创建博客文章","使用自动获取的元数据生成链接文章","使用hydrate命令创建自定义博客内容"],"ja":["Xeのサイトの自動ブログ投稿生成","自動取得されたメタデータを使用してリンク投稿を生成する","hydrateコマンドを使用してカスタマイズされたブログコンテンツを作成する"],"ko":["Xe의 웹사이트를 위한 자동 블로그 게시물 생성","자동으로 가져온 메타데이터를 사용하여 링크 게시물 생성","hydrate 명령을 사용하여 맞춤형 블로그 콘텐츠 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de publicaciones de blog para el sitio de Xe","Generación de linkposts con metadatos auto-buscados","Creación de contenido de blog personalizado utilizando el comando hydrate"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de billets de blog pour le site de Xe","Génération de linkposts avec des métadonnées auto-récupérées","Création de contenu de blog personnalisé en utilisant la commande hydrate"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Blog-Beiträgen für die Xe-Website","Generierung von Linkposts mit auto-abgerufenen Metadaten","Erstellung von personalisiertem Blog-Inhalt unter Verwendung des Hydrate-Befehls"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de posts de blog para o site da Xe","Gerar linkposts com metadados extraídos automaticamente","Criar conteúdo de blog personalizado usando o comando hydrate"],"ru":["Автоматизация создания записей в блоге для сайта Xe","Генерация linkpost с автоматически извлеченными метаданными","Создание настраиваемого контента блога с помощью команды hydrate"],"ar":["توفير آلي لإنشاء منشورات المدونة لموقع Xe","توليد منشورات الارتباط مع بيانات وصفية مسترجعة تلقائيًا","إنشاء محتوى مدونة مخصص باستخدام أوامر الـ hydrate"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires invocation for each new blog post","Limited to specific post types (blog, linkpost, note, talk, or xecast)","Dependent on the hydrate command functionality"],"zh":["需要为每个新博客文章调用","仅限于特定文章类型（博客、链接文章、笔记、谈话或xeCast）","依赖于hydrate命令的功能性"],"ja":["新しいブログ投稿ごとに呼び出しが必要","特定の投稿タイプ（ブログ、リンク投稿、ノート、トーク、またはxeCast）に限られる","hydrateコマンドの機能に依存する"],"ko":["새 블로그 게시물마다 호출이 필요함","특정 게시물 유형(블로그, 링크 게시물, 노트, 대화 또는 xeCast)으로 제한됨","hydrate 명령의 기능에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere invocación para cada nueva publicación de blog","Limitado a tipos de publicaciones específicos (blog, linkpost, nota, charla o xecast)","Dependiente de la funcionalidad del comando hydrate"],"fr":["Nécessite une invocation pour chaque nouveau billet de blog","Limité à des types de publications spécifiques (blog, linkpost, note, conférence ou xecast)","Dépendant de la fonctionnalité de la commande hydrate"],"d