ement de monorepos avec Turborepo","Création de landing pages avec Astro","Mise en œuvre d''API d''inscription avec Hono","Intégration avec Postgres","Efficacité dans le développement et le déploiement"],"de":["Bereitstellung von Monorepos mit Turborepo","Erstellung von Landingpages mit Astro","Implementierung von Signup-APIs mit Hono","Integration mit Postgres","Effizienz bei Entwicklung und Bereitstellung"],"pt":["Criação de landing pages com Astro","API de signup com Hono","Utilização de Postgres como banco de dados","Melhoria da eficiência do desenvolvimento","Implantação de monorepo Turborepo"],"ru":["Создание лендингов с Astro","API регистрации с Hono","Использование Postgres в качестве базы данных","Повышение эффективности разработки","Развертывание монорепо Turborepo"],"ar":["إنشاء صفحات هبوط مع Astro","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات التسجيل مع Hono","استخدام Postgres كقاعدة بيانات","تحسين كفاءة التطوير","نشر مونوربو Turborepo"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Turborepo monorepo","Astro landing pages","Hono signup API","Postgres数据库","如何使用Turborepo","Turborepo替代品","Turborepo vs Git"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Turborepo monorepo","Astro landing pages","Hono signup API","Postgresデータベース","Turborepoの使い方","Turborepoの代替","Turborepo vs Git"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Turborepo 모노레포","Astro 랜딩 페이지","Hono 가입 API","Postgres 데이터베이스","Turborepo 사용법","Turborepo 대체품","Turborepo vs Git"],"es":["herramientas de ia","despliegue de turborepo","astro landing pages","hono signup api","postgres integración","cómo usar turborepo","turborepo vs otros","guía de instalación de turborepo"],"fr":["outils d''ia","déploiement de turborepo","astro pages de destination","hono api d''inscription","intégration postgres","comment utiliser turborepo","turborepo vs autres","guide d''installation de turborepo"],"de":["ki-tools","turborepo-bereitstellung","astro-landingpages","hono-signup-api","postgres-integration","wie man turborepo verwendet","turborepo vs andere","anleitung zur installation von turborepo"],"pt":["como usar Turborepo","o que é monorepo","Astro vs React","Hono alternative","Postgres tutorial","deploy de monorepo","desenvolvimento de aplicativos"],"ru":["как использовать Turborepo","что такое монорепо","Astro vs React","альтернативы Hono","урок Postgres","развертывание монорепо","разработка приложений"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Turborepo","ما هو مونوربو","Astro vs React","بديل Hono","دورة Postgres","نشر مونوربو","تطوير التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"sethdavis512","repo":"quick-landing-page","repoPath":"sethdavis512/quick-landing-page","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.735Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"deploy","description":"This skill should be used when the user wants to push code to Railway, says railway up, deploy, deploy to railway, ship, or push. For initial setup or creating services, use new skill. For Docker images, use environment skill.","bodyPreview":"# Deploy\n\nDeploy code from the current directory to Railway using `railway up`.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User asks to \"deploy\", \"ship\", \"push code\"\n- User says \"railway up\" or \"deploy to Railway\"\n- User wants to deploy local code changes\n- User says \"deploy and fix any issues\" (use --ci mode)\n\n## Commit Message\n\nAlways use the `-m` flag with a descriptive commit message summarizing what''s being deployed:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach -m \"Add user authentication endpoint\"\n```\n\nGood commit messages:\n- De","body":"# Deploy\n\nDeploy code from the current directory to Railway using `railway up`.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User asks to \"deploy\", \"ship\", \"push code\"\n- User says \"railway up\" or \"deploy to Railway\"\n- User wants to deploy local code changes\n- User says \"deploy and fix any issues\" (use --ci mode)\n\n## Commit Message\n\nAlways use the `-m` flag with a descriptive commit message summarizing what''s being deployed:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach -m \"Add user authentication endpoint\"\n```\n\nGood commit messages:\n- Describe what changed: \"Fix memory leak in worker process\"\n- Reference tickets/issues: \"Implement feature #123\"\n- Be concise but meaningful: \"Update deps and fix build warnings\"\n\n## Modes\n\n### Detach Mode (default)\nStarts deploy and returns immediately. Use for most deploys.\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\n### CI Mode\nStreams build logs until complete. Use when user wants to watch the build or needs to debug issues.\n\n```bash\nrailway up --ci -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\n**When to use CI mode:**\n- User says \"deploy and watch\", \"deploy and fix issues\"\n- User is debugging build failures\n- User wants to see build output\n\n## Deploy Specific Service\n\nDefault is linked service. To deploy to a different service:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --detach --service backend -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\n## Deploy to Unlinked Project\n\nDeploy to a project without linking first:\n\n```bash\nrailway up --project <project-id> --environment production --detach -m \"Deploy description here\"\n```\n\nRequires both `--project` and `--environment` flags.\n\n## CLI Options\n\n| Flag | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `-m, --message <MSG>` | Commit message describing the deploy (always use this) |\n| `-d, --detach` | Don''t attach to logs (default) |\n| `-c, --ci` | Stream build logs, exit when done |\n| `-s, --service <NAME>` | Target service (defaults to linked) |\n| `-e, --environment <NAME>` | Target environment (defaults to linked) |\n| `-p, --project <ID>` | Target project (requires --environment) |\n| `[PATH]` | Path to deploy (defaults to current directory) |\n\n## Directory Linking\n\nRailway CLI walks UP the directory tree to find a linked project. If you''re in a subdirectory of a linked project, you don''t need to relink.\n\nFor subdirectory deployments, prefer setting `rootDirectory` via the environment skill, then deploy normally with `railway up`.\n\n## After Deploy\n\n### Detach mode\n```\nDeploying to <service>...\n```\nUse `deployment` skill to check build status (with `--lines` flag).\n\n### CI mode\nBuild logs stream inline. If build fails, the error will be in the output.\n\n**Do NOT run `railway logs --build` after CI mode** - the logs already streamed. If you need\nmore context, use `deployment` skill with `--lines` flag (never stream).\n\n## Composability\n\n- **Check status after deploy**: Use `service` skill\n- **View logs**: Use `deployment` skill\n- **Fix config issues**: Use `environment` skill\n- **Redeploy after config fix**: Use `environment` skill\n\n## Error Handling\n\n### No Project Linked\n```\nNo Railway project linked. Run `railway link` first.\n```\n\n### No Service Linked\n```\nNo service linked. Use --service flag or run `railway service` to select one.\n```\n\n### Build Failure (CI mode)\nThe build logs already streamed - analyze them directly from the `railway up --ci` output.\nDo NOT run `railway logs` after CI mode (it streams forever without `--lines`).\n\nCommon issues:\n- Missing dependencies → check package.json/requirements.txt\n- Build command wrong → use environment skill to fix\n- Dockerfile issues → check dockerfile path\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:03:04.733Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing streamlined monorepo deployment to Railway","zh":"适用于需要将完整堆栈代理部署到 Railway 的简化 monorepo 部署","ja":"Railway へのモノレポデプロイをストリームライン化する必要があるフルスタックエージェントに最適","ko":"Railway에 대한 스트림 라인화 된 모노레포 배포가 필요한 풀 스택 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Full Stack que necesitan una implementación de monorepo simplificada en Railway","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin d''un déploiement de monorepo simplifié sur Railway","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die eine vereinfachte Monorepo-Bereitstellung auf Railway benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que necessitam de implantação de monorepo simplificada no Railway","ru":"Идеально для Full Stack агентов, требующих упрощенного развертывания monorepo на Railway","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الكاملون الذين يحتاجون إلى نشر monorepo مبسط إلى Railway"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deploy code from the current directory to Railway using `railway up`, handling local code changes and commit messages with ease, leveraging Turborepo monorepo and Postgres integration","zh":"赋予代理从当前目录部署代码到 Railway 的能力，使用 `railway up` 命令，轻松处理本地代码更改和提交消息，利用 Turborepo monorepo 和 Postgres 集成","ja":"エージェントが `railway up` を使用して現在のディレクトリから Railway にコードをデプロイできるようにし、ローカルのコード変更とコミットメッセージを簡単に処理する、Turborepo モノレポと Postgres 統合を利用","ko":"에이전트가 `railway up`을 사용하여 현재 디렉토리에서 Railway로 코드를 배포할 수 있도록 하며, 로컬 코드 변경 및 커밋 메시지를 쉽게 처리하며, Turborepo 모노레포 및 Postgres 통합을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar código desde el directorio actual en Railway utilizando `railway up`, manejando cambios de código local y mensajes de confirmación con facilidad, aprovechando la integración de Turborepo monorepo y Postgres","fr":"Permet aux agents de déployer du code à partir du répertoire actuel sur Railway en utilisant `railway up`, gérant les modifications de code local et les messages de validation avec facilité, en exploitant l''intégration de Turborepo monorepo et Postgres","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Code aus dem aktuellen Verzeichnis auf Railway mit `railway up` zu bereitstellen, dabei lokale Codeänderungen und Commit-Nachrichten mühelos handhabend und die Integration von Turborepo-Monorepo und Postgres nutzend","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implantar código do diretório atual para o Railway usando `railway up`, lidando com alterações de código local e mensagens de commit com facilidade, aproveitando a integração do Turborepo monorepo e do Postgres","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью развертывать код из текущего каталога на Railway с помощью `railway up`, обрабатывая местные изменения кода и сообщения коммитов с легкостью, используя интеграцию Turborepo monorepo и Postgres","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على نشر الكود من الدليل الحالي إلى Railway باستخدام `railway up` ، معالجة التغييرات المحلية في الكود ورسائل الالتزام بسهولة ، مستفيدا من دمج Turborepo monorepo و Postgres"},"useCases":{"en":["Deploying Astro landing pages with Hono signup API","Pushing code changes to Railway with descriptive commit messages","Fixing deployment issues using --ci mode"],"zh":["使用 Hono_signup API 部署 Astro 登陆页面","使用描述性的提交消息将代码更改推送到 Railway","使用 --ci 模式解决部署问题"],"ja":["Hono サインアップ API を使用して Astro ランディング ページをデプロイ","記述的なコミット メッセージを使用してコード変更を Railway にプッシュ"," --ci モードを使用してデプロイの問題を修正"],"ko":["Hono 회원가입 API를 사용하여 Astro 랜딩 페이지 배포","설명적인 커밋 메시지를 사용하여 코드 변경을 Railway에 푸시","--ci 모드를 사용하여 배포 문제 해결"],"es":["Implementación de páginas de aterrizaje de Astro con API de inicio de sesión de Hono","Envío de cambios de código a Railway con mensajes de confirmación descriptivos","Solución de problemas de implementación utilizando el modo --ci"],"fr":["Déploiement de pages d''atterrissage Astro avec API d''inscription Hono","Envoi de modifications de code à Railway avec des messages de validation descriptifs","Résolution de problèmes de déploiement en utilisant le mode --ci"],"de":["Bereitstellung von Astro-Landingpages mit Hono-Registrierungs-API","Übertragung von Codeänderungen auf Railway mit beschreibenden Commit-Nachrichten","Behebung von Bereitstellungsproblemen unter Verwendung des --ci-Modus"],"pt":["Implantando páginas de destino Astro com API de inscrição Hono","Empurrando alterações de código para o Railway com mensagens de commit descritivas","Corrigindo problemas de implantação usando o modo --ci"],"ru":["Развертывание страниц посадки Astro с API регистрации Hono","Отправка изменений кода на Railway с описательными сообщениями коммита","Исправление проблем развертывания с помощью режима --ci"],"ar":["نشر صفحات الهبوط Astro مع API الاشتراك Hono","دفع التغييرات في الكود إلى Railway مع رسائل الالتزام الواضحة","إصلاح مشاكل النشر باستخدام وضع --ci"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Railway account and configuration","Limited to Turborepo monorepo and Postgres integration","Dependent on `railway up` command-line tool"],"zh":["需要 Railway 账户和配置","仅限 Turborepo monorepo 和 Postgres 集成","依赖于 `railway up` 命令行工具"],"ja":["Railway アカウントと設定が必要","Turborepo モノレポと Postgres 統合に限定"," `railway up` コマンドラインツールに依存"],"ko":["Railway 계정 및 구성이 필요","Turborepo 모노레포 및 Postgres 통합에 한정","`railway up` 명령줄 도구에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta y configuración de Railway","Limitado a la integración de Turborepo monorepo y Postgres","Dependiente de la herramienta de línea de comandos `railway up`"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte et une configuration Railway","Limité à l''intégration de Turborepo monorepo et Postgres","Dépend de l''outil de ligne de commande `railway up`"],"de":["Benötigt ein Railway-Konto und eine Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf die Integration von Turborepo-Monorepo und Postgres","Abhängig von der Befehlszeilen-Tool `railway up`"],"pt":["Exige conta e configuração do Railway","Limitado à integração do Turborepo monorepo e do Postgres","Dependente da ferramenta de linha de comando `railway up`"],"ru":["Требует учетной записи и настройки Railway","Ограничен интеграцией Turborepo monorepo и Postgres","Зависит от инструмента командной строки `railway up`"],"ar":["يتطلب حساب وضبط Railway","محدود بدمج Turborepo monorepo و Postgres","يعتمد على أداة سطر الأوامر `railway up`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8f76d1c79c47ec542bf17ac0ce554b560930e25f673f2ed74c7ed02a8619671f","qualityScore":46}');
