 avec des pipelines de développement"],"de":["Gruppierung von Tailwind zur Compile-Zeit","Linting von Tailwind für eine bessere Codequalität","Verbesserung der Effizienz der Webentwicklung","Kompatibilität mit beliebten Webentwicklungstools","Einfache Integration in Entwicklungspipelines"],"pt":["Compilacao de tempo de execucao do Tailwind","Linting do Tailwind","Otimizacao de codigo","Integracao com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Suporte a desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Компиляция во время выполнения Tailwind","Линтинг Tailwind","Оптимизация кода","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Поддержка разработчиков"],"ar":["تجميع وقت التشغيل من Tailwind","التحقق من Tailwind","تحسين الكود","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","دعم المطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["tx-styling","AI智能工具","compile-time Tailwind分组","linting","代码质量","开发效率","如何使用tx-styling","tx-styling安装","tx-styling设置指南"],"ja":["tx-styling","AIエージェント","コンパイル時Tailwindグループ化","linting","コード品質","開発効率","tx-stylingの使い方","tx-stylingのインストール","tx-stylingの設定ガイド"],"ko":["tx-styling","AI 에이전트","컴파일 타임 Tailwind 그룹화","린팅","코드 품질","개발 효율성","tx-styling 사용 방법","tx-styling 설치","tx-styling 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrollo web","tx-styling tutorial","cómo usar tx-styling","alternativas a tx-styling","tx-styling vs otros herramientas de AI","instalación de tx-styling","guía de configuración de tx-styling"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour le développement web","tutoriel tx-styling","comment utiliser tx-styling","alternatives à tx-styling","tx-styling vs autres outils d''IA","installation de tx-styling","guide de configuration de tx-styling"],"de":["KI-Tools für die Webentwicklung","tx-styling-Tutorial","wie man tx-styling verwendet","Alternativen zu tx-styling","tx-styling vs andere KI-Tools","Installation von tx-styling","Konfigurationsanleitung für tx-styling"],"pt":["como usar tx-styling","o que é tx-styling","tx-styling alternative","tx-styling vs tailwind","instalar tx-styling","guia de configuracao do tx-styling"],"ru":["как использовать tx-styling","что такое tx-styling","tx-styling альтернатива","tx-styling vs tailwind","установить tx-styling","руководство по настройке tx-styling"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام tx-styling","ما هو tx-styling","بديل tx-styling","tx-styling مقابل tailwind","تثبيت tx-styling","دليل إعداد tx-styling"]}},"owner":"landfolk","repo":"tx","repoPath":"landfolk/tx","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.759Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tx-styling","description":"Guidance for using @landfolk/tx styling (tx prop, grouping syntax, Tailwind transformer, SWC + ESLint plugins) in React/Next.js.","bodyPreview":"# tx styling\n\n## When to use\n- Editing components that use the `tx` prop or `tx` template literals.\n- Integrating `@landfolk/tx` into a React/Next.js app.\n- Debugging grouping, Tailwind extraction, or linting around `tx`.\n\n## Core rules\n- Prefer `tx` over `className` for Tailwind classes.\n- Use arrays for conditional styles; avoid string concatenation.\n- Use grouping syntax like `hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)`.\n- Do not forward `tx` props; only forward `className`.\n- For styleable components, m","body":"# tx styling\n\n## When to use\n- Editing components that use the `tx` prop or `tx` template literals.\n- Integrating `@landfolk/tx` into a React/Next.js app.\n- Debugging grouping, Tailwind extraction, or linting around `tx`.\n\n## Core rules\n- Prefer `tx` over `className` for Tailwind classes.\n- Use arrays for conditional styles; avoid string concatenation.\n- Use grouping syntax like `hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)`.\n- Do not forward `tx` props; only forward `className`.\n- For styleable components, merge `className` into `tx`.\n\n## Tooling overview\n- SWC plugin rewrites `tx` to `className` at compile time.\n- Tailwind transformer expands grouped classes for JIT extraction.\n- ESLint rule sorts and validates classes.\n\n## Grouping syntax\nExample:\n\n```tsx\n<div tx=\"hover:(bg-blue-500 text-white)\" />\n```\n\nCompiles to `className=\"hover:bg-blue-500 hover:text-white\"`.\nGroups can be nested.\n\n## SWC transform\n- `tx=\"...\"` becomes `className=\"...\"`.\n- Arrays like `tx={[cond && tx`...`]}` become joined `className` arrays.\n- Tagged `tx` templates expand at compile time.\n- In dev, class strings can be wrapped with a conflict checker if registered.\n\nRegister the dev-only conflict checker once:\n\n```ts\nimport ''@landfolk/tx/checkConflicts''\n```\n\n## Tailwind transformer\nThe transformer scans `tx` attributes and template literals to expand grouped\nsyntax into full class lists so Tailwind JIT sees every class.\n\n## ESLint rule\n`@landfolk/tx/optimize-tailwind-classes`:\n- Expands grouped syntax and re-compacts in a stable order.\n- Sorts classes using Tailwind''s internal order.\n- Normalizes whitespace in arbitrary values.\n- Can validate class names when given a Tailwind config path.\n\n## Getting started\nSee `getting-started.md` for install, config, and Next.js compatibility.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:15:21.073Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing streamlined Tailwind CSS class management and linting.","zh":"非常适合需要简化Tailwind CSS类管理和linting的前端代理","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがTailwind CSSクラスの管理とlintingを簡素化するために最適","ko":"프론트엔드 에이전트가 Tailwind CSS 클래스 관리 및 linting을 간소화하는 데 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan una gestión y revisión de clases CSS de Tailwind optimizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une gestion et de linting de classes CSS Tailwind rationalisées.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die eine optimierte Verwaltung und Überprüfung von Tailwind-CSS-Klassen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de gerenciamento de classes CSS Tailwind e linting simplificados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходим упрощенный менеджмент классов CSS Tailwind и линтинг.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى إدارة صفوف Tailwind CSS ومعالجة لينت المبسطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently compile and lint Tailwind classes using the `tx` prop and template literals, while enforcing best practices like grouping syntax and conditional styles with arrays, and integrating seamlessly with React and Next.js apps via `@landfolk/tx`.","zh":"赋予代理高效编译和lint Tailwind类的能力，使用`tx`属性和模板字面量，同时强制执行最佳实践，如使用数组分组语法和条件样式，并通过`@landfolk/tx`无缝集成到React和Next.js应用程序中","ja":"エージェントが`tx`プロパティとテンプレートリテラルを使用してTailwindクラスを効率的にコンパイルおよびlintし、グループ化構文や配列による条件スタイルなどのベストプラクティスを強制適用し、`@landfolk/tx`を介してReactおよびNext.jsアプリケーションとシームレスに統合する","ko":"에이전트가 `tx` 속성 및 템플릿 리터럴을 사용하여 Tailwind 클래스를 효율적으로 컴파일하고 lint하는 기능을 제공하며, 배열을 사용한 그룹화 구문 및 조건부 스타일과 같은 모범 사례를 강제 적용하고, `@landfolk/tx`를 통해 React 및 Next.js 애플리케이션과無縫로 통합","es":"Habilita a los agentes a compilar y revisar eficientemente las clases Tailwind utilizando la propiedad `tx` y literales de plantilla, mientras se aplican las mejores prácticas como la sintaxis de agrupación y los estilos condicionales con matrices, e integrándose de forma transparente con aplicaciones React y Next.js a través de `@landfolk/tx`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de compiler et de linter efficacement les classes Tailwind en utilisant la propriété `tx` et les littéraux de modèle, tout en appliquant les meilleures pratiques telles que la syntaxe de regroupement et les styles conditionnels avec des tableaux, et en s''intégrant en toute transparence avec des applications React et Next.js via `@landfolk/tx`.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Tailwind-Klassen effizient zu compilen und zu überprüfen, indem sie die Eigenschaft `tx` und Template-Literale verwenden, während sie bewährte Verfahren wie Gruppierungssyntax und bedingte Stile mit Arrays anwenden und sich nahtlos in React- und Next.js-Apps über `@landfolk/tx` integrieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a compilar e linter classes Tailwind de forma eficiente usando a propriedade `tx` e literais de template, ao mesmo tempo em que impõe as melhores práticas, como sintaxe de agrupamento e estilos condicionais com matrizes, e integra-se perfeitamente com aplicativos React e Next.js por meio de `@landfolk/tx`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно компилировать и линтер классы Tailwind с помощью свойства `tx` и литералов шаблонов, одновременно обеспечивающих соблюдение лучших практик, таких как групповая синтаксис и условные стили с массивами, и обеспечивает бесшовную интеграцию с приложениями React и Next.js через `@landfolk/tx`.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تجميع وفحص الفصول الدراسية Tailwind بفعالية باستخدام خاصية `tx` والأدلة الإلكترونية، مع فرض أفضل الممارسات مثل بناء الجملة المجمعة والأسلوب الشرطي مع المصفوفات، وتكاملها بشكل متجانس مع تطبيقات React و Next.js من خلال `@landfolk/tx`."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging Tailwind extraction issues","Optimizing `tx` prop usage in React components","Enforcing consistent styling conventions across a Next.js application"],"zh":["调试Tailwind提取问题","在React组件中优化`tx`属性的使用","在Next.js应用程序中强制执行一致的样式约定"],"ja":["Tailwind抽出の問題をデバッグする","Reactコンポーネントでの`tx`プロパティの使用を最適化する","Next.jsアプリケーション全体で一貫したスタイル規約を強制する"],"ko":["Tailwind 추출 문제 디버깅","React 컴포넌트에서 `tx` 속성 사용 최적화","Next.js 애플리케이션에서 일관된 스타일 규칙 적용"],"es":["Depuración de problemas de extracción de Tailwind","Optimización del uso de la propiedad `tx` en componentes React","Aplicación de convenciones de estilo coherentes en toda una aplicación Next.js"],"fr":["Débogage des problèmes d''extraction de Tailwind","Optimisation de l''utilisation de la propriété `tx` dans les composants React","Application de conventions de style cohérentes dans toute une application Next.js"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei Tailwind-Extraktionsproblemen","Optimierung der Verwendung der Eigenschaft `tx` in React-Komponenten","Durchsetzung konsistenter Styling-Konventionen in einer gesamten Next.js-Anwendung"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas de extração Tailwind","Otimização do uso da propriedade `tx` em componentes React","Enforcing convenções de formatação consistentes em toda a aplicação Next.js"],"ru":["Дебагging проблем экстракции Tailwind","Оптимизация использования свойства `tx` в компонентах React","Принудительное соблюдение последовательных конвенций форматирования во всем приложении Next.js"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء استخراج Tailwind","تحسين استخدام خاصية `tx` في مكونات React","فرض اتفاقيات تنسيق متسقة في جميع تطبيقات Next.js"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `@landfolk/tx` integration","Specific to Tailwind CSS and React/Next.js ecosystems"],"zh":["需要`@landfolk/tx`集成","特定于Tailwind CSS和React/Next.js生态系统"],"ja":["`@landfolk/tx`の統合が必要","Tailwind CSSおよびReact/Next.jsのエコシステムに特有"],"ko":["`@landfolk/tx` 통합이 필요","Tailwind CSS 및 React/Next.js 생태계에 특정"],"es":["Requiere integración con `@landfolk/tx`","Específico para los ecosistemas Tailwind CSS y React/Next.js"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec `@landfolk/tx`","Spécifique aux écosystèmes Tailwind CSS et React/Next.js"],"de":["Benötigt Integration mit `@landfolk/tx`","Spezifisch für die Ökosysteme Tailwind CSS und React/Next.js"],"pt":["Requer integração com `@landfolk/tx`","Específico para os ecossistemas Tailwind CSS e React/Next.js"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с `@landfolk/tx`","Конкретно для экосистем Tailwind CSS и React/Next.js"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع `@landfolk/tx`","محدد للنظم البيئية Tailwind CSS و React/Next.js"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a70b545a68e73970643865122b4e2b17599fbcb309e0324edbdd9dca1a13e764","qualityScore":46}');
