el usuario","Integración con tecnologías como React y Node.js","Diseño de interfaz de usuario personalizable","Compatibilidad con aplicaciones de escritorio nativas","Optimización del rendimiento de la aplicación"],"fr":["Amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","Intégration avec des technologies comme React et Node.js","Conception d''interface utilisateur personnalisable","Compatibilité avec les applications de bureau natives","Optimisation des performances de l''application"],"de":["Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Integration mit Technologien wie React und Node.js","Benutzeroberflächen-Design anpassbar","Kompatibilität mit nativen Desktop-Anwendungen","Optimierung der Anwendungsleistung"],"pt":["Interface do usuário aprimorada","Experiência de usuário melhorada","Compatibilidade com desktop nativo","Integração com SEQTA e BetterSEQTA+","Desenvolvimento de aplicações de desktop","Otimização de UI para melhor desempenho"],"ru":["Улучшенный интерфейс пользователя","Улучшенный опыт пользователя","Совместимость с родным рабочим столом","Интеграция с SEQTA и BetterSEQTA+","Разработка приложений для рабочего стола","Оптимизация UI для лучшей производительности"],"ar":["واجهة مستخدم محسنة","تجربة مستخدم محسنة","التوافق مع سطح المكتب الأصلي","التكامل مع SEQTA و BetterSEQTA+","تطوير التطبيقات سطح المكتب","تحسين واجهة المستخدم لتحقيق أداء أفضل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用premium-ui-refinement","什么是AI智能工具","premium-ui-refinement替代品","premium-ui-refinement安装","SEQTA网站移植","BetterSEQTA+界面优化"],"ja":["premium-ui-refinementの使い方","AIエージェントとは","premium-ui-refinementの代替","premium-ui-refinementのインストール","SEQTAのウェブサイト移植","BetterSEQTA+インターフェースの最適化"],"ko":["premium-ui-refinement 사용법","AI 에이전트란","premium-ui-refinement 대체","premium-ui-refinement 설치","SEQTA 웹사이트 이식","BetterSEQTA+ 인터페이스 최적화"],"es":["herramientas de AI","refinamiento de la interfaz de usuario","react","node.js","aplicaciones de escritorio nativas","mejora de la experiencia del usuario","diseño de interfaz de usuario","compatibilidad con aplicaciones de escritorio","optimización del rendimiento de la aplicación"],"fr":["outils d''IA","raffinement de l''interface utilisateur","react","node.js","applications de bureau natives","amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","conception d''interface utilisateur","compatibilité avec les applications de bureau","optimisation des performances de l''application"],"de":["KI-Tools","Verfeinerung der Benutzeroberfläche","react","node.js","native Desktop-Anwendungen","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Benutzeroberflächen-Design","Kompatibilität mit nativen Desktop-Anwendungen","Optimierung der Anwendungsleistung"],"pt":["como usar premium-ui-refinement","o que é premium-ui-refinement","premium-ui-refinement alternative","premium-ui-refinement vs outros","instalar premium-ui-refinement","guia de setup premium-ui-refinement","desenvolvimento de aplicações de desktop","otimização de UI"],"ru":["как использовать премиум-ui-рефайнмент","что такое премиум-ui-рефайнмент","премиум-ui-рефайнмент альтернатива","премиум-ui-рефайнмент vs другие","установить премиум-ui-рефайнмент","руководство по настройке премиум-ui-рефайнмент","разработка приложений для рабочего стола","оптимизация UI"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام premium-ui-refinement","ما هو premium-ui-refinement","premium-ui-refinement بديل","premium-ui-refinement مقابل غيره","تثبيت premium-ui-refinement","دليل إعداد premium-ui-refinement","تطوير التطبيقات سطح المكتب","تحسين واجهة المستخدم"]}},"owner":"BetterSEQTA","repo":"DesQTA","repoPath":"BetterSEQTA/DesQTA","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.824Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"premium-ui-refinement","description":"Apply premium animation and UI refinement patterns to create polished, refined user experiences. Use when working on animations, transitions, UI polish, or when the user asks about making elements feel more premium or refined.","bodyPreview":"# Premium UI Refinement\n\nApply proven animation and visual design patterns to create a premium, refined user experience throughout DesQTA.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Easing Functions\n\n**Never use linear easing.** Always use:\n\n- `cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)` (Material Design standard)\n- `cubicInOut` from `svelte/easing` for Svelte transitions\n\n### 2. Duration Hierarchy\n\nMatch duration to element complexity:\n\n- **150-200ms**: Simple UI (buttons, dropdowns, tooltips)\n- **300ms**: Moderate changes","body":"# Premium UI Refinement\n\nApply proven animation and visual design patterns to create a premium, refined user experience throughout DesQTA.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n### 1. Easing Functions\n\n**Never use linear easing.** Always use:\n\n- `cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)` (Material Design standard)\n- `cubicInOut` from `svelte/easing` for Svelte transitions\n\n### 2. Duration Hierarchy\n\nMatch duration to element complexity:\n\n- **150-200ms**: Simple UI (buttons, dropdowns, tooltips)\n- **300ms**: Moderate changes (sidebars, modals, panels)\n- **400-500ms**: Complex content (page sections, data tables)\n- **500-1000ms**: Data visualizations (charts, graphs)\n\n### 3. Multi-Property Animations\n\nCombine multiple properties for richer feel:\n\n- Opacity + transform (scale/translate)\n- Width + opacity\n- Position + scale\n- Never animate just one property\n\n### 4. Transform Origin\n\nSet `transform-origin` to logical anchor points:\n\n- Text elements: `left center` (matches reading flow)\n- Buttons: `center center` (default)\n- Dropdowns: anchor to trigger element\n\n### 5. Stagger Sequential Elements\n\nUse delays for related elements:\n\n- First element: 0ms\n- Second: 100ms delay\n- Third: 200ms delay\n- Creates visual hierarchy\n\n### 6. Visual Effects Layering\n\nCombine effects for depth:\n\n- `backdrop-blur-md` for glassmorphism\n- `shadow-2xl` for elevation\n- Semi-transparent backgrounds (`bg-white/95`)\n- Multiple effects work together\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Premium Fade-In\n\n```svelte\n<div transition:fade={{ duration: 200 }}>\n  <!-- Content -->\n</div>\n```\n\n### Scale + Fade Animation\n\n```svelte\n<div\n  class=\"transition-all duration-200\"\n  style=\"animation: fadeInScale 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\">\n  <!-- Content -->\n</div>\n```\n\nCSS:\n\n```css\n@keyframes fadeInScale {\n  0% {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: scale(0.95);\n  }\n  100% {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: scale(1);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Premium Dropdown\n\n```svelte\n<div\n  transition:fly={{ y: -8, duration: 200, opacity: 0 }}\n  class=\"backdrop-blur-md shadow-2xl bg-white/95 dark:bg-zinc-900/90\">\n  <!-- Dropdown content -->\n</div>\n```\n\n### Staggered Sequential Loading\n\n```svelte\n<div in:fade={{ duration: 400 }}>Filters</div>\n<div in:fade={{ duration: 400, delay: 100 }}>Charts</div>\n<div in:fade={{ duration: 400, delay: 200 }}>Table</div>\n```\n\n### Chart Animations\n\n```javascript\n// Bar chart - animate from bottom\nmotion: {\n  x: { type: \"tween\", duration: 500, easing: cubicInOut },\n  y: { type: \"tween\", duration: 500, easing: cubicInOut },\n  height: { type: \"tween\", duration: 500, easing: cubicInOut },\n  width: { type: \"tween\", duration: 500, easing: cubicInOut },\n}\n\n// Area chart - clip-path reveal\nmotion={{\n  width: { type: \"tween\", duration: 1000, easing: cubicInOut }\n}}\n```\n\n### Sidebar/Major UI Transitions\n\n```svelte\n<aside\n  class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out overflow-hidden\"\n  class:w-full={open}\n  class:w-0={!open}\n  class:opacity-0={!open}\n  class:opacity-100={open}\n  class:pointer-events-none={!open}\n  class:pointer-events-auto={open}>\n```\n\n## Implementation Checklist\n\nWhen adding or refining animations:\n\n- [ ] Easing function is not linear (use `cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)` or `cubicInOut`)\n- [ ] Duration matches element complexity (200ms simple, 300ms moderate, 400-500ms complex)\n- [ ] Multiple properties animated (opacity + transform, width + opacity, etc.)\n- [ ] Transform origin set appropriately for scaling/rotating\n- [ ] Sequential elements staggered with delays (100ms, 200ms)\n- [ ] Visual effects layered (blur, shadow, transparency)\n- [ ] Pointer events managed during transitions\n- [ ] Overflow handled correctly (`overflow-hidden` when needed)\n- [ ] Responsive behavior considered (mobile vs desktop)\n- [ ] Consistent with existing patterns in codebase\n\n## Examples from Codebase\n\n**Editor headings:** `src/components/Editor/EditorStyles.css` (fadeInScale animation)\n**User dropdown:** `src/lib/components/UserDropdown.svelte` (fly transition with blur)\n**Analytics charts:** `src/lib/components/analytics/` (staggered loading, chart animations)\n**Sidebar:** `src/lib/components/AppSidebar.svelte` (multi-property transitions)\n\n## Additional Resources\n\nFor detailed analysis of premium animation patterns, see [docs/development/premium-animations-analysis.md](../../docs/development/premium-animations-analysis.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:40:56.444Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced UI animation and design capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级 UI 动画和设计能力的前端代理。","ja":"フロントエンド エージェントが高度な UI アニメーションとデザイン機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 UI 애니메이션 및 디자인 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de animación y diseño de interfaz de usuario.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités avancées d''animation et de conception d''interface utilisateur.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Benutzeroberflächen-Animations- und Designfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de capacidades avançadas de animação e design de UI.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым требуются продвинутые возможности анимации и проектирования UI.","ar":"مميز للوكلاء الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة للرسوم المتحركة وتصميم الواجهة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create premium user experiences using proven animation patterns, such as cubic-bezier easing functions and duration hierarchies, with libraries like Svelte for seamless transitions.","zh":"通过使用 cubic-bezier 缓动函数和持续时间等级等成熟的动画模式，结合像 Svelte 这样的库实现无缝过渡，赋予代理创建高级用户体验的能力。","ja":"cubic-bezier イージング関数や時間階層などの確立されたアニメーションパターンを使用し、Svelte などのライブラリを使用してシームレスな遷移を実現し、高品質のユーザーエクスペリエンスを作成するエージェントの能力を付与します。","ko":"cubic-bezier 이징 함수 및 지속 시간 계층과 같은 검증된 애니메이션 패턴을 사용하고 Svelte와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여 무缝 전환을实现하여 고급 사용자 경험을 만들 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear experiencias de usuario de alta gama utilizando patrones de animación probados, como funciones de suavizado cubic-bezier y jerarquías de duración, con bibliotecas como Svelte para transiciones sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des expériences utilisateur de haute qualité en utilisant des modèles d''animation éprouvés, tels que des fonctions de suavisation cubic-bezier et des hiérarchies de durée, avec des bibliothèques comme Svelte pour des transitions en douceur.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Premium-Benutzererfahrungen mit bewährten Animationsmustern wie cubic-bezier-Easing-Funktionen und Dauerkategorien zu erstellen, mit Bibliotheken wie Svelte für nahtlose Übergänge.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar experiências de usuário premium usando padrões de animação comprovados, como funções de easing cubic-bezier e hierarquias de duração, com bibliotecas como Svelte para transições sem interrupção.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать премиум-пользовательские trải nghiệm с помощью проверенных анимационных шаблонов, таких как функции cubic-bezier easing и иерархии продолжительности, с использованием библиотек, таких как Svelte для бесшовных переходов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء تجارب مستخدم متقدمة باستخدام أنماط الرسوم المتحركة المثبتة، مثل وظائف التخفيف cubic-bezier والتراكيب الهرمية للمدة، مع مكتبات مثل Svelte للانتقالات السلسة"},"useCases":{"en":["Refining UI interactions with cubic-bezier easing","Implementing duration hierarchies for consistent animations","Enhancing user experience with Material Design standard animations"],"zh":["使用 cubic-bezier 缓动函数来完善 UI 交互","实现持续时间等级以获得一致的动画","使用 Material Design 标准动画来增强用户体验"],"ja":["cubic-bezier イージング関数を使用して UI インタラクションを洗練する","時間階層を実装して一貫したアニメーションを実現する","Material Design 標準のアニメーションを使用してユーザーエクスペリエンスを向上させる"],"ko":["cubic-bezier 이징 함수를 사용하여 UI 상호작용을 개선하다","지속 시간 계층을 구현하여 일관된 애니메이션을实现하다","Material Design 표준 애니메이션을 사용하여 사용자 경험을 향상시키다"],"es":["Perfeccionar las interacciones de la interfaz de usuario con suavizado cubic-bezier","Implementar jerarquías de duración para animaciones coherentes","Mejorar la experiencia del usuario con animaciones estándar de Material Design"],"fr":["Affiner les interactions de l''interface utilisateur avec le suavisation cubic-bezier","Mettre en œuvre des hiérarchies de durée pour des animations cohérentes","Améliorer l''expérience utilisateur avec des animations standard de Material Design"],"de":["Verfeinern von Benutzeroberflächen-Interaktionen mit cubic-bezier-Easing","Implementieren von Dauerkategorien für konsistente Animationen","Verbessern der Benutzererfahrung mit Standard-Animationsmustern von Material Design"],"pt":["Aprimorar interações de UI com easing cubic-bezier","Implementar hierarquias de duração para animações consistentes","Melhorar a experiência do usuário com animações padrão do Material Design"],"ru":["Уточнение взаимодействий UI с помощью easing cubic-bezier","Реализация иерархий продолжительности для последовательных анимаций","Улучшение пользовательского опыта с помощью стандартных анимаций Material Design"],"ar":["تحسين التفاعلات الأمامية مع تخفيف cubic-bezier","تنفيذ هرميات المدة لرسوم متحركة متسقة","تحسين تجربة المستخدم مع الرسوم المتحركة القياسية لتصميم المواد"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Svelte or similar frontend framework","Limited to native desktop applications"],"zh":["需要 Svelte 或类似的前端框架","仅限于本机桌面应用程序"],"ja":["Svelte または同等のフロントエンド フレームワークが必要","ネイティブ デスクトップ アプリケーションにのみ限定"],"ko":["Svelte 또는 유사한 프론트엔드 프레임워크가 필요","네이티브 데스크톱 응용 프로그램에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere Svelte o un framework de frontend similar","Limitado a aplicaciones de escritorio nativas"],"fr":["Nécessite Svelte ou un framework de frontend similaire","Limité aux applications de bureau natives"],"de":["Benötigt Svelte oder ein ähnliches Frontend-Framework","Begrenzt auf native Desktop-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Exige Svelte ou framework de frontend semelhante","Limitado a aplicações de área de trabalho nativas"],"ru":["Требует Svelte или аналогичного фронтенд-фреймворка","Ограничен до родных настольных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب Svelte أو إطار عمل واجهة أمامية مشابه","محدود للتطبيقات الأساسية لملء الشاشة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"32932b277f87a7eaab9b0d0f50207e59c1297b35d2336d3cf4d829442a87cf89","qualityScore":46}');
